<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Ndonde Hamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Hikubho ya Akaandundame</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hikubho ya Akaandundame</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hikubho</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hiku</para>
  <para style="mt2">Hikubho ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akaandundame</para>
  <para style="imt">Nnongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chenjeni cha Hikubho chikongolela namuna lilubhalo lya bhandu lilyahobhalela Akilisito chibhakajemekanga ku Yelusalemu na kujenela ku Uyahudi na ku Samalia mpaka ku hilambo ya kutali, handa malagilo ga Ayesu Kilisito kwa bhabhachijigana bhabhe tangu kujaula kwaachabhe kunani kwa Annoongo Hikubho 1:8. Chitabu heche chikajaandikwa na Aluka na nga jwaakajandika chitabu cha Ngani Jammbone handa chiikajandikwa na Aluka. Jonojwe akibha ang'anga, na jonojwe atendita kulolekea muno abhi kulolekea kujandika melobhe gayene. Jwaakajandikilwa hitabu heye ya hibhele yaani Injili na chitabu cha Hikubho akibha Agiliki jumo jwakemitwa Ateofilo. Nambo komboleka hitabu heye hikajandikwa kwa bhandu bhoa bhabhakahobhalela Akilisito, bhabhakibhanga Bhagiliki na Bhayahudi 1.1.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na komboleka chitabu cha Hikubho chikajandikwa mu yaaka ya 60 hadi 64 baada ja kubhelekwa Ayesu Kilisito, ligongo chitabu chitendakujomoka tangu Apaulo jwangajogolekwa kubhoka mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. Kabhele Aluka akibha mu ulendo pamo na andundame Apaulo, na komboleka akachijandika chitabu heche akibha mu chilambo cha ku Antiokia. Chitabu cha Hikubho nga nnyendelelo gwa chitabu cha Ngani Jammbone ja Aluka, chijemeka kukongolela kuhomba kwa Ayesu kujaula kunani kwa Annoongo. Aluka akajandika chitabu heche komboleka kubhee lyela lyela libhakibhanalyo, atendita kujandika Ngani Jammbone jabhe. Akapala Ateofilo, na bhandu bhabhakibhanga Akaakilisito bhatendita kujonjokekanga ili bhakombolange kumanya maha chenichela chibhatendita kujiganangwa, na henela akajandika ngani ja kweli ja umomi gwa Ayesu na kujonjokeka kwa bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha hikubho chitendakutulangia twenga kulandanakia kwa lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito palikajema, na namuna bhandu chibhatamitinge mu kuhobhalela kwa Ayesu. Kulandanikia kwa akaandundame hitendakutulangia twenga namuna ja kuhobhalela machili ga Mboomo ja Annoongo mu kujenela malobhe ga Ngani Jammbone kwa bhangi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabhile nkati.</para>
  <para style="io">Mboomo ja Annoongo jitendakwajangatila bhabhachijigana na lilubhalo lya bhandu lilyahobhalela Akilisito likajemaka kukola na kujonjokeka, mu nniango gwa 1:1-8:1.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhele lilubhalo lya bhandu lilyahobhalela Akilisito lipeta mu chipindi cha kulaga na hibhini, na lilubhalo lya bhandu lilyahobhalela Akilisito litendakujenela mpaka nnyenje ja mipaka ja ku Yelusalemu, mu nniango gwa 8:2-12:23.</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo pabhakajomola genago akajemeka ulendo gwabhe gwa kutangacha Ngani Jammbone, mu nniango gwa 12:24-14:28.</para>
  <para style="io">Ngapena chikomiti pachikakongana ku Yelusalemu kuamua nga hikubho niki yammbone hiipalikwa kwa bhandu bhabhahobhalile bhayono, mu nniango gwa 15:1-35. Ngapena</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo akajaula ulendo gwabhe gwa bhele gwa kutangacha Ngani Jammbone, mu nniango 15:36-18:22.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pabhakabhoka penapo akajaula ulendo gwabhe gwa tatu gwa kutangacha Ngani Jammbone mu nniango gwa 18:23-20:38 Ngapena</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo akamulikwa abhi ku Yelusalemu, mu nniango gwa 21-26</para>
  <para style="io">Kupela kwa yoa Apaulo apelekwa ku Loma, mu nniango gwa 27:28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Akolo Ateofilo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Mu chitabu changu chinakalongolela kujandika, nakajandika hikubho nnani ja Ayesu, gabhatendite na kujigana kubhokela kandahi mwa lihengo lyabhe, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mpaka lichobha lyela pabhakatolekwa kujaula kunani kwa Annoongo, paakapekeanga malagilo kwa kupetela Mboomo ja Annoongo bhenibhala akaandundame bhabhakaagula. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Pagakapeta machobha makomi ncheche kubhokela kujomoka kwabhe bhakaabhokelanga bhabhachijigana bhabhe mala jijingi na kuchilangia yakubhehe akibha jwamomi. Bhakaabhona, na jonojwe akalongelanabho ngani ja Ukolo gwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Pabhakakongana pamo nabho bhakaakulumikianga kubhee, “Nkotokubhokanga pa Yelusalemu, nambo nnendange jenijela ngwaupa jibhakanhaidi Atati, yakubhehe nkajoanga mikulongela ngani jabhe. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Ayohana akabaticha bhandu kwa machi, nambo pagapakupeta machobha kachoko, mwangota mpakubatichwanga kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakutolekwa kujaula kunani kwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Amaluko 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Aluka 24:50-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Bahi, akaandundame pabhakakongana pamo na Ayesu, bhakaakonya, “Hangwana, bholi, wakati hogogo nga pampakubhujia gonigola umwenye kwa Bhaisilaeli?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Nambo Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Atati jika jabhwe nga bhahimanya hikubho heyo hipakupetela machobha ba hipindi hipakupitila lii. Machobha na hipindi ya hikubho heyo hibhi pahi ja ukolo gwa Atati bhangu. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Nambo Mboomo ja Annoongo chibhapakuntulukilanga mwaangota, mpakupokelanga machili na mpakubhee bhabhalongela ngani jangu mu Yelusalemu, mu hilambo yoha ya ku Yudea na ku Samalia, na hata kupela kwa chilambo.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Pabhakajomola kulongela genago, akatolekwa kujaula kunani kwa Annoongo bhenaangota bhabhi tangu bhatendakulolanga, lihunde likaawekela bhakotokokwabhona kabhele.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Pabhakibhanga tangu bhabhikulolekeanga muno kunani kwa Annoongo, Ayesu abhikujaula, kachoko akanalome bhabhele bhawalitinge ngobho hihuhu bhakajemanga kubhandikana nabho, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />bhakalobholanga, “Mwangota mwabhandu bha ku Galilaya! Mbona ntenda kujemanga mmikulolanga kunani? Ayesu habhabha yakubhehe bhatekutolekwa kubhoka kwachinunji kujenda kunani kwa Annoongo apakuhika hela hela handa chimunnonitinge abhikujaula kunani kwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amatia atekuhagulikwa akamule mahali pa Ayuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Amatayo 27:3-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Ngapena akaandundame bhenibhala bhakabhujanga ku Yelusalemu kubhoka lyanilela litombi libhakemita Litombi lya Mizeituni gugukabhee kilomita jimo kubhoka mu chilambo hecho. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Pabhakaikanga kunnyini bhakajingilanga mu chumba kugolopa kubhatendita kutamanga. Bhenaangota bhakibhanga Apetulo, Ayohana, Ayakobo, Aandulea, Afilipo na Atomaso, Abatolomayo na Amatayo, Ayakobo amwana bha Aalufayo, Asimoni jwaapotanila chilambo chabhe na Ayuda amwana bha Ayakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Habha bhoha bhakapundanga kondekananga pamo na kujopa, pakati jabhenji akibha Amalia anyongolo bhabhe Ayesu, na anung'una bhabhe Ayesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mu machobha genago chibhoga cha bhandu chichahobhalela Ayesu, bhabhakakondekananga bhakibhanga handa bhandu makomi na gabhele. Apetulo ajakema pakati jabhenji na kulobhola, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Akanung'una bhangu, ikapalikwa Majaandiko ga Annoongo gakwele, chehemu yakubhehe Mboomo ja Annoongo, kwa malobhe ga Adaudi, akalondola ngani ja Ayuda yakubhe bhakaatandaanga bhenibhala bhabhakaakamula Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Ayuda akibha jumo jwa chibhoga chitu, kwakubhee akaagulikwa na Ayesu atende lihengo litu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Ayuda akaemela nng'oonda kwa yeniyela mbiya hiibhakapata kubhoka kwa chikubho chabhe chibou, akagwehe monomwe, akapapuka na lutumbo lwabhe lukapita panja. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Kila mundu mu Yelusalemu akajoa ngani ja chikubho hecho na henela, kwa chilongelo chabhenji, bhakemanga gonigola nng'oonda, “Akel Dama,” Mana gakwe, “Nng'oonda gwa miyahi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />“Bahi, ikajandikwa mu chitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Kwaachabhe kuigalile mahundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">mundu johajola akotokutama nkati jakwe.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Hela hela hijaandikwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">Mundu joongi atole lihengo libhatendita kupangana.’”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Bahi, mundu jumo pakati ja bhenibhala jwaatendita kutama pamo na twenga muda gwoha Hangwana Ayesu pabhakibha mu ulendo pamo na twenga bahi ahagulikwe kuchilondanika na twenga mu lihengo, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />kubhoka Ayohana pabhakaabaticha Ayesu mpaka lichobha lyela Ayesu pabhakapetulikwa kubhoka kwaachitu kujaula kunani kwa Annoongo. Mundu Jonojwe apakubhee pamo na twenga mu lihengo lya kulola kuyoka kwa Ayesu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Pena, bhakahagulanga mahina ga bhandu bhabhele, jwaakejemeka Ayusufu jwakemitwa Abalisaba hela hela akakemwa Ayusito, na jwa bhele Amatia. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Ngapena bhakaajoapa Annoongo, “Hangwana, mwenga ntendakujimanya mitima ja bhandu bhoha. Henela, ntulaangie nga jwaapi pakati ja habhabha bhabhele jumuhagwile, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />kupala apetule lihengo lya alondoi libhalekite Ayuda kujenda mahali pakwe pajikajabhe mwene.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Bhakatendanga gudugudu, na gudugudu jikagwela Amatia, na jonojwe akajonjokekwa pakati ja bhenibhala akaandundane bhangi komi na jumo.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Palikaika lichobha likolongwa lya Pentekosite, bhabhakahobhalela Ayesu bhakakondekananga pamo. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ng'ang'anu, lilobhe likajohanika kubhoka kunani, lilobhe lilikibha handa chimboonga, chikatwelea mu jenijela nyuumba joha mubhakibhanga bhatamitinge. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Ngapena, hikabhonekana hilebhe handa ndetelehi ya mooto, hikametunika na kutola nnani ja kila jumo jwabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Bhoha bhakatandahikwangwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo, bhakajemekanga kulongela hilongelo yangali yabhenji handa Mboomo ja Annoongo chibhakaakomboleanga bhalongelange.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Konokwe ku Yelusalemu bhakibhanga Bhayuhudi, bhandu bhabhaobhalela Annoongo, bhabhabhokitinge mu kila chilambo pachilambo. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Pabhaakajohanga lilobhe helyo, libhoga likolongwa lya bhandu lilikakondekana pamo. Bhoha bhakang'ang'anukanga muno kwakubhee kila jumo jwaabhenji akaajoanga chilongelo chabhe chibhikulongelwa na bhenibhala bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Bhakakangachanga na kuhechukanga, “Bholi, habha bhoha tutendanga kwajohanga bhabhikolongelanga henela, ngabha bhandu bha ku Galilaya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Hibhibholi bahi, yakubhehe kila jumo jwitu atendakujoa bhabhikulongela cha ku kaaja? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Pakati jitu bhabhokitinge ku Filisiti, ku Amedi na ku Elamu, bhangi bha ku Mesopatamia, ku Yudea, ku Kapadokia, ku Pontio na ku Asia. <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Bhangi bhabhokelanga ku Fulugia na ku Pamufulia, ku Misili na chehemu ja ku Libya kubhandikila na ku Kilene, bhangi bhitu nga akaageni kubhokela ku Loma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Bhayahudi na bhandu bhabhajingilinge mu dini ja Chiyahudi, bhangi bhakabhokelanga ku Kilete chilambo chichindilwe na machi na ku Alabia. Twenga twabhoha tutenga kujoha bhabhikulongelanga hikubho hikolongwa hibhatendita Annoongo kwa chilongelo chitu twaabhene.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Bhandu bhoha bhakakangachanga na kuhechukanga kongo bhabhikonyananga, “Heje maana jakwe niki?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Nambo bhangi bhakaatendelanga mbenje bhakalobholanga, “Habha bhandu bhatekolwelanga!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apetulo atendakwajigana bhandu Ngani Jammbone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ngapena Apetulo akajema ja bhenibhala akandundame komi na jumo akaajemeka kwajigananga bhandu kwa lilobhe likolongwa, “Mwakaanung'una bhangu Bhayahudi mwangota bhoha bhantamanga pambani pa Yelusalemu, nnyohanikiange maha malobhe gangu. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Bhandu habha bhangakolwelanga handa chinng'anikianga, mboni nangocheni nga chaa tatu ja kundabhi? <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Nambo hele nga lilobhe libhakalobhola Ayoeli alondohi jwa Annoongo,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Hangwana alongela, mu machobha genigala ga kupela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">mbakwaletelanga bhandu bhoha Mboomo jwaangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Bhana bhinunji akanalome na hakaikege bhapakubhoanga ulondohi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Na akanangwendu bhinunji bhapakulolanga hagamii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">na hihokolo hinunji bhapakuhagamilanga hagamihi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Kweli, bhatumichi bhangu akanalome na hakaikege,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">mbakwaletelanga Mboomo jwangu machobha genigala, nabhena bhapakubhoanga ulondoi.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Mbakutenda yakangachika nnani kwa Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">na hilolelo pahi pachilambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">kupakubhehe na miyai, mooto na lyohi lyakutopa,<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />lyobha lipakulekelwa lubhendu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">lwehi gupakubhehe nkele handa miyai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">tangu ja kubhokela lyenile lichobha likolongwa na ung'anyimo gwa Hangwana.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Penapo, joajola jwapakujopa kupetela lihina lya Hangwana, apakuokolewa.’”<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Bhandu bha ku Isilaeli, nnyoanikiange malobhe gangani! Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti akibha mundu yakubhehe mamulaka gabhe ga chinnoongo gakalangikwa kwinunji kwa kutenda yakangachika, hikangachiko na hilolelo Annoongo hibhakatenda pakati jinunji kwa ndela jabhe, handa chimmanyanga. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Kulongana na ndela jabhe Annoongo bhene akakulumikia kubhee mwangota mwakamule Ayesu na mwangota nkankoma na kunkamua kwa bhandu bhangali mmbone bhaabhambe panchalaba. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Nambo Annoongo akaayoha, akahokoa kubhoka mu hibhini ya malilo kwakubhee hikakombolikehopo malilo gaatabhe. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Adaudi akalobhola nnani jabhe kubhee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Nakaabhona Hangwana nnoongi jangu machobha goha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">kubhee jonojwe akabhandikana na nenga hata ngapukunyika.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Henela, ntima gwangu gukahachuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">kabhele ngapoota hilulu ya kuangalala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">Mmele gwangu gupakutama mu kuhobhalela,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kwakubhee mwenga Hangwana Annoongo ngaleka mboomo jangu ku lihembo litandamao lyangapela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">wala ngaleka antumichi bhinu bhakuaminika abhole mu likabuli.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Ntekunangia ndela jijindandaa ku umomi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">ndendakuhachuka muno ligongo nibhile kwaachinu!’”<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Akanung'una bhangu, mbala kunnobholelanga ngani ja hikubho hiiyapatite Adaudi, akolo bhitu. Bhenabho akajomoka, akachikwa, kabhele likabhuli lyabhe libhile panipani paachitu mpaka leleni. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Nambo kwakubhee Adaudi akibha halondoi, bhakaimanya kubhehe Annoongo akaalapila chilapo yakubhe apakwajelea jumo jwa ubhelehi gwabhe kubhehe hakolo mahali pakwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Adaudi akalola tangu hikubho hiipakutendekwa na Annoongo na henela akalobhola ngani ja kuyoka kwa Akilisito pabhalobhola, Ngaaleka mu lihembo litandamao lyangapela, mmele gwabhe gwangabhola. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Annoongo nga jwaakaayoa jonojwe Ayesu na twenga twabhoa nga tukachilola chikubho hecho. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ayesu pabhakatolekwa na kubhekwa na Annoongo upande gwabhe gwa kunnelo, akapokela Mboomo ja Annoongo kubhoka kwa Atati jonijola jubhakanhaidi, atekuteletela Mboomo ja Annoongo. Chenjeni nga chimuchibhonanga nangocheni na kujoanga. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />“Adaudi bhene, jwangatolekwa kunani kwa Annoongo, ila jonojwe akalobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Hangwana akaalobholela Hangwana bhangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">ntame upande gwangu gwa kunnelo,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />mpaka pambakutenda mwaatandae akaapwati bhinu.’”<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Bhandu bhoha bha ku Isilaeli bhamanyange kubhee, kweli hojo nga Ayesu bhantekwabhamba, nga jonojwe yakubhee Annoongo jwatekwatenda kubhehe Hangwana na Akilisito.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Bahi, bhandu pabhakajoanga genago, ikaabhinanga mu mitima jabhenji, bhakabhakonyanga Apetulo bhenibhala akandundame ajabhe, “Akaanung'una bhitu nangocheni tutendebholi?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Apetulo akaajangula, “Nnekange kulemwa kwinunji na kila jumo jwinunji na abatichwe kwa lihina lya Ayesu Akilisito ili mpatange kulekelelwa kulemwa kwinunji na mwangota mpakupokelanga ahadi jenijela ja Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kwakubhee, ahadi jenjeni nkabhekewa mwangota, na bhana bhinunji, na bhoha bhabhatamanga kutali na ligongo lya mundu yakubhee Hangwana Annoongo bhitu apakwajinula kwaachabhe.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Malobhe gangi gajingi, Apetulo bhakakachimila na kwakulumikianga bhandu kulobhola, “Nchiokoange kubhoka mu chibhelehi heche chibou.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Bhandu bhajingi bhakakondanga malobhe gabhe bhakabatichwanga. Bhandu handa elupu tatu bhakajonjokeka mu chenichela chibhoga chichahobhalela Akilisito lichobha helyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Habha bhoha bhakaendeleanga kuchijigana kubhoka kwa akaandundame, na bhakalyanganga pamo handa akaanung'una, na kwajopa Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umomi gwa kila lichobha kwa bhenibhala bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Hilolelo na yakangachika hijingi gakatendeka kwa ndela ja akaandundame hata kila mundu akibha na bhoga. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Bhandu bhoa bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhakaendeleanga kubhee chilebhe chimo na hilebhe yabhenji bhakametunilananga.<verse eid="ACT 2:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Bhakibhanga bhatendanga kuhuchanga hilebhe yabhenji na kuchimetulilanga mbiya handa hela kila mundu chaapalite. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Bhakaendeleanga kongonanga pamo kila lichobha pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo. Nambo pabhalilaje, bhakonganilanga pa nnyuumba yabhenji na kulyehe pamo kwa kuhangalalanga na ntima chindegele. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Bhakaalumbalilanga Annoongo na bhandu bhoa bhakabhajilwa na bhenaangota. Kila lichobha Hangwana akaajonjokeanga bhandu bhabhatenditandanga kuokolewanga.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Apetulo atenda kunnamia nangwabha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Lichobha limo, chaa ticha kimuho, Apetulo na Ayohana bhakibhanga bhatendakujaulanga ku Nyuumba ja Annoongo, muda gwa kwaajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Wakati hogwe bhandu bhakibhanga bhampapitinge mundu jumo nangwabha chibhelekwa. Bhandu habho bhatenditanga kummekanga jono mundu kila lichobha pa nniyango gwa Nyuumba ja Annoongo gukemitwa, “Nniyango gwa Kuhalala” ili ajope choachela kwa bhenibhala bhabhajingilanga pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Jono mundu pabhakaabhona Apetulo na Ayohana bhabhikujingilanga pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo, akaajopanga bhapekehe mbiha. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Apetulo na Ayohana bhakaalolekea muno, na jono Apetulo akaalobholela, “Ntulole!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Nabhena akaatendebhukila, bhabhikulolela kupata chilebhe kubhoka kwachabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Ngapena Apetulo akaalobholela, “Nanga mbiha, nambo chenichela chibhinacho mbakumpekeha. Kwa lihina lya Ayesu Kilisito bha ku Nazaleti nnyeme nnyaule!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Akaakamula lubhoko lwa kunnelo, akajinula. Popopo makongono na hindindili yabhe hikabhee na machili. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Akahomba, akajema na kujemeka kujenda. Penapo akajingila pamo nabho pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo, abhikujenda na kuhombahomba kongo abhikwalumbalila Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Bhandu bhoha bhakaabhona abhikujenda na kwaalumbalila Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Pabhakaamanya kubhehe nga jonijola jwatendita kujopajopa kubhandikila na gonigola, “Nnyango gwa Kuhalala” pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo, bhakakangachanga muno hata bhakotokuelewanga gagaapatite.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apetulo atendakwaatangachianga bhandu pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Mundu jono akibha bhalogine na Apetulo na Ayohana. Bhandu bhoha, bhakakakangachanga muno, bhakajemekanga kubhutukilanga mahali papakemitwa, “Lubhanja lwa Aselemani,” <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Bahi, Apetulo pabhakaabhona bhandu habho akaalobholelanga, “Mwabhandu bha Isilaeli, kwa niki ntendangakangachanga ligongo lya chikubho heche? Kwa niki ntendanga kutulolekeanga miho handa henela twenga nga tutendite kwa machili gitu hojo mundu akombole kujenda au twenga nga bhammbone nnoongi ja Annoongo? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Annoongo bha akaakolo bhitu Aibulahimu, Aisaka na Ayakobo, bhatekwatukucha antumichi bhake Ayesu. Bhena nga jolajola jumukaakamula na kwakana nnongi ja Apilato hata baada ja Apilato kulobhola kwaalekelekea. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Ayesu akibha mundu jwa Annoongo na jwambone, nambo mwangota nkankananga. Nkampalanga mundu joongi jwaakibha akomi bha bhandu ajogolelwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Bahi, nkankomanga jonijola jwaapekeanga bhandu umomi. Nambo Annoongo akaayoa, na twenga nga tutubhonite na kuchikongolela chikubho hecho. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Kwa kuhobhalela mu lihina lya Ayesu nga kutekunpekea machili hojo mundu mummonanga na kummanyanga. Kwahobhalela Ayesu nga kutekwalaamia mundu hojo handa chimummonanga mwabhoha.”<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Nangocheni mwakaanung'una bhangu, ndendakuimanya kubhehe mwangota na akolo bhinunji nkatendanga genago ligongo lya kwangaimanyanga kwinunji. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Nambo nga Annoongo akagatenda genigala gabhaakatangacha lolo kwa ndela ja akaalondoi bhoha, kubhee Akilisito apalikwa alage. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Bahi, nkotimange, mwabhujilange Annoongo ili jonojwe annekelelange kulemwa kwinunji. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Ntendange henela ili Hangwana ampekeange muda gwa kuhangalala mumitima jinunji na kunnetelanga jonijola Akilisito jwabhahagwile ligongo linunji yakubhe nga Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Hipalikwa jonojwe ahigalile konokwe kunani kwa Annoongo mpaka chigupakuika wakati gwa kuhalakilwa hilebhe yoha, handa Annoongo chibhalongile kwa ndela ja akalondoi bhabhe bhatakatifu kubhokela lolo. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Hela hela Amusa akalobhola, ‘Hangwana Annoongo bhinu apakwatuma alondoi kwachinunji handa chibhandumite nenga kubhoka pakati jinunji. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Joajola yakubhee ngannyoanikia alondoi hojwe jwa Annoongo, apakwabheka kutali na bhandu bha Annoongo na kwatinihanga.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Akaalondoi bha Annoongo bhoha, kujemeka Asamweli na bhenibhala bhabhakagwile, bhakatangachanga ngani ja hikubho heyeye yakubhe gatendakutendeka machobha gangani. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Genigala gabhakalongela Annoongo hibhakaibhoa kwa ndela ja akaalondoi bha Annoongo nga ligongo jinunji, na ntendakulondanika na liagano Annoongo libhakalitenda na akahokolo bhinu, handa Annoongo chibhakaalobholela Abulahamu kubhee, ‘Kubhokela mu ubhelei gwinu, bhandu bhoa bha pachilambo apakutendelelwanga gammbone.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Bahi, Annoongo akaayoha antumichi bhabhe ligongo linunji, akajemeka kwaatuma kwaachinu antendelange gammbone kwa kuntenda jumo jwinunji aleke ubohu gwabhe.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Apetulo na Ayohana bhapelekwangwa ku Chebule ja akaakolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Apetulo na Ayohane pabhakibhanga tangu bhatendanga kwatangachianga bhandu ngani ja Ayesu, akaakung'i na akaakolo bha ajemelei bha Nyuumba ja Annoongo pamo na Masadukayo bhakaikanga. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Bhakatumbalanga muno, kwakubhee bhenabho akandundame bhatendanga kwataangachianga bhandu yakubhee Ayesu akayoa, chikubho hecho chilangia ndaa yakubhehe bhabhawilinge bhapakuyokanga. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Bahi, bhakaakamulanga Apetulo na Ayohana na kwa kubhehe kilo chite kubhandikila, bhakabhabhekanga pahi ja ujemelehi mpaka malabhi jakwe. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Nambo bhandu bhajingi pakati jabhenji bhabhakajoanga malobhe gabhenji Apetulo na Ayohana bhakahobhalelanga, na bhandu bhabhakahobhalelanga bhakabhandikila handa akanalome elupu nhano.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Malabhi jakwe, akaakolo bha Bhayahudi, akanahota na bhabhajiganga Malagilo ga Amusa bhakakondekanga pamo konokwe ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Bhakakongananga pamo na Aanasi Akung'i akolo, Akayafa, Ayohana, Alekisanda na bhangi bhabhabhilinge bha chilagwa cha Akung'i akolo. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Pabhakajemeanga akandundame nnoongi jabhenji, bhakaakonyanga, “Mwangota ntenditinge chikubho heche kwa uwecho niki na ukolo gwa aganiki?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Popopo, Apetulo, kongo abhikulongolelwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo, akaajangulanga, “Akanachilongola na akanahota bha ku Isilaeli! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Handa ntukonyitinge leleni ngani ja chenichela chikubho chammbone chatendilwe jonijola mundu jwakibha nagwabha na namuna chibhalamite, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />bahi, mwangota na bhandu bhoha bha ku Isilaeli hipalikwa kuimanyanga yakubhehe mundu hojo jwaajemite nnongi jinunji leleni, jwamomi, kwa machili ga lihina lyakwe Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti yakubhe mwangota nkaabhamba panchalaba, nambo Annoongo akayoa. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Jonjoni Ayesu nga Majandiko ga Annoongo gatendakulobhola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Liganga limulikanitinge mwangota akaachengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">nangocheni litekubhee liganga likolongwa lya kulupalilwa.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Ayesu jikajabhe nga jwaakombola kwaokoanga bhandu kwa kubhee pachilambo poa lyakwa lihina lyengi tutupekiwe lya kutuokoa twenga.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Bhenaangota akanahota ya Chebule bhakibhanga bhatendakuimanyanga kubhee Apetulo na Ayohana bhakibhanga bhandu bhanga chomanga wala kumanya kohakola, bhakakangachanga namuna chibhatendita kulongelanga kwa kutongamanikanga. Bhakaimanyanga kubhee bhakibhanga bhachilondanikinge na Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Nambo pabhakammonanga mundu jola jwatekulamiwa ajemite pamo nabho, bhangakombolanga kulongelanga chilebhe. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Henela, bhakaakulumikianga bhapitange panja ja Chebule, akanahota bhakaigalilanga nkati bhabhikulongelanga pantemela. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Bhakakonyananga, “Twaatendele chiniki bhandu habha? Kila mundu jwaatama ku Yelusalemu atendakuimanya kubhee nnolelo hogogo gwa kangachika gutendikwe, natwenga ngakombola kukana chikubho hecheche. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Nambo ili tupate kwaakanikia chikubho heche chikotokujenela kupunda pakati ja bhandu, twaanyamukange bhakotokulongelanga na mundu johajola kwa lihina lya Ayesu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Henela bhakaakemanga kabhele akaakolo bha Chebule nkati, bhakaakalipilanga kabhele bhakotokulongelanga palugwinjili, wala kujigana kwa lihina lya Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Nambo Apetulo na Ayohana bhakajangulanga, “Nhamuange mwangota mwabhene chichibhi chammbone, handa nga yammbone nnoongi ja Annoongo kunnyeketelanga mwangota au Annoongo? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kwa kubhee ngakombola kuleka kulobhola ngani ja hikubho yela ituhibhonite na kuijoanga.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Bahi, bhena akanahota bha Chebule bhakaanyamukanga kwa kukalipa muno, ngapena bhakaalekeleanga. Bhangakombolanga kwaalagianga ligongo bhandu bhoha bhakibhanga bhatendakwalumbalila Annoongo ligongo lya chilebhe hecho. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Jono mundu jwatekulamiwa akapunda yaaka makomi ncheche.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhatenda kwajoopa Annoongo bhaatamie maha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Popopo pabhakalekelelwanga, Apetulo na Ayohana bhakabhujanga kwaachabhenji, bhakaalobholelanga genigala gabhatekulobholelwanga na akaakung'i akolo na akanahota. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Nabhena pabhakajoanikianga ngani heyo bhakalondekananga pamo mu kwajoopa Annoongo gubhakalobhwilangaje, “Mwenga Hangwana Annoongo nga jwanhalakie kunani kwa Annoongo na pachilambo, bahali na yoha hihibhile! <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Himwatendile antumichi bhinu, atati bhitu Adaudi, alongele kwa machili ga Mboomo ja Annoongo kubhee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Kwaniki hilambo hitekubhee na lilaka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Mboni bhandu bhatenditinge ndela ja hiyoyo?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Akaamwenye bha pachilambo bhatekuchibheka maha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">na bhatawala bhakongininge pamo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">kwakana Hangwana na Akilisto bhabhe.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Kweli, nga Ahelode, Apontio Pilato, bhandu bha ku Isilaeli na bhandu bhanga Bhayuhudi bhakakondanikanga papapa pa nnyini, kwakana Ayesu Antumichi bhinu, mundu jwinu jwankaagula. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Kweli, bhakakongana ili bhatendange chikubho chela chibhakapalanga na kutendanga kubhokela kandai kwa machili gakwe na upaliho gwinu. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Nambo nangocheni, mwa Hangwana, nnole hijogoo yabhenji. Ntukombolehe twenga akaabhanda bhinu kutangacha lilobhe linu pangali bhoga. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Nlangie machili ginu ili mwalamie bhandu. nteende yakangachika kwa lihina lya Ayesu Antumichi jwinu Atakatifu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Pabhakajomolanga kujopa, penipala pabhakibhanga bhakongininge pakapukunyika, nabhena bhoha bhakalongolelwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo. Bhoa bhakajemekanga kutangachanga Lilobhe lya Annoongo pangali bhoga.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhabhaahobhalela Ayesu bhatamanga kwa kuchikichana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Chibhoga cha bhandu bhoa bhabhaahobhalela Ayesu chakibhanga na ntima gumo na mboomo jimo. Jwaka hata jumo jwakibha na chilebhe choachela jwakachibheka kubhee chilebhe chakwe jika, ila bhakabhagananga yoha hibhakibhanayo. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Akandundame bhakalolanga kwa machili gajingi kuyooka kwa Hangwana Ayesu, nabhena Annoongo akaatendelanga gammbone gajingi. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Jwaakwa mundu johajola jwakapongokelwa na chilebhe, kwa kubhee bhabhakibhanga na migonda au majumba bhakibhanga bhatendakuuchanga. <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />Bhakaapekeanga akandundame mbiya yela, na bhenaangota bhakagabhananga kwa kila mundu handa chibhatendita kupala.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Kukibha na mundu jumo jwakabhoka chilagwa cha Lawi, akabhelekwa ku Kupulo, lihina lyakwe Ayusufu, akibha alondoi jwa Annoongo jwaakemitwa Abanaba maana gakwe, “Mundu jwaalekela mitima bhandu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Jonojwe kabheele akibha na nng'oonda gwabhe, akaguucha, akatola yeniyela mbiya, na kuipeleka kwa akaandundame.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Anania na Asafila bhatendakutemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Kukibha na mundu jumo jwaakemitwa Aanania na hanu bhabhe Asafila na bhenaangota hela hela bhakauchanga ng'oonda gwabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Nambo, hanu bhabhe abhikuhimanya, Aanania akaapula chehemu ja mbiya hibhaakapata na kuhiya na mbiya yengi hihikaigalila akapeleka kwa akaandundame. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Bahi, Apetulo akaakonya, “Aanania, mboni ntekwaajeketela lichetani kujingila muntima gwinu na kuntenda muntembe Mboomo jwa Annoongo kwa kuchibhekela mbiya muipatite kubhokela kwa kuucha nng'oonda? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Mmi tangu kuguhucha gukibha gwinu, na pamukaguucha, tangu yene mbiya ikibha yinu muitumie chimpala. Kwa niki, nkahamua muntima gwinu kutenda chikubho handa chenjeni? Mwangantemba mundu, mwaatembite Annoongo!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Aanania pabhakajoa genago, akagwehe pahi, akajomoka. Bhandu bhoha pabhakajoanga ngani ya chikubho hecho bhakajogopanga muno. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Akanangwendu bhakakemwanga, bhakaguigilila mmele gwabhe sanda, bhakagupia panja, bhakaachika.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Pagakapeta machaa gatatu, hanu bhabhe, pangaimanya chikubho chichibhokile, bhakajingilanga monimola nkati. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Apetulo akaalobholela, “Ngongolele! Bholi, heye mbiha nga mpatitinge kwa kuuchanga ng'oonda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Jonojwe akajangula, “Kweli, nga yenjeni.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Nabhenabho Apetulo akaalobholela, “Mboni mpala kwaajiga Mboomo jwa Hangwana? Nnyohanikie! Bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakajaulanga kwaachika hangwana bhinu, nangocheni bhabhilinge panniango bhapakuntola namwenga.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Popopo Asafila akagwehe nnoongi ja makongono ga Apetulo, akajomoka. Bhenibhala akanangwendu pabhakajingilanga, bhakaakolela ajomwike, bhakaapia panja, bhakaachika kubhandikila na hangwana bhabhe. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Bhoga ngolongwa gukaajingila bhandu bhabhaahobhalela Akilisito bhoa bhabhakajoanga ngani ja chikubho hecho.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akalondoi bhatendanga yakangachika hilolelo hijingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Akandundame bhakatendanga hilolelo na yakangachika gajingi pakati ja bhandu. Bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhabhakibhanga bhatendakongananga pamo mpa lubhanja lwa Aselemani. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Mundu johajola jongi jwangabhe pamo na chibhoga hecho. Hata henela, bhandu bhangi bhangahobhalela lenelyo bhakaalumbalilanga. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Bhandu bhabhakahobhalelanga Hangwana, bhakapunda kujonjokeka muno akanalome kwa akaikege <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Bhandu bhakibhanga bhatendakwapelekanga akaatamwa nndela na kwagonekanga nnaani ja hindanda na mmakahi ili Apetulo handa apetite, chiheka chabhe chakwaange bhangi pakati jabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Bhandu bhajingi bhakaikanga kubhoka mu hilambo ya nngulugulu ja ku Yelusalemu, bhakaaletanga akaatamwa bhabhenji na bhenibhala bhabhabhilinge na mahoka gabohu, nabhena bhoha bhakaalamianga.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akandundame bhatendakulagiwanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ngapena, akung'i akolo na akaajabhe bhabhakibhanga bha chibhoga cha Masadukayo bha penapo, bhakaabhonelanga akandundame bwihu.<verse eid="ACT 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Bahi, bhakakamulanga, bhakaatabhanga nkati ja nyuumba ngolongwa ja kutabhila bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Nambo kilo akaatumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo bhakajijogolanga milyango ja nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu, na kwapianga panja, bhakaalobholelanga, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Nnyabhulange, nkajemange pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo nkaalobholelange bhandu malobhe goha ga umomi hogo guyono kwa kulondanika na Ayesu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Akandundame bhakajeketelanga, bhakajingilanga mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo kundabhi tupupu, bhakajemekanga kwaajigananga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Akung'i Akolo na ajabhe pabhakaikanga, bhakaakemanga pamo chikomiti cha Chebule ja lilubhalo lyoa lya akanahota Bhaisilaeli, kabhele bhakaatumanga bhandu ku nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu bhaletange bhenibhala akandundame. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Nambo bhenabho akaatumichi pabhakaikanga konokwe bhangaakolelanga monimola mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. Henela bhakabhujanga, kwalobholelanga akanahota bha Chebule, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />bhakalobholanga, “Patukahika pa nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu tukakolela milyango ja nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu jitabhitwe kohakoha na akaalendei bhabhi kulendelela milyango. Nambo patukajogola twaangankolela mundu johajola nkati.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Akolo bha akaajemelei bha Nyuumba ja Annoongo na akakung'i akolo pabhakajoanga ngani hejo bhakibhanga na bhoga, bhakotokuimanyanga kubhapatitinge bhenibhala akaandundame. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Akaika mundu jumo, akaalobholelanga, “Bhenibhala bhandu bhamwatabhitinge mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu, nangocheni bhabhilinge pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo, bhatendanga kwaajigana bhandu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Penapo akakolo bha akaajemelei bha nyumba ja Annoongo pamo na bhandu bhabhe bhakajaulanga ku nyumba ja Annoongo, ili bhaaletange. Nambo bhangaakamulanga kwa machili, ligongo bhakajogopanga bhandu bhapakwapootanga maganga.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Bahi, akaandundame bhakapelwakwangwa, na kwaajemeanga nnoongo ja Chebule. Akung'i Akolo akaalobholelanga, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Tukankakianga kujigananga kwa lihina lya mundu hojo, nangocheni nntendanga kujeneanga majigano ginunji pohapoha mu Yelusalemu na mwangota mpalanga kutukokoleka twenga ligongo lya malilo ga mundu hojwe.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Penapo Apetulo, akibha pamo na akaandundame bhangi, akajangula, “Tupalikwa kwaakoonda Annoongo, na ngabha bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Annoongo bha ahokolo bhitu akaayoa Ayesu jonijola mwaangota pankankoma kwa kwabhamba pa nchalaba. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Jonojwe nga Annoongo jwakaakwelea mpaka upande gwabhe gwa kunnelo, akabhee nkolo na Jwatukomboa, ili bhakomboleange bhandu bha ku Isilaeli bhakotimange, bhapatange kulekelelwanga kulemwa kwabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Natwenga nga bhatulolite chikubho hecho, Mboomo jwa Annoongo yakubhee Annoongo bhatekwaapekeanga bhenibhala bhabhaakonda, nabhombe atendakulola chikubho hecho.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Akaajumbe bhoha bha jenijela Chebule pabhakajoanga genago, bhakatumbalanga muno, hata bhakapalanga kwakomanga akaandundame. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Nambo Mfalisayo jumo jwaakemitwa Agamalieli yakubhee akibha amundu bha kujigana malagilo na jwaakatopelwa muno akajema nnoongi ja bhandu bhoha, akajema nnongi ja Chebule, akapala bhenibhala akandundame bhaapiange oti panja kachoko. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Ngapena, akaalobholelanga bhenibhala akaajumbe bha Chebule, “Bhaisilaeli akaajangu, nkombokelange oti tangu mwangatendanga chenecho chimpala kwatendela habha bhandu! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Yaaka kachoko jijipetite, akabhokela mundu jumo lihina lyabhe Ateuda. Jonojwe akachitangacha kubhee akolo na bhandu handa mia ncheche bhakaakagula. Nambo akakomekwa, ngapena bhandu bhoa bhabhakakaagula bhakapwilinganikanga na chibhoga chabhe chikawee. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Kabhele, machobha gala ga kubhalanganwa bhandu, akabhokela Ayuda amundu bha ku Galilaya. Jonojwe akautanga bhandu bhakaakagula, hela hela na jonojwe akakomekwa, na bhenibhala bhandu bhabhaakagula bhakapwilinganika. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Nangocheni na nenga ndendakunkelebhuanga, habha bhandu nkotokwaatendalanga choachela, mwaalekange, kwakubhee, handa gubhi mpango ngongoni au lihengo lyabhenji lijemikwe na bhandu, ngajaula kutali lipakuwehe.<verse eid="ACT 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Nambo handa lijeemikwe Annoongo, ngakombola kwakanikia habha bhandu, nambo mpakuchikolelanga mmikwakana Annoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Henela, bhandu bhoa bha Chebule bhakaondanga chenichela chibhakalongela Agamalieli. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Henela bhakaakemanga bhenibhala akandundame bhajingilange nkati, bhakaakulumikianga bhapotwangwe hiyakato na kwakanikia bhakotokwajigana kabhele kwa lihina lya Ayesu, ngapena bhakaalekanga bhajaulange. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Bahi, akaandundame bhakapitanga panja ja jenijela Chebule bhabhikuhangalalanga muno, kwakubhee Annoongo akatenda bhatopelwangwe kwa kupatanga honi ligongo lya lihina lya Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Bhakajaulanga kila lichobha kujigana na kutangachanga Ngani Jammbone pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo na mmajumba ga bhandu kubhee Ayesu nga Akilisito.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Akaajangatii chaba bha akalondoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Bhabhachijigana bha Ayesu bhapakunda kujonjokeka, kukabhokela na kokoleka pakati jabhenji ja bhenibhala bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhabhalongila Chigiliki na bhenibhala bhabhalongila Chiebulania. Bhenibhala bhabhalongila Chigiliki bhakakokolekelanga kubhee bhawela bhabhenji bhatendakulibhalilwanga mu kumetulana yakulya yakila lichobha. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Henela, bhenibhala akaandundame komi na bhabhele bhakalikemanga libhoga lyoa lya bhabhachijigana cha Ayesu na kwalobholelanga, “Ngabha yammbone twenga tuleke kutangacha lilobhe lya Annoongo ili tutendange lihengo lya kubhagana chakulya. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Henela, akaanung'una bhitu, nhagulange pakati jinunji bhandu chaba bhabhabhilinge na Mboomo ja Annoongo, bhabhakolite malango na bhabhatopelwanga muno, twenga tupakwakamuanga lihengo hilo. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Twenga tupakwajopa Annoongo na lihengo lya kutangacha Lilobhe lya Annoongo.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Chikubho hecho chikaabhajilanga chibhoga choha chichitekwahobhalela Ayesu. Bhakaagulanga Asitefano, mundu jwaakahobhalela muno na kulongolelwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo. Hela hela bhakaahagulanga Afilipo, Apolokolo, Anikanoli, Atimona, Apalimela na Anikolao bha ku Antiokia yakubhe akajingila dini ja Chiyahudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Bhakaabhekanga nnoongi ja akandundame, na bhenaangota bhakaajopelanga na kwaatendelanga gammbone kwa kwabhekelanga mabhoko.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Lilobhe lya Annoongo likapunda kujenela na bhandu bhabhakahobhalela bhakajonjokeka muno konokwe ku Yelusalemu, na akaakung'i bhajingi bhakahobhalela.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asitefano atendakamulikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Annoongo akaajalia Asitefano majingi gammbone, akaapekea machili gajingi hata akatenda hilolelo na yakangachika pakati ja bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Nambo bhandu teno bhakabhokelanga ili bhataukanange na Asitefano. Bhandu kachoko habho bhakibhanga bha mu nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi jimo jijikemitwa, “Nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi ja bhandu bhabhalekelilwe,” nabhena bhakabhokanga ku Kilene na ku Alekisandilia, bhangi bhakabhokanga ku Kilikia na ku Asia. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Nambo bhangakombolanga kwaagwia ligongo lya malango gabhe na kwakubhee jonijola Mboomo jwa Annoongo jwakaatandaa penipa pabhakalobhola. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Henela bhakaakolekeanga bhandu kachoko bhalongelange, “Twajoine Asitefano abhikulongela malobhe ga kwaatukana Amusa na kwaapoonja Annoongo.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Henela, bhakaakolekeanga bhandu, akanahota na bhabhajiganga Malagilo ga Amusa. Bahi, bhakaahikila Asitefano, bhakaakamula na kwaaleta nnongi ja Chebule Nkolongwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Bhakaaletanga pa Chebule bhandu bhabhalongilinge unami kubhee pabhalongilaje, “Mundu hojo ngaleka ng'oo malobhe ga kupaponja pambani mahali pa Annoongo na malagilo ga Amusa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Tukaajoa abhilongelanga kubhee, Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti apakubhomolana pambani na kuhuta gagayobhalilike kugapokela kubhoka kwa Amusa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Bhoha bhabhakibhanga mu chikomiti cha Chebule bhakaalolekea miho Asitefano, bhakabhonanga kumio kwabhe kubhile handa antumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Asitefano atendakuchitetela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Bahi, Akung'i Akolo akaakonya Asitefano, “Bholi, hikubho heye nga ya kweli?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Nabhena Asitefano akalobhola, “Akaanung'una bhangu na akaatati bhangu, nnyoanikiange! Annoongo bha ng'anyimo akaabhokela anahota bhitu Abulahamu pabhakibha ku Mesopotania tangu jwangajaula kutama konikola ku Halani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Annoongo akaalobholela Abulahamu, ‘Mmoke mu chilambo chinu, mwalekange bhandu bha chilagwa chinu, nnyaule mu chilambo chimbakunnangia!’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Henela, Abulahamu akabhoka chilambo cha ku Kalidayo, akajaula kutama ku Halani. Atati bhabhe Abuluhamu pabhakajomoka, Annoongo akaabhoa kabhele ku Halani akahika kutama mu chilambo heche chintamanga nangocheni. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Annoongo jwangampekea hata kachoko chilambo heche chibhee chabhe, henela, akaalobholela kubhee apakwapekea chilambo heche chibhee chabhe na cha ubhelei gwabhe, na gono muda akibha bhanga mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Annoongo akaalobholela henela Abulahamu, ‘Ubhelei gwinu gupakupelekwa kutama ku chilambo chigeni, na konokwe gupakutendwa kubhee akaabhanda na kutendelwa hilebhe hibou kwa yaaka mia ncheche. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Nambo nenga mbakuchihukumula chilambo hecho chichipakwaatendanga akaabhanda. Ngapena mbakwabhoanga mu chilambo hecho ili bhaikange kungotimila pambani pamile.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Penapo Annoongo akatenda liagano na Abulahamu kwa ndela ja kwahina bhana bhabhe akanalome kulangia hilolelo yabhe. Henela, Abulahimu akahina mwana jwabhe Aisaka lichobha lya nane kubhokela kubhelekwa kwabhe. Hela hela Aisaka, akahina Ayakobo. Na Ayakobo akatendelanga hela hela bhenibhala akanahota komi na bhabhele.”<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Bhenibhala akanahota bhakabhonela bwihu anung'una bhabhe Ayusufu, bhakaahucha abhe abhanda ku Misili. Nambo Annoongo akibha pamo na jonojwe, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />akaahokoa mu hibhini yoa. Annoongo akaapekea umanyo na malango nnongi ja Afalao, amwenye bha ku Misili, na henela Afalao akaabheka kubhee akolo bha chenichela chilambo na nyuumba ja chimwenye. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Ngapena, likajemeka likuluta mu chilambo choha cha ku Misili na ku Kanaani, na bhakalaganga muno. Akanahota bhitu bhangakombolanga kupatanga chakulya choachela. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Bahi, Ayakobo pabhakajoa ngani kubhee konokwe ku Misili kukibha na chakulya, guna kamo akaatumanga bhana bhabhe nga akanahota bhitu bhajaulange konokwe ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Mu ulendo gwabhenji gwa bhele, Ayusufu bhakachilangia kwa akaanung'una bhabhe, na Afalao akaamanyanga akaalongo bhabhe Ayusufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Ayusufu akalagia kwa atati bhabhe na akaalongo bhabhe bhaikange ku Misili, na bhandu bhoa bhakibhanga chabini na nhano. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Henela, Ayakobo akajaula ku Misili kubhatamita, yakubhee jonojwe na akanahota bhitu bhangi bhakajomokanga. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Mimele jabhenji hikaletwanga mpaka ku Shekemu, ikachikwa mmakabuli gabhakaemela Aibulahimu kwa mbiya kubhoka kwa chilongelo cha bha Hamoli.”<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Machobha pagakaika Annoongo apangane handa chibhakaalobholela Abulahimu, bhandu bhenibhala bhabhakibhanga ku Misili bhakapunda kujonjokeka kubhee bhajingi muno. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Pagakajomoka goa, ngapena amwenye jongi jwangaamanya Ayusufu akajemeka kutawala konokwe ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Amwenye jonojwe akaachitendela hilebhe hibou akanahota bhitu, akaatendelanga ubohu akanahota bhitu kwa kwakulumikianga bhaabhekange panja bhana bhabhenji hilemba ili bhakomekwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Amusa akabhelekwa mu machobha genago, na akahalala muno. Akalelewa kaja kwa miehi jitatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />na pabhakabhekwa kutali na kaja, mwali jwa Afalao akantola, akannela handa mwana jwabhe. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Amusa akajiganwa hikubho yoa ya malango ga bhandu bha Misili akibha amundu uwecho nkolongwa gwa kulongela na kutenda hilebhe hikolongwa.”<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Pabhakibha na yaaka makomi ncheche akapala kujaula kwaalonga akaanung'una bhabhe bha Isilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Konokwe akaabhona anung'una bhabhe jumo abhikuntendelwa hubou na mundu jwa ku Misili, akajaula kwaokoa, na kuchibhujikiha, akaakoma bhenabho Mmisili. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Akaganikia kubhee Bhaisilaeli akaajabhe bhakaimanyitenge kubhee Annoongo akaatumite bhenabho kwakomboanga, nambo bhangaelewanga henela. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Malabhi jakwe, akaabhona Bhaisilaeli bhabhele bhabhikupotana, akalenga kwaatapulanga akalobhola, ‘Mwangota nga mwalongo, kwa niki, ntendakutendela yangalimmbone mwangota akaachinabhene?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Jonijola jwampotita ajabhe akaanokola Amusa nnyenje akalobhola, ‘Nga ganiki jwaammekite mwenga kubhee achilongola bhitu twenga? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Bholi, mpala kungoma handa chimunkomite jonijola mundu jwa ku Misili licho?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Pabhakagajoa genago, Amusa akabhutuka, akajaula kutama mu chilambo cha ku Midiani na konokwe akalombela na akapata bhana bhabhele akanalome.”<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Yaaka makomi ncheche pajikapeta, antumichi bha kunani bha Hangwana akaabhokela Amusa mu chitekete chichijakita mooto konokwe kululemba kubhandikila na litombi lya Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Amusa akakangacha muno kubhona chikubho hecho hata bhakabhandikila muno ili akombole kulingulila, nambo akajoa Hangwana abhikulobhola, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Nenga nga Annoongo bha akanahota bhinu, Annoongo bha Abulahamu, na Aisaka na Ayakobo!’ Amusa akalendemela kwa bhoga na jwangalenga kulola muno. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Hangwana akaalobholela. ‘Nhule champali yinu kwakubhee pambani pannyemite nga kwangu nenga. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Nigubhweni ubohu gubhatendelwanga bhandu bhangu konikola ku Misili. Ndekujoa nguto yabhenji, na nenga ndekuika kwaokoanga. Bahi nangocheni, mbakuntuma ku Misili.’”<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Hojo Amusa nga jwajola jwaakakanwa na bhandu ha ku Isilaeli pabhakaakonya, ‘Nga ganiki jwaammekite mwenga kubhee akolo na kututapulana twenga?’ Kwa kupetela jonijola ntumichi jwa kunani kwa Annoongo jwakaabhokela mu chitekete chichijakita mooto, Annoongo akaatuma Amusa bhabhe achilongola na akomboi. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Jonojwe jwaakatutandaa bhenibhala bhandu bhabhokange ku Misili kwa kutenda yakangachika hijingi mu chilambo cha ku Misili, mu bahali ja Shamu na palulemba, kwa yaaka makomi ncheche. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Hojo nga Amusa jwaakaalobholelanga bhandu bha Isilaeli, ‘Annoongo apakunhagulilanga alondoi handa nenga pakati ja akaalongo bhinu mwabhene.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Bhaisilaeli pabhakakondanika konikola kululemba, Amusa nga jwaakibha konokwe handa annyumbe pakati ja bhena akanahota bhitu na bhenibhala antumichi bha Annoongo jwaakalongela nabho ku litombi lya ku Sinai. Nga jwaakapekewa genigala malobhe ga umomi atupekee twenga.”<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Nambo bhenabho nga haokolo bhitu bhabhakanitinge kwaajoanikia, bhakaanokola kutali, bhakalokolilanga kubhuja ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Bhakaalobholela Aaluni, ‘Ntualakiange minnoongo jijipakututandaa nndela, kwakubhee ngagamanya gagapatite Amusa jwaatekututandaa kubhoka ku Misili!’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Pena bhakachihalakianga chidimu cha ndama, bhakachibhekela na kuchihangalalia chenichela chilebhe chabhahalakie kwa mabhoko gabhenji bhene. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Nambo Annoongo akabhoka pakati jabhenji, akaalekanga bhakotimilange ndondwa ya kuliunde, handa chiijandikwe mu chitabu cha akalondoi bha Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Mwangota bhandu bha Isilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">Ngabha nenga bhantekumokeanga mbeeko na chadaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">kwa yaaka makomi ncheche konikola kulikonja!<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Mwangota nga mwankachipetulanga chilendo cha annoongo Amoloki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">na chidimu cha ndondwa ja annoongo bhinu Alefani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Hidimu mwankahilakianga ligongo lya kukotimilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Henela mbakampelekanga mateka kutali kupeta ku Babiloni!’”<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Konikola kululemba akaaokolo bhitu bhakibhanga na chenichela chilendo cha kuhukumulila. Likaalakikwa handa Annoongo chibhakaalobholela Amusa aalakie chilebhe chene cha chenichela chibhakaalangiha. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Ngapena hakaokolo bhitu bhakapokelananga akachinabhenenji mpaka muda gwa Ayoshua, pabhakanyakulanga chenichela chilambo kubhoka ku chilambo yakubhe Annoongo bhakagabhenga nnoongi jabhenji. Chilendo chenecho chikatama penapo mpaka machobha ga Adaudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Adaudi akabhajilwa na Annoongo, akaajopa Annoongo alekelee ili anchengele nyuumba yakubhee jonojwe na bhandu bha ku Isilaeli bhoa bhakakombolinge kwaajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Nambo Aselemani nga jwaakachengela Annoongo nyuumba.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Henela, Annoongo akolongwa ngatama mu nyuumba hiichengwite na bhandu, handa alondoi bhabhe chibhalobhola.<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Hangwana alobhola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Kunani kwa Annoongo nga chitengu changu cha umwenye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">na pachilambo nga chitengu changu cha kubhekela makongono.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Nga nyuumba niki jinkombola kunjengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">na koji kumbakupomolela?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Hilebhe heye yoha nenga nga ndekuihalakia au ngabha?’”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Mwangota nga bhandu bhamitau! Mitima na machikilo ginunji nga handa bhandu bhangaamanya Annoongo. Mwangota nga handa akanahota bhinu. Machobha goha ntendakunkananga Mboomo jwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Akaalondohi bhoa bha Annoongo bhakatendelwanga hilebhe hibou na akanahota bhinunji. Bhakaakomanga bhenaangota yakubhee Annoongo akaatumanga bhatangache kuika kwabhe bhenibhala Akola Haki. Nangocheni, mwangota ntekung'aluka, <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Mwangota nkapokelanga genijela Malagilo ga Annoongo gagakaika kwaachinu na akaatumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo, nambo mwangagakondanga.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asitefano atendakomekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Bhenibhala akanahota bha Chebule pabhakajoanga genago, bhakatumbalanga muno, bhakaayagila mino kwa lilaka. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Nambo Asitefano akalongolelwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo, akalola kunani kwa Annoongo, akagubhona ng'anyimo gwa Annoongo na Ayesu atamite upande kwa kunnelo gwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Akalobhola, “Nnolange! Ndendabhona kunani kwa Annoongo kutekujogolekwa na Jwana jwa Mundu atekujema upande gugukatopelwa gwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Penapo, bhandu bhoha mu chenichela chikomiti cha Chebule, bhakapotanga nyenye na kuibha machikilo gabhenji kwa mabhoko gabhenji. Ngapena bhakaahombela pamo, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />bhakaabhoha panja ja chilambo, bhakampota maganga. Bhenibhala bhabhakaalongelea unami Asitefano bhakagabhekkanga makoti gabhenji pahi ja ujemelei gwa nkakombo jumo lihina lyakwe Asaulo. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Bhakaendeleanga kumpotaanga Asitefano kwa maganga kongo abhi kujopa, “Hangwana Ayesu, mujipokele mboomo jangu!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Akatindibhala majugwa, akaguta kwa lilobhe likolongwa, “Hangwana nkotokwahumulanga kwa kulemwa hoko.” Pabhakajomola kulongela henela, akajomoka.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Hela hela Asauli akachibhona chikubho hecho cha kwaakoma Asitefano kubhee chammbone.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Bhandu bhabhanhobhalela Akilisito bhatendakulagikwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Lichobha helyo lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalile Akilisito bha ku Yelusalemu likajemeka kulaga muno. Bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhoha, pangabhe tu bhenibhala akandundame, bhakajenelanga mu chehemu ja mmigonda ya ku Samalia. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Bhandu bhabhahobhalela Annoongo bhaakachika Asitefano na kwaapunda kwaagutila muno.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Wakati gogogo, Asauli akalenga kulilagiha lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito. Akajaula kila nyuumba, bhakaapianga panja bhandu bhabhahobhalile Ayesu, akanalome na akaikege, na kwatabha mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngani Jammbone jitendakutangachwa ku Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakahobhalela Ayesu bhabhakapwilinganika, bhakatangachanga Ngani Jammbone koha kubhakajaulanga. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Hela hela Afilipo akajingila mu chilambo cha ku Asamalia na kwatangacha Akilisito kwa bhandu bhabhatamita konokwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Bhandu pabhakaajoa Afilipo na kuilola hilolelo na yakangachika hibahaitendite bhakachilondanikanga na kujoanikianga kwa kuchitimalika. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Mahoka gagakatama nkati ja bhandu gakaabhokanga kongo bhabhikupotanga nyenye muno. Na bhandu bhangi bhajingi bhabhakapolanga yega yabhenji na bhabhalemilinge bhakalamiwanga. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Henela bhandu bha chilambo chela bhakahangalala muno.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Bahi, kukibha na mundu jumo ahabhi jwaakeemitwa Asimoni yakubhehe akibha atendite uhabhi gwabhe mu chilambo kwa muda hogwe na kwakangachianga bhandu bha ku Chamalia, abhikuchilola kubhee jonojwe nga mundu jwakumanyikana muno. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Bhandu bhoha, akaachoko na akaakolongwa bhakalobholanga, “Asimoni nga machili ga Chinnoongo gagakemwa, ‘Machili Majingi.’” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Bhakaajoanikia muno kwa henela akibha atekwakangachianga kwa uhabhi gwabhe kwa muda ntandamao. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Nambo pabhakagaobhalelanga malobhe ga Afilipo kupetela Ngani Jammbone ja ukolo gwa Annoongo na ngani ja lihina lya Ayesu Kilisito, bhakabatichwanga, akaikege na akanalome. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Hata Asimoni hela hela akaobhalela Ngani Jammbone, na pabhakabatichwa akibha atendakulongana na Afilipo, akakangacha hilolelo na yakangachika hihikatendeka.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Bhenibhala akandundame bhabhakibhanga konikola ku Yelusalemu pabhakapatanga ngani yakubhehe bhandu bha ku Samalia nabhena bhabhakonditinge Lilobhe lya Annoongo, bhakaatuma Apetulo na Ayohana bhajaulange konokwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Pabhakaikanga konokwe bhakaajopelanga bhandu bhabhaobhalela Ayesu ili bhajipokelange Mboomo ja Annoongo, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />kwa kubhee muda hogwe Mboomo ja Annoongo akibha angaatulukila mundu joajola pakati jabhenji, bhakibha bhatekubatichwanga tu kwa lihina lya Hangwana Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Bahi, Apetulo na Ayohana bhakaabhekelanga mabhoko bhen bhandu bhabhaobhalela Ayesu, nabhena bhakaakonda Mboomo ja Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Penapo Asimoni akahimanya kubhee kwa kwaabhekela mabhoko ga akandundame na bhabhakaahobhalela Ayesu bhakaapekeanga Mboomo jabhe henela akabhoa mbiha na kupala kwaapekea Apetulo na Ayohana kongo abhikulobhola, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />“Mmbekeange na nenga hela hela uwecho hogwe kubhee jwaajola jwambakummekela mabhoko apokele Mboomo ja Annoongo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Nambo Apetulo akaajangula, “Mmoke pambani na mbiha hinu kwa henela ng'anikia yakubhe mpakombola kuhemela uwecho gwa Annoongo kwa mbiha! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Mwanga choachela mu lihengo helye kwa kubhee ntima gwinu ngakoondekwa mu kwaajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Henela, nkotime ubohu gwinu na mwajoope Hangwana annekelele kuganikia kwinu kubohu. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Nenga ndendakuhuchunika muno ndendakummona ntwelile hibhini hijingi na ntabhwitwe na mabohu!”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Asimoni akajaangula, “Choonde, nnyoopelange kwa Hangwana likotokumbata lyoha lyela pakati ja genago gannongilinge.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Apetulo na Ayohana pabhakajomolanga kulongela genago na kutangachanga Ngani Jammbone ja Annoongo, bhakabhujanga ku Yelusalemu. Pabhakibhanga bhatenditanga kubhujanga bhakatangachanga Ngani Jammbone mu hijiji hijingi ya ku Samalia.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afilipo na chilongola jumo bha ku Ethiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Akaatumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo akaalobholela Afilipo, “Nchibheke maha nyaule kusini kupetela ndela jijibhokela ku Yelusalemu kujaula ku Gaza.” Ndela jenejo jipetela kululemba. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Bahi, Afilipo akachibheka maha, akajemeka ulendo. Pabhakibha nndela akakongana na anachilongola jumo jwa ku Ethiopia, anachilongola jonojwe akibha, jwakatimbilila lupenu, yakubhee akibha ulendo kujaula kwaachabhe. Jono mundu akibha ajemelei jwa hilebhe ya amalikia Kandake jwa ku Ethiopia. Akibha atendakubhuja kubhoka ku Yelusalemu kwaajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Pabhakibha mu ulendo kubhuja kaaja akibha akwelite mutuka jijihutwa na mnyama nkolongwa jwakemitwa falasi, akibha atenda kuchoma chitabu cha Aisaya, alondohi jwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Bahi, Mboomo ja Annoongo jikaalobholela Afilipo, “Nhegelele mmandikile na mutuka hejo nnongane nalyo.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Afilipo akabhutukila kujibhandikila na mutuka, akaajoa mundu hojwe abhikuchoma mu chitabu cha Aisaya. Penapo Afilipo akaakonya jonijola akolo, “Bholi, ntendakugamanya maha genago ganchoma.”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Jono nkolo akaajangula, “Ngombolabholi kuimanya panga mundu jwa kunyigana?” Penapo akaalobholela Afilipo, “Nkwele mmutuka ninnyigane.” Ngapena akakwela na kutama pamo nabho. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Bahi, chehemu ja Majaandiko ga Annoongo, gabhachomitaje gakajandikwa henela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Akibha handa mwana ngondolo jwapelekwa kuchinjwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">akatama jii handa mwanangondolo paheketwa manjoja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">jonojwe jwangabhoa lilobhe hata kachoko.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Bhakaabheluha na kwaabhonela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Jwaakwa jwapakombola kulongela nnani ja chibhelehi chabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">kwa kubhee umomi gwake gatekubhokekwa pachilambo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Jonojwe mundu jwa ku Ethiopia akaakonya Afilipo, “Nngongolele, habha alondohi alongela ngani ja ganiki? Alongela hikubho heye ngani jabhe bhene au ngani ja mundu joongi? <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Bahi, Afilipo akajemekela chehemu hejojo ja Majaandiko ga Annoongo, akaalobholela Ngani ja Mmbone ja Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Pabhakibhanga tangu mu ulendo, bhakaikanga pagabhile na machi, na bhena Akolo bhakalobhola, pamba pabhile na machi, bholi, chaakwa chohachela cha kunhibhila ngotokubatichwa?”<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Afilipo akalobhola, “Handa ntendakuobhalela kwa ntima gwinu goha ntenda kubhatichwa?” Nabhena akajangula, “Kweli, ndendakuobhalela kubhee Ayesu Kilisito nga Amwana bha Annoongo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Bahi, jono akolo akakulumikia jenijela mutuka jijeme, na bhoha bhabhele, Afilipo na jonijola akolo bhakatulukanga, na kujingila mmachi, ngapena Afilipo akaabaticha. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Pabhakabhoka mmachi Mboomo ja Hangwana akaatenda Afilipo abhoke. Na jono jwaatindile lupenu jwangammona kabhele, nambo akaendelea na ulendo gwabhe abhikuhangalala. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Afilipo akachikolela abhi ku Azoto, akapeta hilambo yoha kongo abhikutangacha Ngani ja mmbone mpaka pabhakaika ku Kaisalia.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Asauli atendakwahobhalela Akilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:6-16">Amatayo 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Machobha genago Asauli atekapunda kwajogoanga na hijoo hijingi ya kwaakoma kwa bhenibhala bhabhankagula Hangwana. Akajaula kwa Akung'i Akolo, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />akajopa bhapekehe bhalua jakumanyikana ja nyuumba ja kongonilanga Bhayahudi konikola ku chilambo cha Damasiko, kubhee handa akoolile konokwe akanalome au akaikege bhenibhala bhabhakagula Ngani Jammbone ja Hangwana, aakamukalange na kwaletanga ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Nambo pabhakibhanga nndela kubhandikila kuika ku chilambo cha Damasiko, gunakamo njai kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo jikaamulikila kohakoha. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Akagwee pahi na akajoa lilobhe, “Asauli, Asauli! Kwaniki ntendakunagia?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Asauli akakonya, “Mwe nga aganiki Hangwana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Na lyenilela lilobhe likajangula, “Nenga na Ayesu yakubhehe mwenga ntendakunanigia. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Nambo nnyeme nangocheni, nnyingile pannyini na konokwe mpakulobholelwa gagapalikwa kutenda.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakibhanga ulendo gumo na Asauli bhakajemanga penipala bhakibhanga bhanga chakulongela, bhakajoanga lyenilela lilobhe nambo bhangaammona mundu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Asauli akajimuka, na kuunukula miho gabhe jwangakombola kulola chilebhe choha chela, henela bhenibhala bhandu bhakaatandaa kwa kwakamula lubhoko mpaka ku nnyini ku chilambo cha Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Asauli akatama machobha gatatu, na muda goha akibha ngalola choachela, muda hogwe jwangalyehe wala kung'wehe chohachela.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Bahi, konokwe kuchilambo cha Damasiko kukibha na mundu jumo jwankagula Hangwana lihina lyabhe Aanania. Hangwana akaalobholela mu kuhagamila, “Aanania!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Aanania akajeketa, “Mile pambani, Hangwana.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Hela hel Hangwana akaalobholela, “Nchibheke maha nnyaule ku ndela jijikemwa ndela Jijigolwike, na mu nyuumba ja Ayuda mwatole mundu jumo kubhoka ku Taliso akemwa Asauli, nangocheni abhi kwakotimila Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />mu agamii abhonite mundu jwakemitwa Aanania abhikujingila nkati na kwabhekela mabhoko ili alole kabhele.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Nambo Aanania akajangula, “Hangwana, ndekujoa ngani ja mundu hojo kubhoka kwa bhandu bhajingi, ndekujoha ngani ja mabohu gabhatendilinge bhandu bhinu konokwe ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Atekuika pambani abhi na mamulaka kubhoka kwa Akakung'i Akolo kwakamulanga kwa machili bhoha bhabhajopanga kwa lihina linu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Nambo Hangwana akaalobholela, “Nnyaule tu, kwa kubhee ndekwaagula abhe antumichi jwangu, atangachache lihina lyangu kwa bhandu bhoha na bhenibhala akaakolo bhabhenji na kwa bhandu bha ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Nenga namwene mbakunnangiha gajingi gagapakwaatenda alage ligongo lya lihina lyangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Bahi, Anania akajenda, akajingila mu jenijela nyuumba. Ngapena akaabhekela mabhoko Asauli, akajangula, “Apwanga Asauli, Hangwana yakubhehe nga Ayesu bhene jwakammokela pammile nndela kuika pambani, atekunduma ili nkombole kulola kabhele na kulongolelwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Kachoko hilebhe handa magagabhu hikagwehe kubhoka mmiho mwa Asauli, akakombola kulola kabhele, akajema na akabatichwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Pabhakalyee chakulya, machili gabhe gakaabhujila.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Asauli atangacha Ngani Jammbone konokwe ku Damasiko</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Asauli akatama machobha kachoko pamo na bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito konokwe kuchilambo cha Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Popopo akajemeka kutangacha Ngani Jammbone mu nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi yakubhehe Ayesu nga mwana jwa Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Bhandu bhoha bhabhaakajonikia bhakakangachanga, bhakalobhola, “Bholi, mundu hojo nga jolajola jwabhakaakomanga bhenibhala bhabhatendita kujoopa kwa lihina helye konikola ku Yelusalemu? Kabhele akaika pambani abhi kuganikia kwakamulanga bhena bhandu na kwapelekanga kwa akaakung'i!”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Asauli akapunda kupata machili, kwa namuna chibhakaalobholelanga pandaha kubhehe Ayesu nga Akilisito, Bhayahudi bhabhatamanga konokwe kuchilambo cha Damasiko bhakibha bhangali na chakulongela choachela.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Pagakapeta machobha gajingi, Bhayahudi bhakakondekananga na kulolea ndela ja kwakoma Asauli. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Kilo na muhi bhakajindelanga milyango ja kujingila pannyini ili bhapatange kwakoma. Nambo Asauli akajoa chikubho hecho. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Nambo muda gwa kilo bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakaatola, bhakaatulua pahi abhi nkati ja chikapu chikolongwa kwa kupetela mahali papatekupobholwa palikukumba lya pachilambo.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asauli atendakubhuja ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Asauli pabhakaika ku Yelusalemu akapala kuchilondanika na bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhoa bha Ayesu, nambo bhoha bhakaajogopa bhangakombolanga kwahobhalela yakubhehe jonojwe atekubhee ajabhenji jwaankagula Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Popopo, Abanaba bhakaika kwaatola Asauli, akaapeleka kwa akaandundame na kwakongolela namuna Asauli chibhakaabhona Hangwana nndela na namuna Hangwana chibhaalongile nabho. Akaakongolelanga namuna Asauli pabhakibha ajemite kwatangacha Akilisito pangali bhoga kwakola kuchilambo cha Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Bahi, Asauli akatama pamo nabho, akatyangila ku Yelusalemu joha kutangachanga lilobhe lya Hangwana panga bhoga. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Kabhele bhakalongela na kutaukananga na Bhayahudi bhabhalongelanga Chigiliki, nambo bhabhenji bhakajiganga kwaakoma. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Bhenibhala bhabhankagula Ayesu pabhakachimanyanga chikubho hecheche, bhakaapetula Asauli, bhakaapeleka ku Kasilia, bhakaaleka bhajabhule ku Taliso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Machobha genago lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhakahobhalela Ayesu bhakatamanga kwa kuhengwa pohapala mu Yudea, Galilaya, na Samalia, Lilichengwite na kukola mu kwakotimia Hangwana, na likajonjokeka likalekelwa ntima na Mboomo ja Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chibhatendite Apetulo na konokwe kuchilambo cha Lida na ku Yopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Apetulo pabhakibha mu ulendo kila mahali akaika kwa bhandu bha Annoongo bhabhatamanga kuchilambo cha Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Konokwe akaakolela mundu jumo jwakemitwa Aainea, yakubhee kwa yaaka jinane akibha agolwike pa chindanda ligongo akibha apolite. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Bahi, Apetulo akaalobholela, “Aainea Ayesu Kilisito atendakunnamia. Nnyinuke ntandike chindanda chinu.” Aainea akajimuka gunakamo. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Bhandu bhoha bha kuchilambo cha Lida na likote lya ku Saloni bhakaabhona Aainea, na bhoha bhakaakagula Hangwana.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Konokwe ku Yopa kukibha na mwikege jumo jwaahobhalela Ayesu jwakemitwa Atabitha, kwa Chigiliki nga Adoka maana gakwe, “Uloko.” Mwikege jonojwe akibha atenda gammbone na kwaajangatilanga akaahocho yaaka yoa. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Muda gonogwe akibha atamwa, akajomoka. Bhandu bhakagujoanga mmele gwabhe, na kugugoneka mu chumba ku golofa. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Chilambo cha ku Yopa chikibha changatalika muno na chilambo Lida, henela bhenibhala bhabhankagula Annoongo pabhakajoanga yakubhe Apetulo akibha ku Lida, bhakaatumanga bhandu bhabhele kwachabhe na chalaamu, “Nhikange kwaachitu chindema nkotokabha.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Bahi, Apetulo akabhoka na akajaula pamo nabho. Pabhakaika akaapelekwa ku golofa mu chenichela chuumba. Konokwe akaahelwa bhajingi bhakaatindila Apetulo bhabhikugutanga na kwaalangiha makoti na ngobho hibhatendita kuhalakia Adoka pabhakibha bhamomi. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Apetulo akaapianga panja bhoha, akatindibhalanga, na kwajopa Annoongo. Ngapena bhakatendebhukila mahiti jela na kulobhola, “Atabita, nnyimuke.” Nabhena akaunukula miho gabhe, na pabhakaabhona Apetulo, akajimuka akatama. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Apetulo akaajangatila kujema, akaakema bhenibhala bhandu bha Annoongo na bhenibhala akaawelwa, na kwakamuanga kwachabhenji abhi jwamomi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Ngani ja chikubho hecheche chikajenela kohakoha ku Yopa, bhandu bhajingi bhakaobhalela Hangwana. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Apetulo akatama kwa machobha kachoko ku Yopa, akatama kwa mundu jwaabhamba mambendela jwakemitwa Asimoni.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Apetulo na Akolonelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Pakibha na mundu jumo lihina lyabhe Akoloneli jwatamita ku Kaisalia yakubhee akibha akolo bha chibhoga cha manyemba chikemitwa, “Chibhoga cha ku Italia.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Akibha mundu jwa kwakoonda Anoonngo, jonojwe pamo na alongo bhabhe bhoha bhatenita kwaajopa Annoongo, atendita gajingi na kwaajangatilanga akaahocho bha Chiyahudi, na jonojwe atendita kwaajopa Annoongo machobha goha. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Lichobha limo, pajikahika handa chaa ticha ja muhi, akalola maha mu hagamii antumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo abhikwahikila, kwalobholela, “Akolonelio!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Akolonelio akalolekea muno jonojwe kwa bhoga, akaalobholela, “Chibhi niki akolo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Bhena antumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo akaalobholela, “Annoongo ajoine kujopa kwinu na kubhona yadaka hinu kwa akaocho wala ngailibhalila. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Nangocheni, mwaatumange akaatumichi bhinu kachoko bhajendange ku Yopa bhakaakema mundu jumo jwaakemitwa Asimoni yakubhee lihina lyabhe lyengi nga Apetulo. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Jonojwe abhile kaaja kwa Asimoni, jonijola jwaabhamba mambendela, jwaatama kubhandikila na bahali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Jono antumichi jwa kunani kwa Annoongo pabhakabhoka, Akoloneli akakemanga akaatumichi bhabhele bhabhatendita kupangana mahengo ga nkati pamo na linyemba limo jwaatendita kwajopa Annoongo jwaakibha ajemelei bhabhe. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Akolonelio akaalobholelanga goha gagabhokile, na akaatumanga bhajendange ku Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Malabhi jakwe, bhena bhandu bhatatu bhabhi tangu ulendo, nambo kubhandikila kuika ku Yopa, ikibha handa chaa chita ja muhi Apetulo akakwela na kujaula ku chuumba cha nnani kujaula kwaajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Akibha na njala, akapala kulyehe chakulya. Chakulya pachitendita kutelekwa, akaagamila malolo. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Akakubhona kunani kwa Annoongo kujogwike na chilebhe handa chuka ngolongwa jibhikutukukikwa pahi jibhi jikamwilwe pande yabhe yoha ncheche. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Nkati ja chuka hejo kukibha na kila chinyama, hinyama hihibhile na makongono ncheche, hinyama yakwabha na hijuni. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Ngapena akajoa lilobhe, “Apetulo, nnyeme nchinje, nlyee!”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Apetulo akajangula, “Hopo, Hangwana, nenga nangapaa chilebhe choachela yakubhee nga nhilo au chakulya chichaatenda mundu akotokondekwa mu ndela ja kwaajopa Annoongo.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Akojoa kabhele lyenilye lilobhe, “Nkotokema nhilo yaakulya yakubhee Annoongo atekuhijelejea!” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Chikubho heche chikajibhujila patatu, ngapena jenijela chuuka jikabhujikwa kunani kwa Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Apetulo pabhakibha tangu atendakukangacha malolo genago maana gakwe chiniki, bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakatumwanga na Akoloneli, pabhakajimanya nyuumba ja Asimoni, bhakaikanga na kujema panlyango, <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />bhakakonyanga kwa lilobhe, “Bholi, pambani abhile ageni joajola jwakemitwa Asimoni Petulo?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Apetulo akibha tangu atendakuganikia genigala malolo, na penapo Mboomo ja Annoongo jikaalobholela, “Nnyohanikihe! Bhabhile bhandu bhatatu pambani, bhatendakunnoleha mwenga. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Ntuluke chindema na wala nkotokubhee na lipamba kujaula pamo nabho kwa kubhee nenga nga ndekwaatumanga.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Apetulo akatuluka na kwaalobholela bhenibhala bhandu, “Nenga nga jonijola jumunnoleanga. Nkagwilinge chiniki?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Bhenaangota bhakaajangula, “Akolonelio akolo bha manyemba, mundu jwammbone, jwaampala Annoongo na jwaatopelwa na Bhayahudi bhoa, atutumite. Atekulobholelwa na antumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo abhatumange bhandu bhaikange kwaachinu ili ajoanikie choachela chimpakwaalobholela.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Apetulo akaapokelanga, akaapekeanga pakugoloka kilo chela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Malabhi jakwe, Apetulo akajemeka ulendo pamo na bhenaangota, na akalongana na bhandu bhangi bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bha ku Yopa. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Lichobha lya bhele bhakahikanga ku Kaisalia. Konokwe Akolineli atendita kwalendela pamo na akaalongo na akaaganja bhabhakaalalikanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Apetulo pabhatendita kujingila, Akolineli akabhoka kwaapokela akaatindibhala majugwa na kwaakomitila kwa kwatopea. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Nambo Apetulo akaajinula, akaalobholela, “Nnyeme, kwakubhee nenga hela hela namwene na amundu handa mwenga.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Apetulo akapunda kulongela na Akolonelio pabhakibha bhatendakujingila mu nyuumba yakubhee akaakolelanga bhandu bhajingi bhatekulondanikanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Apetulo akaalobholelanga, “Mwangota mwabhene ntendakuimanyanga kubhee Nnyahudi joajola atekanikilwa na malagilo gakwe ga dini kondekana na bhandu bha hilambo yengi au kwatyangila. Nambo Annoongo atekunangia, ngotokunng'anikia mundu joajola kubhee ngakondekwa kwa ndela ja kwaajopa Annoongo au ahakwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Henela pantekungemanga nangakana kuhika, bahi ndendakunkonyanga ntekungemelanga chiniki?” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Akolinelio akalongela, “Machobha ga tatu gagapetite, mu chaa hejeje, yaani chaa ticha, pandendita kwaajopa Annoongo ku chuumba changu, ngamona mundu awalite ngobho hiyuu kuu, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />akalobhola, ‘Akolinelio! Kujoopa kwinu kutekujoanika, na yadaka hinu hiintekwaapekea akaahocho hitekondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Bahi, mwatume bhandu bhajaulange ku Yopa bhakaankeme mundu jumo jwakemitwa Asimoni, kwa lihina lyengi Apetulo, abhi kaaja kwa Asimoni jwahalakia hilebhe kwa kutumia mambendela jwaatama kubhandikila na bahali.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Henela nakaatumanga bhandu kwaachinu, na mwenga ntekutenda yambone kuika. Bahi nangocheni twenga twaabhoha pamba tubhi nnongi ja Annoongo, tukombole kugajoanika malobhe gohagala gabhatekunhukumula Hangwana ntulobholele.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhe ga Apetulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Ngapena Apetulo akajemeka kulongela, “Nangocheni ndekuhimanya kweli Annoongo ngapendelea, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />nambo kila mundu jwa chilambo choachela jwaajopa Annoongo na kupangana gagakondekwa na jonojwe apakondekwa na jonojwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Gongoni nga gonigola ujumbe gubhakaguleta Annoongo kwa bhandu bha ku Isilaeli, abhikutangacha Ngani Jammbone jijileta kuhengwa kwa Annoongo kwa ndela ja Ayesu Kilisito yakubhee nga Hangwana bha bhoha. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Chikubho chela mwangota ntekuchimanyanga, chichikajenela mu chilambo choa cha Bhayahudi kujemekela ku Galilaya, Ayohana pabhakajomola kwatangachianga bhandu ngani jabhe ja ubaticho. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Ndendakumanya Annoongo chibhakaahagula Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti kwa kwapekea Mboomo jabhe na ukolo. Koakola kubhakajaula akatenda hikubho yammbone ya kwalamianga mahoka ligongo Annoongo akibha pamoa na jonojwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Twenga twabhene tujoine na kuhilola hikubho yoha hihiteendikwe mu chilambo cha Bhayahudi na ku Yudea. Konokwe bhakaakoma kwa kwaabhamba pa nchalaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Nambo Annoongo akaayoha lichobha lya tatu, ngapena akaatenda abhonekane na bhandu, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />ngabha kwa bhandu bhoha, nambo kwa bhenibhala Annoongo bhabhaagwile bhabhangange bhenibhala bhabhajoine na kulola, nga twenga bhatulile na kung'we pamo nabho penipala pabhakayoka. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Akatulumikia tutangache Ngani Jammbone kwa bhandu na kwalobholelanga genigala gatugabhonite kubhee hojo nga jwaatekuagulikwa na Annoongo abhee Jwakuhumula bhabhabhilinge bhamoomi na bhabhawilinge. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Akaalondohi bhoha bha Annoongo bhakalongelanga ngani yabhe, kubhee kila mundu jwaapakwahobhalela apakulekelelwa kulemwa kwabhe koha kwa lihina lyabhe.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akolonelio na akaalongo bhabhe bhampokela Mboomo jwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Apetulo pabhakibha atenda kulobhola malobhe hago Mboomo jwa Annoongo akaatulukilanga bhoha bhabhakajoanga lilobhe lyela. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Akaayahudi bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhoa yakubhee bhabhakahikanga na Apetulo kubhoka ku Yopa, bhakakangachanga kulola kubhee Annoongo akaapekeanga machili ga Mboomo ja Annoongo kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi kabhele. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Bhakahimanyanga henela, kwakubhe bhakaajoanga bhabhikulongela kwa hilongelo yengi na kwalumbalila Annoongo. Ngapena Apetulo akalobhola, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Bhandu habha bhampokile Mboomo ja Annoongo handa twenga chitwaapokile. Bholi abhile mundu joajola jwakombola kwaahibhila bhakotokubatichwanga kwa machi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Akaakulumikianga bhatichwange kwa lihina lyakwe Ayesu Kilisito. Ngapena bhenibhala bhandu bhakaajopa Apetulo atame nabho kwa machobha kachoko.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Malobhe ga Apetulo kwa bhandu bhabhahobhalile Akilisito bhabhatamanga ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Bahi akandundame na bhabhahobhalela Akilisito konokwe ku Yudea bhakapatanga ngani ya kubhee bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi nabhonji bhatekulipokelanga Lilobhe lya Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Apetulo pabhakabhuja ku Yelusalemu, bhenibhala Bhayahudi bhabhahobhalela Ayesu na bhabhakapalanga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhahinwange, bhakaakalipila, bhabhikwalobholela, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Mwenga ntekujaula ku nyuumba ja bhandu bhangahinwanga na nkatama nabho kulyee nabho chakulya!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Apetulo akajemeka kongolela ngani ja genigala gagakatendeka kubhokela kandahi,<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />Apetulo akajangu, “Lichobha limo panakibha ndendakwajopa Annoongo ku Yopa, nakabhona malolo, nakabhona chilebhe handa chuuka ngolongwa jibhikikwa pahi kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo jibhi jikamwilwe pande yoa ncheche, jibhikubhekwa kubhandikila na nenga. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nakalingulila nkati maha nakabhona hinyama bhabhabhilinge na makongono ncheche, hinyama bha kumanyai hiikwabha na hijuni. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ngapena nakajoa na lilobhe, ‘Apetulo, nnyeme, nchinje nlyee.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Nambo nenga nakalobhola, ‘Hangwana, hopo, kwakubhee chilebhe changakondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo au chiakwa ngakombola kujingila mu kang'wa jangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Chikubho heche chikatendeka pabhele kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo, ‘Nha nhilo kukema chilebhe chihakwa chilebhe chichitekuhalakilwa na Annoongo.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Heche chikubho chikatendeka patatu, ngapena hilebhe yoha bhakaihutanga kabhele kunani kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Bhandu bhatatu bhabhakatumwanga kubhoka ku Kaisalia bhaikange kwaachangu bhakahikanga ku nyuumba jinakahikila. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Mboomo jwa Annoongo akanobholela nngagule nabho, pangali lipamba. Akanung'una habhabha chita nabhenabho bhakajaulanga pamo nanenga, tukajingila mu nyuumba ja mundu jola. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Bhakatukongolela namuna chibhabhonite antumichi bha Annoongo bhabhakajema nnyumba jabhe na kwaalobholela, ‘Mwatume bhandu bhajaulange ku Yopa nkakeme Asimoni jwakemitwa kwa lihina lyengi Apetulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Jonojwe apakunnobholela malobhe kwa kupetela malobhe genago mwenga na akaalongo bhinu bhoa mpakuhokolewanga.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Panakajemeka kulongela, Mboomo ja Annoongo akaatulukianga handa chibhakatutulukia twenga panipala kandahi. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ngakombokela lilobhe lyela lya Hangwana, chibhakalobhola, ‘Ayohana akabhaticha kwa machi, nambo mwangota mpakubatichwa kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Bahi, handa Annoongo atekumpekwapekea bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi Mboomo jwabhe jolajola jwaatupekie twenga patukahobhalela Hangwana Ayesu Kilisito, nenga nga ganiki ngombole kwaakana Annoongo?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Pabhakajoanga malobhe genago bhakakotokanga, na kwalumbalila Annoongo, kulongela, “Bahi, Annoongo atekwapekea bhangu bhanga Bhayahudi upenyo gwa kukonda na kuleka mabohu gabhenji ili bhapatange umomi.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilubhalo lya bhandu bha Antiokia lilyakahobhalela Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Bahi, bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakahobhalela Ayesu bhabhakapwilinganika ligongo lya konikola kulaga kukolongwa kwa ngani jijikaabhokela Asitefano, bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhakabhutukanga na kujaula ku Fonike na ku Kipulo na Antiokia, bhakatangachanga lyenilela lilobhe kwa Bhayahudi jikajabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Nambo bhangi pakati jabhenji bhabhakabhokanga ku Kipulo na ku Kilene, na bhenabho bhakajaulanga ku Antiokia bhakalobholanga na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, hela hela akaatangachianga Ngani Jammbone ja Hangwana Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Mchili ga Hangwana gakabhee pamo nabho, bhandu bhajingi bhakahobhalela na kwatendebhukila Hangwana.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Ngani hejo jikajohanika kwa bhandu bhabhahobhelela Ayesu bhabhatamita ku Yelusalemu, bahi akaatuma Abanaba ajaule ku Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Pabhakahika konokwe na kubhona namuna Annoongo chiatekwapea bhena bhandu neema jabhe, akahachuka na kwakulumikia bhapundange kubhee bhakuhaminika kwa Hangwana. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Abanaba nga mundu jwammbone, jwahobhalela na jwalongolelwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo, bhandu bhajingi bhatekujonjokeka upande gwa Hangwana.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ngapena Abanaba akajaula ku chalambo cha Taliso kwaloleha Asauli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Pabhakampata akaaleta ku Antiokia. Na bhoa bhabhele bhakakatamanga na lyenilyela libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalile Akilisito kwa chaka choa bhakajigananga libhoga likolongwa lya bhandu. Konokwe ku Antiokia, nga kukukajemeka kukemwa lilubhalo lilikaahobhalela Ayesu kukemwanga Akaakilisito.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Machobha gogogo akalondohi bha Annoongo bhakahikanga kubhoka ku Antiokia kubhoka ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Alondohi bha Annoongo bhamo lihina lyabhe Agabo, akajema kwa ukolo gwa Mboomo jwa Annoongo akalondola kupakubhee likuluta mu chilambo choa. Likuluta lyenelyo likaika machobha ga Akaisali Tibelio pabhatendita kuhukumula. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Bhenibhala bhabhachigana bha ku Antiokia, bhakaamuanga kila jumo jwabhenji handa chibhapakombola abhoe chilebhe choachela ligongo lya kwajangatilanga bhenibhala bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhabhatamanga ku Yudea. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Bhakatendanga henela, na bhakaatumanga Abanaba na Asauli bhapelekange mbiya heyo kwa akaakolo bha lilubhalo lilyahobhalela Akilisito konokwe ku Yudea.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Chibhoga chichaahobhalela Akilisito bhapunda kulaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Machobha gogogo, amwenye Ahelode Gilipa akajemeka kwakamula na kwalagianga bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito.<verse eid="ACT 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Akaakoma Ayakobo anung'una bhabhe Ayohana kwa upanga.<verse eid="ACT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Pabhakaalola chikubho hecho chitekwaabhajilanga Bhayahudi, akaendelea, akaakamula Apetulo. Chikubho chenecho chikatendeka machobha ga lichobha likolongwa lya mikate yangalekelwa ngedule. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Pabhakaakamula Apetulo akapelekwa mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. Konokwe atenditwa kujemelewa na hibhoga nchenche na kila chibhoka chikibha na manyemba ncheche. Ahelode akapala kwapeleka nnoongi ja bhandu ili bhanhukumule pajikapeta lichobha lya Pasaka. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Henela, Apetulo pabhakibha mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu, nambo kwa ntima gumo chibhoga cha bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito chitendita kwajopela kwa Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apetulo atendakujogolekwa kubhoka mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Kilo chenichela tangu Ahelode Gilipa jwangampia Apetulo nnongi ja bhandu kupala kwahukumula, Apetulo akagoloka pakati ja manyemba gabhele. Akatabha kwa minyololo jibhele, na manyemba gatendita kulendela panlyango. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Nga'ng'anu antumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo akaabhokela na nhana gukaamulikila monimola mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. Antumichi jwa Annoongo jonojwe akaakwaa Apetulo palibhega na kwaajimuha, na kwalobholela, “Mmoke chindema!” Palapala jenijela minyololo jijibhakaatabha Apetulo mmabhoko jikahengeleka na kugwee pahi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Jono antumichi jwa kunani kwa Annoongo akaalobholela, “Ntabhe nkanda gwinu,” Apetulo akatenda henela. Ngapena akaalobhalela, “Nhwale likoti linu ngagule.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Apetulo akabhoka monimola mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu abhi alongine na jonijola antumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo. Kongo abhi tangu kuimanya kubhee gagabhokile gakibha ga kweli, akaganikia kubhee abhi mu malolo. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Bhakapetanga nlyango gugukajemeka na gwa bhele, ngapena bhakaikanga ku nlyango gwa chiano gwa kujingilila kunnyini. Nlyango gukajogoka guyene, na bhenaangota bhakapitanga paanja. Pabhatendita kujenda mu ndela jimo na kachoko jonijola antumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo akaaleka Apetulo jika jabhe.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ngapena Apetulo pabhakagamanya gagabhokile akalobhola, “Nangocheni ndenda kuimanya kweli Hangwana antumite antumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo kunhokoa kubhoka mmabhokoa ga Ahelode na kubhoka mu genigala goa gabhatendita kuhobhalela bha Isilaeli.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Kachoko Apetulo pabhakaimanya akajaula kaja kwa Amalia, anyoongo bhabhe Ayohana jwakemitwa Amaluko, konokwe bhandu bhajingi bhakakongananga ligongo lya kwajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Apetulo akahodika pa nniyango gwa panja, abhanda bhamo mwikege lihina lyabhe Aloda, akaika panlyango kujoanikia. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Mwikege jonojwe pabhakalimanya lilobhe lya Apetulo, akahangalala muno akaleta kujogola nlyango na akabhuja nkati chindema kwalobholelanga kubhehe, Apetulo abhile panlyango. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Bhakannolobholela bhenibhala antumichi haikege, “Mwenga ntekupoganikwa.” Pabhakapunda kwaalobholela kubhee nga kweli, bhakaalobholelanga, “Komboleka jonojwe jumummonite nga lihoka lyabhe.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Nambo Apetulo akapunda kukong'onda nnlyango, na bhenaangota pabhakajogolanga nnlyango na kwabhona Apetulo, bhakakangachanga muno. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Apetulo akaapungilanga mabhoko kubhee bhakotokange, akaalobholela henela Hangwana chibhabhoite mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. Jonojwe akapunda kwalobholelanga, “Bhajaulange kwalobholela ngani heye angota Ayakobo na bhenibhala bhandu bhangi bhabhakahobhalela Akilisito.” Ngapena pabhakajomola akabhoka.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Pajikahika kundabhi manyemba bhakajogopanga muno kwa genigala gagaapatite Apetulo. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Ahelode akahukumula bhannoleange kila mahali nambo bhangampata. Akakulumikia manyemba bhakonywange na akalobhola bhakomekwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Pagapeta genago Ahelode akabhoka ku Yudea na akajaula ku Kaisali, akatama kwa machobha kachoko.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amwenye Ahelode Gilipa atendakujomoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Bahi Ahelode akaatumbalilanga muno na bhandu bha ku Tilo na ku Sidoni. Nambo bhenaangota bhakaapelekela bhandu bhakaapembelee. Bhenaangota bhakombolanga kumpata Abulasito jwaakibha ajemelei akolo bha nyuumba ja amwenye abhee upande gwabhenji. Ngapena bhakaajendelela amwenye Ahelode Gilipa na kwajopa kubhee na kuhengwa, ligongo chilambo chabhenji chikakulupalila kupata chaakulya kubhoka mu chilambo cha amwenye bhenabho.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Lichobha limo lilikahagulikwa, Ahelode akawala ngobho yabhe ya chimwenye, akatama pa chitebhu chabhe cha umwenye na akajemeka kulongela na bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Bhandu bhabhakalondanika bhakapotanga nyenye, bhakalobholanga, “Helye nga lilobhe lya annoongo, ngabha lya mundu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Popopo antumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo akaagiwa pahi Ahelode ligongo jwangampekea Annoongo ukolo gonogwe, akalwala njoka ya lipango na akajomoka.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Nambo Lilobhe lya Annoongo likapunda kujenela na kukola.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Abanaba na Asauli pabhakajomolanga lyenilela lihengo lyabhenji libhakajaula kupangana, bhakabhujanga ku Yelusalemu bhakaatola Ayohana jwaakemitwa Amaluko.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Abanaba na Asauli bhatendakuagulikwa na kutumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mu lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bha ku Antiokia bhakibhanga akaalondoi na bhabhajigananga, pakati jabhenji bhakibhanga Abanaba, Asimioni jwaakemitwa Apili, Alukio jwa kubhoka chilambo cha ku Kilene, na Asauli na Amanaeni, jwabhakannela pamo na Ahelode Antipasi na Asauli. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Pabhakibhanga bhatendakwaajopa Hangwana na kutabha, Mboomo ja Annoongo akalobhola, “Nhagulilange Asauli na Abanaba kwa lihengo lyela linankemelinge.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Pabhakajomolanga kutabha na kwaajoopa Annoongo, bhakaabhekelanga mabhoko Abanaba na Asauli na kwaatumanga bhajendange kupangana lihengo lya kutangacha Ngani Jammbone.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abanaba na Asauli bhajaulanga ku Kipulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Henela, Abanaba na Asauli bhakatumwanga na Mboomo jwa Annoongo, bhakatulukanga kujaulanga ku Seleukia na kubhoka konokwe bhakakwelanga meeli na kujaula pachilumba cha ku kupulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Pabhakaikanga mu chilambo cha ku Salami, bhakatangachanga Lilobhe lya Annoongo mu nyuumba ja kongonilanga Bhayahudi. Kabhele Ayohana Maluko atenditakwaajangatila mu lihengo lyabhenji.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Bhakajendanga kubhoka upande gumo gwa chilumba mpaka mu chilambo cha ku Pafo, bhakakongana nabho na Ayahudi jumo ahabhi akibha alondoi bha unami, lihina lyabhe Abali yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Mundu hojo akibha pamo na Asegio Paulo, akolo jwa chenichela chiluumba, yakubhee akibha mundu jwakumanya muno. Asegio Paulo bhakaakema Asauli na Abanaba apalita kujoha lilobhe lya Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Nambo bhakakanangwa na ahabhi Aelima yakubhee handa lihina lyakwe chilikakemwa kwa Chigiliki jonojwe akalenga kwaakanikia akolo jwa chiluumba cha ku Kupulo akotokwaahobhalela Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Ngapena Asauli, yakubhee kabhele jwakemitwa Apaulo, abhikutandaikwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo, akaalolekea miho jono Aelima ahabhi, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />akaalobholela, “Mwe mwa anami, mwenga nga mwana jwa Lichetani! Mwenga nga apwati bha kila chichibhile chambone! Ntekutwelela kila chilebhe cha unami. Bholi, mwangaleka kwaatembanga bhandu bhakotokagula ndela ya Hangwana hihigolwike? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Nangocheni nnyohanikie, ukolo gwa Hangwana gubhile nnongi jinu. Mpakubhee ngalola, wala ngalola lyobha kwa machobha kachoko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Popopo Aelima akajingilwa na chikopi mmiho gabhe akalepela kulola na abhikulolea mundu jwa kwaakamula lubhoko. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Bhenibhala akolo bha chenichela chiluumba chibhaakabhona gagabhokile akaahobhalela Ayesu ligongo akakangacha pabhakajoa majigano ga Hangwana Ayesu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo na Abanaba konikola ku Antiokia ja ku Pisidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Ngapena Apaulo na ajabhe bhakabhokanga ku Pafo bhakajaulanga mpaka ku Peliga kono ku Pamfilia. Nambo, Ayohana jwakemitwa Amaluko akaalekanga konokwe akabhuja ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Kubhoka ku Peliga bhakaendeleanga na ulendo mpaka ku Antiokia ja Pisidia. Lichobha lya Kupomolela bhakajingilanga nkati ja nyuumba jakonganilanga Bhayahudi bhakatamanga.<verse eid="ACT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Pabhakachomanga chitabu cha Malagilo ga Amusa na hitabu ya akaalondoi bha Annoongo, akaakolo bha jenijela nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi bhatumianga bhakaalobholelanga, “Anung'una handa mmilinge na lilobhe lya kwaajangatilanga bhandu habha, choonde mwalobholelange.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Apaulo akajema, kwapungilanga mabhoko bhandu na kulobhola,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Mwangota bhandu bha ku Isilaeli akaajangu na mwangota mabhoa bhamwajopa Annoongo nnyoanikiange. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Annoongo bha bhandu abha bha ku Isilaeli akaagulanga akaakolo bhitu, akabhatenda bhandu bhabhee chilambo chikolongwa pabhakibhanga konikola ku Misili. Annoongo akaabhabhoanga konokwe kwa machili gabhe makolo. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Akaapumilianga hikubho yabhenji kwa yaaka makomi ncheche konikola kululemba. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Annoongo akaatinianga bhandu bhoa bha hiilongelo saba ya ku Kanaani, akabhapekeanga bhandu bhabhe chenichela chilambo chibhee chabhenji.” <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Haga goha gakatendeka kwa yaaka handa mia ncheche na amusini.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Pagakapeta gangani, Annoongo bhakapekeanga bhandu bhakutapulana bulwa gwabheji mpaka machobha ga Asamweli alondoi jwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ngapena bhandu bhakajoopanga bhaapekehe amwenye, nabhena Annoongo bhakaapekeanga Asauli mwana jwa ku Kishi bha chilongelo cha Abenjamini. Na jonojwe akibha atawala kwa yaaka makomi ncheche. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Annoongo pabhakaabhoa Asauli mu ukolo, akaagula Adaudi kubhee akolo bhabhenji. Yakubhee akalola akalobhola, ‘Ndekwaabhona Adaudi mwana jwa Ayese, mundu jwaubhajila ntima gwangu, apakwela gaganigapala goha.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kubhoka mu ubhelei gwa hojo Adaudi, Annoongo atekwapelekelanga bhandu bha ku Isilaeli Mwokochi yakubhee nga Ayesu, handa chibhakaalobholenga. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Tangu Ayesu jwangajemeka lihengo lyabhe, Ayohana akatangachianga bhandu bhoa bha ku Isilaeli ngani ja kuleka mabohu na kubatichwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Ayohana pabhakajomola kulobhola malobhe gabhe, akaalobholelanga bhandu, ‘Bholi, mwangoota nng'anikianga nenga nga aganiki? Nenga ngabha jonijola Ayesu jumunnendelanga. Jonojwe jwaahika kuyeto jangu nenga ngapalikwa hata kwaahula migoji ja champali yabhe mu makongono gabhe.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Akaanung'una bhangu bha ku Isilaeli, bhana bha Aibulahimu, na mwangota bhandu bha hilambo bhabhaobhalelanga Annoongo, ngani heje ya kuokolewa jiikite ligongo litu twenga twabhoa. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Ligongo bhandu bha ku Yelusalemu na akaakolo bhabhenji bhangaamanya kubhee jonojwe nga akombohi wala bhangaelewanga malobhe ga akaalondoi gagachomwanga kila Lichobha lya Kupomolela, nambo hata henela bhakagapangana genago gakweele ga kupala kwahukumula Ayesu akomekwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Chiikaabhee bhangapatanga ligongo lyohalela lya kwaahukumula kujomoka, bhakaajopa Apilato bhaukumule ajomoke. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Pabhakajomolanga kupangana galagala goha gagajaandikwe ligongo lyabhe, pabhakaakoma kwa kwaabhamba panchalaba bhakaatuluha na kwaachikwa mu mbaako lilikabhachwa pamwala. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Nambo Annoongo akaayoha. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Nabhena, kwa machobha gajingi bhakaabhokela bhenibhala bhabhakibhanga pamo kujemekela ku Galilaya mpaka ku Yelusalemu. Nabhenabhao nga nangocheni nga bhabhalobholanga ngani hibhaibhonitinge na kuijoanga kwa bhandu bha ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Twenga tutendakunnetelanga Ngani Jammbone yakubhee genigala Annoongo gabhakalobholanga akaakolo bhitu kubhee, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />nagocheni gatekweela kwaachitu twenga bhana bhabhe, kwa kwayoha Ayesu, handa chijaandikwe mu zabuli jabhele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Mwenga nga Mwana jwangu, leleni ndekubhee atati bhinu.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Ngani ja kwaayoha, akotokubhuja kabhele konokwe na kubhola, Annoongo akalobhola henela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Mbakuntendela gammbone ga Annoongo na genigala ganakaahidi Adaudi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Kweli, na mu majandiko gangi ga Zabuli alobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Ngaaleka antumichi jwinu jwammbone abhole.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Nangocheni, Adaudi bhene akatenda handa Annoongo chibhakapala machobha gala, ngapena akajomoka na kuchikwa kubhandikila na akanahota bhabhe na mmele gwabhe gukabhola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Nambo jonijola yakubhehe Annoongo akaayoha jwangabhola. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Henela akaanungung'una bhangu, muimanyange kubhee ndela ja hojo mundu kwa ngani ja kulekelelwa kulemwa kwinunji kutendakutangachwa kwaachinu. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Mundu joajola jwaahobhalela Ayesu apakulekelelwa kulemwa kwabhenji koha, chikubho changakomboleka kubhokela kwa kugakamula Malagilo ga Amusa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Henela nangocheni, nchibhekange kutali ili gakoto kumpatanga genigala gagalobholikwe na akaalondoi bha Annoongo,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Nyoanikiange mwangota bhamwabheluanga akaajinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">nkangachange nhobhange!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Kwakubhee chilebhe chintendanga ngocheni, mu machobha ginu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">nga chilebhe yakubhee ngahobhelelanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">hata mundu akinnobholelanga.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Apaulo na Abanaba pabhabhokitanga mu nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi, bhenibhala bhandu bhakaalalikanga bhahikange kabhele Lichobha lya Kupomolela lilihika, kubhee bhalongelange muno ngani ja hikubho yeneyo. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Chikomiti chenecho pachikajomoka, Bhayahudi bhajingi na bhandu bha hilambo yengi bhabhakakagula dini ja Chiyahudi bhakaakagulanga Apaulo na Abanaba. Bhena akaandundame bhakalongela nabho, bhakaalekelanga mitima bhakapundange kutamanga bhabhikuhobhalela neema ja Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Lichobha lya Kupomolela lilikahika, kubhandikila kila mundu mu chenichela chilambo akahika kujoanikia Ngani Jammbone ja Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Nambo Bhayahudi pabhakalibhona lyenilyela libhoga lya bhandu bhakibhanga na bhwihu, na bhakataukanga chibhatendita kulongela Apaulo na kwatukana. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Ngapena Apaulo na Abanaba bhakalongelanga nabho pangali bhooga, kulobhola, “Hikapalikwa oti lilobhe lya Annoongo linhikilange mwangota, nambo mwangota ntekananga henela, ntekuchihukumulanga mwaachinabhene kubhee ngapalikwa kupokela umomi gwa machobha goha, bahi tutendakunnekanga na kwaajendelela bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Hangwana atekutulagia henela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Ndekuntenda mwenga kubhee nhana gwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">ili bhandu bha pachilambo choa bhakombolange kuhokolewanga.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Bhandu bha hilambo yengi pabhakaajoanga chikubho hecho bhakahangalala, bhakagalumbalilanga malobhe ga Annoongo, na bhenibhala bhabhakahagulikwa na Annoongo kupata umomi gwa machobha goa, bhakaahobhalela Hangwana Ayesu.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Lilobhe lya Hangwana likajenela mu chenichela chilambo choha. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Nambo Bhayahudi bhakaakolekeanga akaikege bhabhakibha bhammbone bha hilambo yengi bhabhatendita kwahobhalela Annoongo, na akanalome bhakumanyikana muno bha chenichela chilambo. Ngapena bhakajemekanga kwalagianga Apaulo na Abanaba, bhakaabhenganga kubhoka mu chilambo chabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Bahi, akaandundame bhakapyatanga lutukunda gagakibha mmakongono kulangia hilolelo ja kwaanyamukanga, ngapena bhakajaulanga ku Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Nambo bhenibhala bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bha konokwe ku chilambo cha Antiokio bhakalongolelwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Apaulo na Abanaba konokwe ku Ikonio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Chikubho handa chenecho chikatendeka kabhele konokwe kuchilambo cha Ikonio, Apaulo na Abanaba bhakajingilanga pamo mu nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi handa chihiyobhalilikwe. Konokwe bhakatangachanga kwa machili makolongwa yakubhee Bhayahudi pamo na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhabhahobhalela Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Nambo Bhayahudi bhabhakakananga kwahobhalela Ayesu, bhakaakolekeanga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, bhakatumbalanga nkati ja mitima jabhenji kwaakananga bhenibhala bhabhaobhalilinge. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Henela Apaulo na Abanaba bhakatamanga konokwe machobha gajingi bhatenditanga kutangachanga ngani ya Hangwana panga bhoga, najono Hangwana akalongela malobhe ga kweli gabhakalongela kupetela upaliho gugutekujimbiika, kwa kwakomboleanga kupangana yakangachika na hilolelo. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Nambo bhandu bha mu chilambo chela bhakametunikanga bhangi bhakaakondanga na Bhayahudi na bhangi upande gwa akandundame.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi na Bhayahudi bhakajangatilananga na akaakolo bhabhenji, bhakapalanga kwatendelanga gangalimmbone bhena akaandundame na kwapota maganga. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Nambo akandundame pabhakajohanga ngani heyo bhakabhutukilanga ku hilambo ya Lusitila na Delube, hilambo ya Likaonia na hilambo hiikatindilanga, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />konokwe bhakaendeleanga kutangachanga Ngani Jammbone.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo na Abanaba kunokwe ku Lusitila na Delube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Mu chilambo cha ku Lusitila, kukibha na nangwabha jumo mwanalome yakubhee akibha nangwabha na jwangajenda hopo kubhokela kubhelekwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Mundu jonojwe pabhatendita kwaajoanikia Apaulo chibhatendita kutangacha Ngani Jammbone. Apaulo pabhakaalola muno na kuimanya akahobhalela kupala kulamiwa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Apaulo akaalobholela kwa lilobhe likolongwa, “Nnyeme kwa makongono ginu!” Guna kamo mundu jonojwe jwaakibha nangwabha akajema chindema na kujemeka kujeenda! <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Gonigola nkutuli gwa bhandu pagukalola genigala gagatendikwe na Apaulo, bhakapotanga nyenye kwa chilongelo chabhenji cha Kilikaonia kulobholanga, “Minnoongo hibhonekana handa bhandu na yene hitekututulukia twenga!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Bhakaakema Abanaba Azeu lihina lya annoongo bhabhenji akolo na bhakankema Apaulo Ahelime lihina lya annoongo bhabhenji jongi kwa kubhee jonojwe akibha jwakulongela. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Akung'i jwa Nyuumba ja Annoongo ja Azeu, jijikibha nnyenje ja chilambo, akaleta makambako ga ng'oombe na ngwaupa ja malobha nnongi ja nlyango nkolongwa gwa chilambo, jonojwe pamo na nkutuli gwa bhandu bhakapala kwabhekelanga akaandundame.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Nambo akandundame Apaulo na Abanaba pabhakajoanga na kulolanga hikubho heye hibhaakapalanga kupangana, bhakapapulana ngobho yabhenji kulangia kubhee ngapalanga kubhekelanga hokwe na kubhutukilanga na kulongela kwa lilobhe likolongwa, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Mwaangota bhandu, kwa niki ntendanga hikubho heyeye? Twenga nga bhandu handa mwangoota! Tutendakunnetelanga Ngani Jammbone, handa tunkongolilinge nntendebhukange nnekange kuchalila hidimu mkabhujile Annoongo jwaabhile jwamomi, jwahahalakie kunani kwa Annoongo na pachilambo na bahali na kila chilebhe chichibhile nkati jakwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Lolo Annoongo akalekelea bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhatamange handa chibhapalanga. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Nambo bhangaleka kwaalangianga bhandu kubhee abhile. Atekulangia kubhee atendakwaapalanga muno kwa kwanyechelanga hula kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo na kwaapekeanga yakulya kwa machobha gakwe, nabhena bhatekumpekeanga yakulya ndu na kujiangalila mitima jinunji.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Kwa kulobhola malobhe genago, Apaulo na Abanaba bhakakombolanga kwahibhila bhandu bhenabho kwa kulimba muno bhakotokwaabhekelanga handa minoongo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Ngapena bhakaikanga Bhayahudi bhangi kubhoka ku Antiokia na ku Ikonio bhakaatendanga bhabhee pamo nabho, bhakaapota Apaulo kwa maganga, bhakautangilanga mpaka panja ja chilambo, bhakaganikianga kubhee ajomwike. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Nambo bhenibhala bhabhahobhalela Ayesu pabhakalondanika na kwaatindila Apaulo, akabhuja kunnyini. Malabhi jakwe bhenabho na Abanaba bhakabhokanga kujabhulanga ku Delube.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo na Abanaba bhabhujanga konokwe Antiokia ja ku Silia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Ngapena bhakatangachanga Ngani Jammbone mu chilambo cha Delube na kwaapatanga bhandu bhajingi bhabhakaahobhalela Ayesu. Ngapena bhakajemekanga ulendo kubhuja mu hilambo ya ku Lusitila na ku Ikonio na ku Antiokia ja ku Pisidia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Bhakaaimbalilanga bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bha hilambo heyo na kwaalekelelanga ntima bhapundange kuhobhalela. Bhakaanyamukanga na bhakaalobholelanga, “Bhandu bhapakutupoteka tangu twangajigila mu Umwenye gwa Annoongo.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Apaulo na Abanaba bhakaagulanga akanahota mu kila lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu, bhakajopanga na kutabha Annoongo abhalolekeange.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ngapena bhakapetelanga ku Pisidia na kuikanga ku Pamfulia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Pabhakajomola kutangacha Lilobhe lya Annoongo ku Peliga, bhakajaulanga ku chilambo cha Atalia. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Kubhoka konokwe bhakajaulanga ulendo kwa meeli bhakabhujanga mpaka ku Antiokia ya Silia, yakubhee pena kandahi bhakabhekwanga mu wema gwa Annoongo ligongo lya lihengo bhabhalitendanga nangocheni.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Pabhakaikanga ku Antiokia bhakapangana chikomiti chikolongwa na lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito penapo bhakaapekeanga ngani ja hikubho yakubhee Annoongo akaatendelanga na henela chibhakaalomboleanga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhanhobhalele Akilisito. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Apaulo na Abanaba bhakatamanga konokwe pamo na bhenibhala bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu kwa machobha gajingi.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhatendakongana ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Bhandu bhangi bhatulukanga ku Antiokia kubhoka ku Yudea, nabhena bhatendita kwaajigananga bhenibhala bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhanhobhalele Ayesu, “Handa ngahinwanga handa Malagilo ga Amusa chigalobhola, ngokombola kuhokolewanga.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Chikubho hecho chikaatendanga Apaulo na Abanaba bhataukanange na bhenaangota. Henela Apaulo na Abanana pakahagulikwa pamo na bhandu bhangi bha ku Antiokia bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhajaulange ku Yelusalemu bhakalolange akaandundame na akanahota ligongo lya chikubho hecho.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Bahi, lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito likaatabhukanga pabhatendita kupetanga mu hilambo ya ku Foinike na ku Samalia bhakaatangachianga ngani bhandu bhangahobhalela Akilisito namuna bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi chibhatekwatendebhukila Annoongo. Ngani heyo hikaachuanga muno bhena bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Pabhakaikanga ku Yelusalemu, bhakapokelelwangwa na lilubhalo lya bhandu lilyaahobhalela Akilisito na akandundame pamo na akanahota, ngapena Apaulo na Abanaba bhakalalikanga kila chilebhe Annoongo chibhakibha bhatendite pamo nabho. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Ngapena bhenibhala bhandu bhangi bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhabhakibhanga bha chibhoga cha Mafalisayo bhakajemanga na kulongelanga, “Bhena bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhapalikwa bhainwange na kujiganwa kukagula Malagilo ga Amusa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Akaandundame na akaakola bhakakongananga pamo ili bhalongelange chikubho hecho. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Pabhakakonyananga muno, Apetulo jwaakemitwa Asimoni akajema na kulongela, “Mwakaanung'una bhangu, ntendakuimanyanga yakubhee pena kandai Annoongo akapala kunhagula nenga pakati jinunji ndangache Ngani Jammbone kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, bhakombalange kujoa na kuhobhalela. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Annoongo bhena jwaamanya mitima ja bhandu, akalangia yakubhee abhakoondite kwa kwaapekeanga Mboomo ja Annoongo handa henela chiitekutupekea twenga. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Annoongo ngapendelea, atekwalekea mabou gabhenji ligongo bhakaahobhalela Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Nangocheni, kwa niki ngakondanga genigala gabhagatendite Annoongo kwa kwaapapianga mihigo bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu yakubhee bhakalepelanga kupetulanga akanahota bhitu na twenga? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ikotokubhee henela tutendakuhobhelela kubhee, tutendakuhokolewa kwa kupetela wema kwa Hangwana Ayesu, na bhenaangota hela hela bhatekuhokolewa kwa wema gonogwe.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Bhandu bhoha bhakatama jihii, bhabhikwajoanikia Abanaba na Apaulo pabhatendita kongolelanga henela Annoongo chibhaatuminge kupangana yakangachika na hilolelo kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Pabhaakajomola kulongela, Ayakobo akalobhola, “Mwakahanung'una bhangu, nnyoanikiange! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Asimoni pabhakakongola, henela Annoongo chibhakaahagula bhandu yakubhee ngabha Bhayahudi bhabheangange bhabhe. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Malobhe ga akaalondoi bha Annoongo gatendakondana na chikubho heche, handa chiijandikwe mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Pambakujomola hikubho heye mbakubhuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">nenga mbakuchenga kabhele na nyuumba ja Adaudi jijigwile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Mbakugahalakia kabhele mahame gabhe na kugachenga kabhele.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Penapo bhandu bhangi bhoa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhatendakwakema bhabhee bhangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">bhapakunnolea nenga Hangwana.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Henela nga chindendakulongela nenga Hangwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:18">jundendite chikubho heche chimanyikane kubhokela lolo.’”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Ayaoko akapunda kulonhela, “Chindendakulagia nga chenjeni, tukotokwaalagianga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhabhaatendebhukila Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Nambo twaapelekelelange balua kwaalobholelanga bhakotokulyee nga nhilo kulyee yakulya hiitekubhekelwa hidimu na minnoongo, bhalekange kutendanga ngongola na kulyee chinyama choachela jwaatabhalilwe, na bhakotokulyanganga miyai. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kubhokela lolo malobhe ga Amusa gatekubhee gatendakutangachwa mu kila chilambo na kuchomwa mu nyuumba yoha ja konganilanga Bhayahudi kila Lichobha lya Kupomolela.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balua kwa bhandu bhabhaholela Akilisito yakubhee ngabha Bhahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Akaandundame na akanaota pamo na lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito, bhakapalanga kwaagulanga bhandu kachoko bhabhenji bhene na kwaatumanga ku Antiokia pamo na Apaulo na Abanaba. Bhakanhagula bhandu bhabhakondekwa na akaajabhenji, bahi bhakaagulikwa Ayuda jwaakemwa Abalasaba, na Asila. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Ngapena bhakaapekaanga balua jijijaandikwe, “Twenga twaakandundame na akaakolo, akanung'una bhinu, tutendakunchalimianga mwangota mwakaanung'una mwanga Bhayahudi bha ku Antiokia na chilambo ku Silia na ku Kilikia.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Tujoine kubhee bhabhile bhandu bhangi bha kubhoka mu chibhoga chitu bhakanhangalana kwa malobhe gabhenji, bhakaalekelanga bhoga mu mitima jinunji mu bhoga nkolongwa. Nambo bhatenditinge henela pangali twenga kwaatumanga kwaachinunji. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Henela tutekondaana bhoha kwaagulanga bhandu bhangi na kwaatumanga kwinunji pamo na akaaganja bhitu Abanaba na Apaulo, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />bhandu habho bhatekuchijianga mu hijogoo ligongo lya Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Henela tutendakwatumanga Ayuda na Asila kwaachinu, kupala bhanhatambulilange akaachinabhene gangani gatujaandike. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Kwa kubhee itekwabhajila Mboomo ja Annoongo na twenga tutekondananga tukotokumpekeanga hikubho hijingi kupunda ja hikubho yeneyo hiintekulobholelwanga kubhee, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />nga nhilo kulyee hiitekubhekelwa kwa hidimu, nkotokung'wee miyai, nkotokulyee chinyama jwaachitabhile, nkotokutendanga ngoongola. Mpakutendanga yammbone handa ngatendanga hikubho heyo. Tutendakuchukulu!”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Henela bhakaatabhukana, bhakatulukanga kujaulanga ku Antiokia na kabhele konokwe bhakakema kabhele chikomoti cha bhandu bhabhatekwaahobhalela Ayesu na kwaapekeanga jene balua. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Bhenibhala bhandu pabhakajomolanga kuchoma balua jela, malobhe gabhe gakaalekelanga ntima. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Ayuda na Asila, bhakibhanga akalondohi bha Annoongo, bhakakongolokanga na bhena akanung'una kwa muda ntandamao bhabhikwaalekelanga ntima na kwaatongomanianga. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Pabhakatama konokwe kwa muda teno, kwaakanung'una bha ku Antiokia bhakaatabhukanga kwaalekelanga kuhengwa, ngapena bhakabhujanga kwa bhenibhala bhabhakaatumanga. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Nambo Asila akaigalila kolakola.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maajandiko gangi ga Biblia gangali na jenje moomba</char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Apaulo na Abanaba bhakaigalila konokwe ku Antiokia kwa machobha kachoko, bhakaajigananga na kutangachanga Ngani Jammbone ja Hangwana, pamo na bhandu bhangi bhajingi.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo na Abanaba bhatendakulekananga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Pagakapeta machobha kachoko, Apaulo akalobholela Abanaba, “Tubhuje tukaatyangilange bhenibhala akapwanga mu kila chilambo yoha hiitutekutangacha Ngani Jammbone tulole namuna chibhaendeleanga.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Abanaba akapala bhantole Ayohana jwabhankemita Amaliko ajaule pamo nabho. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Nambo Apaulo jwangapala kuntola Amaluko, yakubhe kandai akaaleka konikola ku Pamfulia na kukana kupanga mahengo gabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Bahi, kukabhokela kutaukananga pakati jabhenji, henela bhakalekananga. Abanaba akantola Amaluko, bhakakwela meeli kujaula ku Kupulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Nambo Apaulo akanhagula Asila na bhenibhala bhabhakaahobhalela Ayesu bha penipala bhakaajopa Annoongo abhatendelange gammbone, ngapena akabhoka. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Mu ulendo gonogwe akapetela ku Silia na ku Kilikila, akaabhekanga maha bhandu bhabhaahobhalela Akilisito.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Atimotheo atendakulongana pamo na Apaulo na Asila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Ngapena Apaulo akatandubha ulendo na kuhika hilambo ya ku Delube na ku Lusitila, ku Delube kukibha na mundu jumo Ayahudi jwahobhalela Akilisito na lina lyabhe Atimotheo. Anyongo bhabhe Atimotheo akibha Ayahudi jwakahobhelela Ayesu Kilisito, nambo atati bhabhe Atimotheo akibha Agiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Atimotheo akalumbalikwa muno pakati ja bhandu bhenibhala bhabhakanhobhalela Akilisito bha hilambo ya ku Lisitila na ku Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Apaulo akapala Atimotheo alongane nabho mu ulendo, henela akanhina. Akatenda henela ligongo Bhayahudi bhoha bhabhatamitanga konokwe bhakaimanyanga yakubhee atati bhabhe Atimotheo akibha Agiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Pabhatendita kupeta mu yeniyela hilambo bhakaapekeanga bhandu malagilo gagabhokite kwa akandundame na akaakolo konikola ku Yelusalemu, bhabhikwalobholelanga bhagakamulange. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Henela, genigala malubhalo ga bhandu bhabhakahobhalela Akilisito bhakapunda kubhee na machili mu kuhobhelela, na bhandu bhabhakahobalela Ayesu bhakapunda kujonjokeka kila lichobha.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakulola mu malolo konokwe ku Toloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bhakapetela mu hilambo ya ku Fulugia na ku Galatia kwakubhee Mboomo ja Annoongo akaanikianga kutangacha Ngani Jammbone ja Hangwana ku chilambo cha Asia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Pabhakaikanga mu mipaka ja ku Musia, bhakalenganga kujingila ku Bithunia, nambo Mboomo ja Ayesu bhanga jikaakanikianga. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Bahi, bhakapetela ku Musia, bhakajendanga mpaka ku Toloa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Kilo hecho, Apaulo akalola malolo ga mundu jumo jwa kubhoka ku Mekedonia ajemite penipala na kwajoopa, “Nnyoomboke, nhiike ku Mekedonia ntujangatile.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Apaulo pabhakalola maono hago, bhakachibheka maha kujaula ku Mekedonia panga kukabha, tukaimanya kweli Annoongo atukemite tukatangache Ngani Jambone.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidia atendakwahobhalela Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Tukabhoka ku Toloa, tukajenda kwa meeli mpaka ku luumba lwasamotilake, pakuchilaje tukahika kuchilambo cha Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Tukabhoka konokwe, tukahika ku Filipi, chilambo cha ku Makedonia, na hitendita kuhukumulwa na bhandu bha ku Loma. Tukatama mu chilambo hecho kwa machobha kachoko. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Lichobha lya Kupomolela tukapiita nngulugulu ja chilambo, tukajaula nngulugulu ja loochi tukaganikia pakwajopela Annoongo. Tukatama, tukalongela na hakaikege bhabhakakondanikanga mahali popopo. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Pakati ja bhenibhala bhabhatendita kutujohanikianga akibha mwikege jumo jwakemitwa Alidia jwa kubhoka ku Tuatila, jwatendita kwahobhalela Annoongo, yakubhee akibha atendakuusa ngobho ya kuhalalaya ja bei ngolongwa ja laangi ja zambalau. Hangwana Annoongo akapangala lihengo muntima gwa Alidia ili agajoanikie malobhe gagakalobholekwa na Apaulo. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Mwikege jonojwe pabhakabatichwa pamo na alongo ajabhe, akatulalika abhikulobhola, “Handa kweli ntekulolanga yakubhee ndekwahobhalela Hangwana, nhikange kwaachangu ntamange.” akatulobholela muno tujaule.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo na Asila bhatendakubhekwa mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu ku Filipi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Lichobha limo, patutendita kujaula mahali palapala pa kwajopela Annoongo, mwikege jumo mmanda jwaakachukilwa na mahoka, jwaakibha na uwecho gwa kulondola akakongana na twenga. Mwikege hojwe akibha atendakwaapekeanga akaakola mbiha bhabhangange na mbiha hijingi ligongo lya kulondola kwakwe. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Bahi, jonojwe mwikege akaakagula Apaulo na twenga, abhikupota nyenye abhikulobhola, “Habha bhandu nga akaatumichi bha Annoongo akolo. Bhakaalobholelelanga namuna mukombolanga kuokolewa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Jono mwali atendita henela kwa machobha gajingi hata lichobha limo Apaulo akatumbala, akatendebhukila na kwalobholela jonojwe lihoka, “Ndendakunkulumikia kwa lihina lya Ayesu Kilisito, mummoke hojojo!” Popopo jono lihoka likaabhoka.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Bhabhabhilinge na mbiha bha jonijola mwikege pabhakabhonanga kubhee nhobhalelo gwabhenji gwa kupatanga hilebhe lijomwike, bhakaakamulanga Apaulo na Asila, bhakaautanga mpaka palugwinjili, nnoongi ja akaakolo. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Bhakaatakianga kwa akaaliwali bhakalobholanga, “Bhandu habha Bhayahudi bhatekulekelanga ukomu mu chilambo chitu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Bhatendakujigananga hilebhe hihiyobhalilike yakubhee twenga bhatubhile pahi ja mamulaka ga ku Loma ngapalikwa kuikonda wala kuikagula.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Libhoga lya bhandu likachilondanika na kwapootanga Apaulo na Asila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Na bhenibhala maliwali bhakaulanga Apaulo na Asila ngobho yabhenji kwa machili, bhakakulumikianga bhaapotange hiyakato. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Pabhakajomolanga kwaaapotanga muno bhakajingianga nkati, na manyemba bha nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu bhakaakulumikianga kwaabhekanga pahi ja ujemelei. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Kubhokana na malagio hago, jonojwe linyeemba likolo lya nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu akaabhekanga mu chumba cha nkati ja jenijela nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu na kwatabhaanga mmakongono gabhenji mu lipekepeke likolongwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Pakati ja kilo Apaulo na Asila bhatendita kujopa na kujemba minyeembo ja kwaalumbalila Annoongo, kongoni akaatabha bhangi bhabhi kwaajoanikianga. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Ng'ang'anu, kukabhokela na kulendemela kukolongwa kwa mandopi gagakapukunya nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. Milyango joha jikajogoka na minyololo jijikaatabhila bhenaangota jikalekana. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Linyemba likolo lya nlyango gwa nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu paakajimuka kulola mlyango gwa nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu gutekujogoka akaganikia yakubhee akatabhwa bhabhutukinge, na henela akaguolomola upanga gwakwe, kupala kuchikoma. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Nambo Apaulo akaakema kwa lilobhe likolongwa, “Nkotochiulaha mwabhene kwa maana twenga tubhile pambani!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Akankema mundu alete lumuli, pabhakaguleka lumuli, jonojwe linyeemba likolo lya nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu akabhutukila nkati akachigwiha nnoongi ja makongono ga Apaulo na Asila kongoni abhi kulendemela kwa bhooga. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Penapo akaalongoleanga panja, akakonyanga, “Mwakakolongwa, ndende chiniki ili kuokolewa?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bhenabho bhakaajangula, “Mwahobhalele Hangwana Ayesu mwenga na bhandu bhinu bhoa bha nyuumba jinu nga pampakuokolewa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Bahi, bhakantangachia lilobhe lya Hangwana jonojwe na pamo na akaalongo bhabhe. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Jonijola linyeemba akaatolanga kilo chochocho na akaajeleanga mabhanga gabhenji, ngapena jonojwe na akaalongo bhabhe popopo bhakabhatichwanga. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Akaatolanga Apaulo na Asila kunyuumba jakwe, akaapekeanga chakulya. Jonojwe na akaalongo bhabhe bhoha bhakatendanga nholo nkolongwa kwakubhee nangocheni bhatendita kwahobhalela Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Malabhi jakwe, maliwali bhenibhala bhakaatumanga akaakolo bha manyemba kwa akolo bha nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu, “Mwajogolange bhenibhala bhandu.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Jonijola akolo bha linyemba lya nyuumba jwa kutabhila bhandu akalobholela ngani Apaulo, “Maliwali bhatekututumanga kubhee nnyogolekwe. Nangocheni mpakombolanga kubhoka na kujaulanga kwa kuhengwa.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Nambo Apaulo akaajangula, “Nnongelabholi? Bhakatupotanga hiyakato palugwinjili pangali kutuhumula, na twenga nga bhandu bha ku Loma, kabhele bhakatutabhanga mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. Nangocheni bhapalanga kutujogolelanga kwa kuchihiya! Ngabha! Nneke akachinabhene bhaikange bhatujogolelange.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Bhenibhala akaakolo bha manyemba bhakabhujanga na kwabholelanga ngani hejo, bhenaangota pabhakajoanga kubhee Apaulo na Asila bhakibhanga bhandu bha ku Loma, bhakajogopanga. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Henela, bhakajaulanga kwatindibhalila majugwa na pabhakaabhoanga nkati bhakaajopanga bhabhokange mu chilambo chela. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Apaulo na Asila bhakabhokanga mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu, bhakajaulanga kaja kwa Alidia. Konokwe bhakakongananga na bhandu bhabhakahobholela Ayesu na pabhakajomolanga kwalekelanga ntima, bhakabhokanga.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">17 Ukomu gubhokela ku Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Apaulo na Asila pabhakibhanga ku ulendo bhakapetelanga mu hilambo ya Amfipoli na Apolonia, bhakajendanga mpaka ku Tesalonike, konokwe kukibha na nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Handa chaayobhalile Apaulo, akajaula mu mu nyuumba ya konganila Bhayahudi na akalongela nabho kwa Machobha gatatu ga Kupomolela, abhikutumia Majaandiko ga Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Atendandita kulongela nabho na kulangia kubhee ipalikwa Akilisito kulaga, kujomoka na kuyoka. Akaalobholelanga, “Akilisito juntendakwatangacha kwaachinu nga Ayesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Pakati jabhenji Bhayahudi bhakakondanga na kuchilondanika pamo na Apaulo na Asila. Kabhelae, bhandu bha kubhoka ku Ugiliki bhabhakahobhalela Annoongo pamo na akaahikege bhabhakatopelwa mu chilambo hecho, bhakachilondanika nabho.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Nambo Bhayahudi yakubhee bhangabhalelanga bhakibha na bwihu, bhakaatumanga bhandu bhangali mmbone kubhoka kuchoko, bhakakonganianga nkutuli gwa bhandu na bhakatandubhanga ukomu pannyini. Bhakabhutukanga lubhelo mpaka ku nyuumba ja Ayasoni bhabhi kwaloleanga Apaulo na Asila ili bhaapiange panja papabhile na nkutuli gwa bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Nambo pabhakaapelelanga bhakautanga Ayasoni na akaanung'una bhangi bhabhakahobhalela Akilisito nnongi ja akanachilongola bha chilambo, kongo bhabhikupotanga nyenye na kulobholanga, “Bhandu habha bhabhatendita kuchipendekula chilambo choa ngocheni bhaikitinge pambani kwaachitu, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Ayasoni atekwapokelanga ku nyumba jakwe. Bhoha bhatendanga mpendeku cha amuli ja Akaisali bhabhikulobhola, Abhile amwenye bhangi jwaakemwa Ayesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Akaakolo bha pannyini na libhoga lya bhandu bhakibhanga na lipamba muno kwa malobhe hago. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Bhenaangota pabhakajomola bhakaatochanga mbiya Ayasoni na akaajabhe, ngapena bhakaalekanga bhajaulange.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo na Asila konokwe ku Belea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Kilo, bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakahobhalela Ayesu bhakaapelekanga Apaulo na Asila bhabhokange bhajaulange ku chilambo cha Belea. Pabhakaikanga konokwe, bhakajaulanga ku nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Bhandu bha ku Belea bhakajoanikianga maha kupeta bhenibhala bha ku Tesalonike, kwa kubhee bhakalipokelanga genigala malobhe kwa kuhangalala muno. Bhakagalolekea maha Majaandiko ga Annoongo kila lichobha, bhalole yakubhee handa genigala gabhakalongelanga Apaulo na Asila gakibha ga kweli. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Bhajingi bhabhenji bhakahobhelelanga pamo na akaikege na akanalome bha Chigiliki bhabhakatopelwa muno.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Nambo, Bhayahudi bha ku Tesalonike pabhakahimanyanga yakubhee, hele hela Apaulo atendita kutangacha lilobhe lya Annoongo konokwe ku Belea, bhakajaulanga konokwe, bhakajemekanga kwaatendela ukomu na kwelekea mabhoga ga bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Palapala bhandu bhabhakahobhalela Ayesu bhakaachapalia Apaulo ajaule kumbwani nambo Asila na Atimotheo bhakaigalilanga ku Belea. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhabhaakachapalia Apaulo bhakajendanga pamo nabho mpaka ku chilambo cha Atene. Ngapena, bhakaaleka Apaulo na bhakabhujanga na malagilo kubhoka kwa Apaulo kubhee Asila na Atimotheo bhaakagule chindema.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo alongela na bhandu konokwe ku chilambo cha Atene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Apaulo pabhatenda kwaalenda Asila na Atimotheo konokwe ku chilambo cha Atene, akatumbala muno kwa kubhoka kujimbika kwa hidimu ya minnoongo, pabhakabhona henela akaabhina muno mu ntima gwabhe. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Henela akakonyananga na Bhayahudi na bhandu bhangi bhanga Bhayahudi nambo bhabhahobhalela Annoongo mu nyuumba ja konganilananga Bhayahudi. Hela hela kila lichobha atendita kulongela na bhandu bhabhakakongana nabho palugwinjili pamo na bhoa bhabhakahikanga. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Bhandu bhangi bhatendita kukagala majigano ga Bhaepikuleo na Bhasitoiki bhakataukana na Apaulo. Bhangi bhakalongelanga, “Hojo mundu jwa lobholobho apala kulongela chiniki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Bhangi bhakalobholanga, “Ibhonekana alongela ngani ja minoongo ja chigeni.” Bhakalobholanga gangani ligongo Apaulo akibha atendakutangacha ngani ja Ayesu na kuyoka. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Henela bhakaatola Apaulo na bhakaapela pachebule jijikemwa Aleopago, bhakalobholanga, “Bholi, tupakombola kugamanya majigano haga gayono gajigana chiniki? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Tutekujoa mmikulongela hilebhe higeni, henela tupala kumanya maana gakwe nga chiniki.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Bhandu bha ku Atene na akaageni bhoha bhabhatamanga monomwe, kwa machobha gabhenji goha bhatendita kupala kukongolelananga na kujoanikia ngani hiyono.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Ngapena Apaulo akajema nnongi ja chebule jenejo ja Aleopago, akalobhola, “Bhandu bha ku Atene! Komboleka mwangota nga bhandu bhankotimilanga kwa kutopea muno minnoongi jinunji. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Panakibha ndendakujeenda pannyini na kulolekea kwa kwakuchimila hidimu yinunji, nakalola litatali lya kubhokea mbeeko, jijaandikwe, ‘Kwa annoongo jwangamanyikana.’ Bahi Annoongo juntendakunkotimilanga kwa kutopea pangali kuimanya, nga jonojwe jundendakuntangachianga kwaachitu. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Jonojwe nga Annoongo, jwahalakihe chilambo na yoha hihibhile nkati jakwe, jonojwe nga Hangwana bha Kunani kwa Annoongo na chilambo, ngatama mu nyuumba jijichengitwe na bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Ngatumukiwa na bhandu na ngapala chilebhe choachela kubhoka kwaachabhenji, ligongo jonojwe bhene nga jwaapekea bhandu bhoha umoomi na mboomo na kwapekea hilebhe yoha. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kubhoka kwa mundu jumo, bhena akatukuhalakia bhandu bhoha na kutama pachilambo, nabhena akabheka nga lii na koji bhena bhandu kubhapakutamanga. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Annoongo akatenda henela ili bhandu bhaalolee hata kwa kupaapaa kupala bhammone. Henela Annoongo jwangabhee kutali na kila jumo jwitu, <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />handa chibhalongile mundu jumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Nkati jabhe jonojwe twenga tutendakutama,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">Tutendakuchikombola, na tubhile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">Nga handa bhandu bhinu bhangi chibhalongilinge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Twenga nga bhana bhabhe.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Twenga nga bhana bha Annoongo, ngapalikwa kuganikia kubhee Annoongo nga handa chidimu cha bhuunyu madini ga mbiha au liganga lilibhachitwe kwa umanyo na kulikulungila kwa bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Annoongo akachitenda handa ngalola machobha genigala yakubhee bhandu pabhakibhanga ngaamanya Annoongo bha kweli. Nambo nangocheni bhatendakunkulumikia bhandu bhoha bhalekange kulemwa kwabhenji na kwabhujila bhenabho, <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />kwakubhee atekubheka lichobha yakubhee apakuukumula chilambo handa chiikondeekwa apakuntuma mundu jwaabhanhagwile, kwa jonojwe jwatekutulobholela bhandu bhoha kwa kwayoha Akilisito.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Pabhakajoanga ngani ya uyoho kubhoka kwa Apaulo, bhangi bhakaabheluha, nambo bhangi bhakalobholanga, “Tupala kunnyoanikia kabhele mmikongoloka ngani ja chikubho hecheche.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Henela, Apaulo akabhoka akaalekanga. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Nambo bhangi bhakalongana na jonojwe, bhakaahobhalela. Pakati jabhenji bhakibhanga Adionisio, jumo jwa chebule cha Aaleopago, hela hela akibha mwikege jumo jwakemitwa Adamali na bhangi bhajingi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Apaulo konokwe ku chilambo cha Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ngapena pagakapeta genago, Apaulo akabhoka ku Atene akujaula ku Kolinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Konokwe akakongana na Ayahudi jumo lihina lyabhe Akila, kwachabhe ku Ponto. Akila na hanu bhabhe jwaamekwa Apulisila, bhakabhujanga kubhoka ku Italia mu machobha gogogo ligongo Akaisalia Kilaudio akibha atekwakulumia Bhayahudi bhoa bhabhokange ku Loma. Henela Apaulo akajaula kwalolanga, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Apaulo atamanga nabho na kupangana mehengo kwukubhee jonojwe akibha mundu jwa kutoka mahema handa bhenaangota. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Kila Lichobha lya Kupomolela Apaulo akibha atendakonyananga na Bhayahudi na Bhagiliki mu nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi abhikujiga kwahuta ili bhahobhalele Ayesu.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Asila na Atimotheo pabhakaikanga kubhoka ku Mekidonia, Apaulo akachitolea umomi gwabhe gwoa ligongo lya kutangacha na kwalobholelanga bhandu kubhee Ayesu nga Akilisito. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Bhayahudi pabhakaakana na kwaatukukana, Apaulo bhena akakung'unda ngubho yabhe nnongi jabhenji kulangia kubhee atendakwanyamukanga, akalobholelanga, “Lilipakumpitilanga nga linunji mwakaachinabhene! Nenga nanga kokolekwa kwa chikubho choachela, nenga lihengo lyangu nyomwile. Kujemeka nangocheni mbakukwajendelanga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Ngapena akabhoka monimola mu nyumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi, akajaula ku nyuumba ja mundu jumo lihina lyakwe Atito Yusito, akibha mundu jwa Annoongo. Nyuumba jakwe jikibha jibhandikile na nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Akolo bha jenijela nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi, Akilisipo akajemeka kwahobhalela Hangwana pamo na bhoha bha nnyumba jakwe, Bhakolinto bhajingi bhabhakaajoanikia Apaulo bhakahobhalelanga na kubatichwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Lichobha limo kilo, Hangwana Ayesu akalobholela Apaulo mu hagamii, “Nkotokujogopa, nhendelee kutangacha Ngani Jammbone panga wee ntima, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />kwakubhee nenga mi pamo namwenga. Jwakwa mundu jwapakujiga kunlaha, ligongo pambani pannyini bhabhilinge bhandu bhangu bhajingi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Bahi, Apaulo akatama konokwe abhikwajiganga lilobhe lya Annoongo pakati jabhenji kwa chaaka jimo na mihei chita.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Nambo Agalio pabhakibha akolo bha chilambo cha ku Akaya, Bhayahudi bhakaakamula Apaulo na kwaapeleka pachebule. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Bhakalobholanga, “Tutendakuntakia mundu hojo ligongo lya kwakolokeanga bhandu bhaajope Annoongo pangali kukagula Malagilo ga Amusa.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Tangu Apaulo jwaangajemeka kolongela, Agailo akalobholela Bhayahudi, “Nnyoanikiange mwangota Akayahudi! Handa kweli chikubho heche chikabhile nnani ja hilebhe hibohu au hilebhe ibohu ngakombwile kunnyoanikianga. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Nambo kwa ngani ja mitahu na ngani ja malobhe na mahina ginunji, nhamuange mwakachibhene. Nenga ngakombola kubhee mundu jwakuhukumula hikubho yinu heyo!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Bahi akaabhenganga bhabhokange penapo pachebule. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Bhena bhoa bhakaakamula Asositene jwaakibha nkolo jwa nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi, bhakaapota palapala nnoongi ja chebule. Nambo Agailo jwangajali chikubho hecho.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakubhuja ku Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Apaulo akatama na bhenibhala bhabhahobhalela Ayesu konokwe ku Kolinto kwa machobha gajingi. Ngapena akatabhuka, akakwela mu meeli kujaula ku Silia pamo na Apilisila na Akula. Konokwe ku Kenkelea, akachekula majunju gabhe ligongo akalangia atekujomola kulapila kwabhe kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Bhakaikanga ku Efeso na popopo Apaulo akalekanga Apilisila na Akula, akajenda ku nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi, akalongela nabho Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bhandu bhakaajopa Apaulo atame nabho machobha gajingi, nambo jonojwe akakana. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Pabhakibha bhatendakubhoka, akalobhola, “Annoongo handa apalite mbakuika kwaachinu kabhele.” Akakwela mu meeli akajaula ku Efeso.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Meeli jikahika ku Kaisalea, na Apaulo akajenda ku Yelusalemu na kwaatyangila bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakahobhalela Akilisito, ngapena akabhoka kujaula ku Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Akatama konokwe kwa machobha kachoko, kabhele akaendelea na ulendo kwa kupetela hilambo ya ku Galatia na ku Fulugia akaalekelanga mitima bhoa bhabhahobhalela Ayesu.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aapolo atendakutangacha lilobhe lya Annoongo konokwe ku Efeso na ku Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Mu machobha genago kukibha na Ayahudi jumo jwakemwa Aapolo, bhabhelikwe ku Alekisandalia, akaika ku Efeso na akibha mundu jwalongela maha na abhi na umanyo nkolongwa gwa Majandiko ga Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Akibha ajiginwe ngani ja jene ndela ja Hangwana, akibha lyotolyoto mu ntima gwabhe, alongila ngani ja ngani ya Ayesu akajigananga maha, akabatichwa na Ayohana jika. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Apilisila na Akula pabhakanyoanikia Apolo abhikulongela kwa kuchimila nkati ja nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi, bhakantola kwachabhenji bhakannyigana malobhe gagaakondolela Ayesu na namuna bhabhahobhalile chibhapalikwa kutamanga. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Ngapena Apolo pabhakaamua kujaula ku Akaya, bhenibhala bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhakannekela ntima kwa kwajandikilanga bhenibhala bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bha konikola ku Akaya bhampokele. Pabhakaika konokwe, akakombola kwa wema gwa Annoongo, kwajangatilanga bhenibhala bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bha ku Akaya, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />kwa kubhee akaendelea kwa kuchimila kutangacha palugwinjili kwa kwapeta Bhayahudi palugwinjili na kulangia kwa Majaandiko ga Annoongo kubhee Ayesu nga Akilisito.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakutangacha Lilobhe lya Annoongo konokwe ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolo pabhakibha ku Kolinto, Apaulo akapeta pakati ja hilambo ya mmatombi, akaika ku Efeso na akaakolela bhandu bhangi bhabhakahobhalela Akilisito. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Akakonya, “Bholi, pamukahobhalela Ayesu nkapokelanga Mboomo ja Annoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Bhakaajangula, “Twangajoa kubhee abhile Mboomo jwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Jonojwe akalongela, “Nangocheni nkapatanga ubaticho gwa namuna niki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Bhakaajangulanga, “Tukapata ubaticho gwa Ayohana.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Apaulo akalobhola, “Ubaticho gubhagajigana gukibha ubaticho gwa kuleka mabohu. Ayohana akaakongolelanga bhandu bhanhobhalele jwajola jwaapakuhika kuyeto jabhe, nga Ayesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Bhandu pabhakajoanga genago, bhakabatichwanga kwa lihina lya Hangwana Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Bahi, Apaulo akabhekelanga mabhoko, na Mboomo ja Annoongo akaalongoleanga, bhakajemekanga kulongela chilongelo chengi na kutangacha ngani ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Bhoha bhakibhanga handa akanalome komi na bhabhele.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Mihei jitatu Apaulo akibha ajenda mu nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi, akalongela na bhandu ngani ja Umwenye gwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Nambo bhangi bhakibha mitahu, bhakakananga kuhobhalela, bhakajemeka kulongela malobhe gabohu kwa ngani ja hejo ndela ja Hangwana Ayesu mu libhoga lya bhandu. Penapo Apaulo akaleka kuelewana nabho, akaatolanga nnyenje bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe, akabhe bhalongela nabho kila lichobha mu nyuumba yakubhee bhandu bhabhakajaulanga kuchijigana ja mundu jwakemwa Atulano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Akaendelea kupangana henela kwa muda gwa yaaka hibhele hata akaakolo bhoha bha kuchilambo cha Asia, Bhayahudi na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, bhakakombola kujoa lilobhe lya Hangwana.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhana bha Asikewa bhajiga kugabhenga mahoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Annoongo akatenda yakangachika hijingi kupetela Apaulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Bhandu bhakatolanga ngobho na hitambaa hiikabhoka payeega mwa Apaulo akaipelekanga kwa akatamwa, nabhena bhakalamiwanga hitamwa yabhenji, na bhenibhala bhabhakibhanga na mahoka gakaabhokanga bhena bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Bhayahudi bhangi bhabhakatendita kupupulika kono na konokwe bhabhikulenga kugabhoa mahoka kwa bhandu kwa kupetela lihina lya “Hangwana Ayesu bhatenditakulongela na kubhoa kwa lihina lya Ayesu yakubhee Apaulo atendakwatangacha.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Bhana chaba bha mundu jumo jwaakemitwa Asikewa, jwakibha anachilongola jwa akung'i akolo bha Chiyahudi akibha pakati ja bhandu bhabhakibha bhatendanga genago. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Nambo mahoka gabohu gakaajangula, “Twaamanyi Ayesu, naamanyi kabhele na Apaulo, nambo mwangota nga aganiki?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Ngapena jonijola mundu jola jwakaachukilwa na mahoka akabhahombelanga bhoha kwa machili, akaagwianga bhoa. Na bhena bhana bha Asikewa bhakabhutukanga kubhoka mu jenijela nyuumba kongo ngobho yabhenji hibhiipapunikwe na kwaahulaanga mu mimele yabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Kila mundu konokwe ku Efeso, Ayahudi na bhanga Ayahudi, bhakajoa ngani ja chikubho hecho. Bhoha bhakibha na bhoga, bhakalilumbalila lihina lya Hangwana Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Bhandu bhangi bhabhahobhalile Ayesu bhakahikanga kukoondanga palugwinjili hikubho hibhaitenditinge. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Bhangi bhabhakibha bhapangana hikubho ya uwabhi pena kandahi, bhakakumbanga hitabu yabhenji ya uwabhi, bhabhikujocha nnongi ja bhoha. Galama ya hitabu heyo hikabhandikila handa hipande elupu makoni nhano ya madini ga mbiya. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Henela nga lilobhe lya Hangwana Ayesu chilikapunda kujenela na kubhee na machili muno.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhapangana ukomu konokwe ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Pahikapeta hikubho heyo, Apaulo akaamua kujenda ku Yelusalemu kwa kupetela ku Makedonia na Akaya. Akalobhola, “Pambakuhika konokwe, hela hela mbalikwa kujaula ku Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Henela, bhakaatuma bhabhele bha ajangati bhabhe, Atimoseo na Aelasito, bhaalongolelange kujeenda ku Makedonia, na jono akaigalila kachoko konokwe ku Asia.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Muda hogwe nga kukabhokela ukomu nkolongwa konokwe ku Efeso ligongo lya ngani ya Hangwana. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Kukibha na mundu jumo jwaalakia hidimu ya nyuumba ja Annoongo mwikege kwa madini ga mbia jwaakemitwa Ademetilio, yakubhe akibha na lihengo lya kuhalakia hidimu ya nyuumba ja annoongo mwikege akemitwa Aalitemi. Lihengo helyo jikaapatilanga bhakuhalakia hidimu kwa madini ga mbia bhapakupata nnyonjokeko nkolongwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Ademetilio akakumbanga bhenaangota bhatenda lihengo pamo na bhangi bhabhakibha na lihengo handa helyo, akalobholela, “Mwabhandu ntendakuimanyanga kubhee lihengo helye limpatilanga mbiha hijingi. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Nangocheni, ntendakombolanga kujoanga na kuchilolelanga mwabhenenji hikubho yaitendita Apaulo, nga pambani pa Efeso jika, hela hela moha mu Asia. Jonojwe atekwaahutanga bhandu na kwaalobholelanga bhandu bhakondange yakubhee jenijela minnoongo jijihalakikwe na bhandu ngabha minnoongo hata kachoko. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Henela hibhi yakujogoa yakubhe maloonda gitu gapakubhee na lihina lyangali mmbone. Nga henela jika, bali kabhele chikubho hecho lipakombola kuitenda nyuumba ja nnoongo mwikege Aalitemi jipakubhelulilwa. nnoongo jonojwe ngaakotimilwa na bhandu bha Asia na chilambo choha.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Pabhakajoanga genago, bhakibha na lilaka, bhakajemekanga kulongela kwa liobhe likolongwa, “Aalitemi nga akolo bha nnoongo jwa ku Efeso!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Chilambo choa chikapundia na ukomu. Bhandu bhakaakamulanga Agayo na Alistako, yakubhee bhakibhanga bhalongine na Apaulo, bhakaabhutuanga mahali yakubhee bhandu patendakongananga. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Apaulo bhene akapala kujaula kupotana nabho lyenilyela lilubhalo lya bhandu nambo bhenibhala bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhakaakanikia. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Akachilongola bhangi bha gono nkowa gwa Asia, bhabhakibhanaga akaaganja bhabhe, bhakaapelekela Apaulo malobhe ga kwaapembelea akotokuchibheka mu kujogoa kwa kujingila penepo. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Muda hogwe penepo pakibha na ukomu, kila mundu akibha alongela kwa kukwea lilobhe, bhangi helele na bhangi lyenilyela, mpaka gonigola nkondekeno gukapwilingananga. Ligongo bhandu bhajingi bhangahimanyanga kwaniki bhakonganinge penipala. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Bhayahudi bhangi bhakaapeleka Alekizanda nnoongi. Bhandu bhangi bhakaganikia kubhee nga ndando, bahi Alekizanda akabhalangianga kwa lubhoko bhakotokange kupala kuchitetea nnoongi jabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Nambo pabhakaimanyanga kubhee jonojwe nga Ayahudi, bhoa pamo bhakapotanga nyenye kwa machaa gabhele bhabhikulobholanga, “Alitemi nga akolo bha ku efeso!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Kupela kwa yoa akalani bha chilambo akakombola kwaakotoanga bhandu na kwaalobholelenga, “Mwangota mwa bhandu bha ku Efeso kila mundu ahimanye kubhee bhandu bha ku chilambo cha ku Efeso nga akaajemelei bha nyuumba ja annoongo mwikege Aatemi na akaajemelei bha liganga lilikagwee kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Jwaakwa jwakombola kukana hikubho heyo. Henela bahi, nkotokange, nkokupangana choha chela chibohu. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ntekwaletanga habha bhandu pambani hata handa bhangajibhanga chilebhe choachela mu nyuumba ja nnoongo na kwaatukana nnoongo bhitu mwikege. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Hata handa Ademetilio na bhabhatenda lihengo bhabhe bhatekola ngani na mundu joajola, machebule gabhile na bhakuamuanga bhabhile, bhakombolanga kutakiananga konokwe. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Handa ntekolanga hindondo yengi, mpelekange mu chikomiti chichimanyika. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Handa chiibhile nangocheni tubhi mu kutakiwa ligongo tuletite ukomu gongoni gwa lelen. Ngakombola kuchitetea ligongo ukomu gongoni mwangalimaana kwaachitu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Pabhakajomola kulobhola genago, akaalobholeelanga bhandu bhabhabhile pachikomiti bhajaulange.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Apaulo ajaula kabhele ku Makedonia na ku Ugiliki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Gonigola ukomu gwa Efeso pajikakotoka Apaulo akaakemanga pamo bhenibhala bhandu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu, akaalekelanga ntima na kwaatabhukanga. Ngapena akajaula ku Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Apaulo akapetela chehemu ja chilambo yela abhikwaalekela ntima bhandu bhabhaahobhalile Ayesu kwa malobhe gajingi. Ngapena akaika ku Ugiliki. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Konokwe akatama kwa mihei jitatu. Pabhatendita kuchibheka maha kujaula ku Silia, bhakaimanya yakubhee Bhayahudi bhakibhanga bhaatendela ndela yangali mmbone, henela akatindigana ndela na kubhuja kwa kupetela ku Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Apaulo akalongana nabho na Asopatulo, mwana jwa Apiliho, kubhoka ku Belea, kabhele akalongana na Aalistaliko na Asekundo bha kubhokela ku Tesalonike na Agayo kubhoka ku Delube, Atimotheo, Tukiko na Atulofimo bha kubhokela nkowa gwa Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Bhena bhandu bhakatulongolelanga na kutulendelanga konikola ku Tuloa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Twenga, palikapeta lichobha likolongwa lya mikate jangalekelwa ngedule, tukakwela meeli kubhoka ku Filipi na pagakapeta machobha gatatu tukaikanga konikola ku Toloa. Konokwe tukatama muda gwa lijuma limo.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakwaayoa Aeutiko bha konokwe ku Toloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Lichobha lya kujemeka lya lijuma tukakongana pamo kupala kulyee chakula. Kwa kubhee Apaulo akibha apala kujaula malabhi jakwe, akabhalobholelanga bhandu Ngani Jammbone na akajendelea kulongela nabho mpaka pakati ja kilo. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Mu chuumba cha nnani cha mutukibha, kukajakilwa himuli hijingi. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Apaulo pabhapundita kujigana nangwendu jumo jwaakemitwa Aeutiko akibha atamite palidilicha lya chuumba cha nnani, nangwendu jonojwe akajemeka kugochela, lugono palukaajonjokea akagwee kubhoka mu nyuumba ja tatu nnani patukajaula kwaalokota akibha atekujomoka. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Nambo Apaulo akatuluka pahi, akakotima, na kwaanyambatila nangwendu hojwe na kulobhola, “Nkotokubhee na lipamba nga jwamomi.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Ngapena Apaulo akakwela kabhele mu chuumba cha nnani, akalyee chakulya. Akajendelea kulongela nabho kwa muda nnyingi mpaka kuhika kundabhi kokoliko, ngapena akajaula. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhakampetula jonijola nangwendu mpaka kaaja abhi jwamomi, bhakaangalala muno.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakubhoka ku Toloa mpaka ku Mileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Twenga tukakwela meeli tukalongolela kujaula ku Aso yakubhee tukaatolite Apaulo. Nga chibhakapanga, kwa kubhee jonojwe akapala kujaula konokwe kwa makongono. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Bahi, akatukolela konikola ku Aso, tukakwela mu meeli, tukajenda ku Mitulene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Kubhoka konokwe tukajaula tukaika ku Kio malabhi jakwe. Lichobha lya bhele, tukahika ku Samo na malabhi jakwe tukaika ku Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Apaulo akibha apalite kujendelea na ulendo kwa meeli panga kupetela Efeso kupala akoto kabha muno hokwe ku Asia. Akibha na chindema cha kuika ku Yelusalemu kwa lichobha likolongwa lya Pentekosite handa ikombolike.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakwaatabhukanga akanahota bha ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Kubhoka ku Mileto Apaulo akalagia malobhe kwa akanahota bhabhakaahobhalela Akilisito bha Ku Efeso bhakongane nabho. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Pabhakaikanga kwachabhe akaalobholela, “Ntendakuimanyanga namuna chindamite namwangota machobha goha kubhokela lichobha lyela lya kujemeka pangaika ku Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Muhimanyi namuna chindekwatumikila Hangwana kwa kutongamanika kwoha, kwa mahoi na hindondo niipatite ligongo lya ndela hibohu ya Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Ntendakuimanya yakubhee nangaleka hata kachoko kuntangachianga Ngani Jammbone palugwinjili na mmajumba ginunji na kunnyigananga choachela chakubhee chipakunnyangatilanga. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Nakaanyamukanga Bhayahudi bhoa na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, bhaatendebhukile Annoongo na kwaobhalela Hangwana bhitu Ayesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Nangocheni, nnyoanikiange! Nenga, ikibha mbakujijeketela Mboomo, ndendakujaula ku Yelusalemu panga kumanya gagapakumbata konokwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Chinachimanya jika nga yakubhee Mboomo jwa Annoongo atendakunnobholela mu kila chilambo yakubhee hitabho na hibhini hitendakunendela. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Nambo, ngagulola umomi gwangu nga chilebhe chammbone muno ila chinichipala muno kugukweela gonigola utumichi gwangu na lyenile lihengo libhambile Ayesu ndeende, kubhee nijibhone Ngani jammbone ja upalio gwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Ndekupeta kwa kila jumo jwinu kongo ndendakutangacha Umwenye gwa Annoongo. Nambo nangocheni, niimanyi jwaakwa hata jumo jwinunji, jwaapakumona kabhele. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Henela, leleni nupe ndendakunnobholelanga kweli kubhee handa ipakubhokela jumo pakati jinunji ahobhite nenga ngakokolekwa kwa choachela, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />kwa kubhee nangaleka hata kachoko kunnobholelanga genigala goha gabhagapala Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Mmangange miho mwachinabhenenji, mulilolekeange lyenileyela lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalile Akilisito yakubhee Mboomo jwa Annoongo ammekitinge mwangota mmangange bhakulilokea. Mulilangiange lilubhalo helyo yakubhee Annoongoo jwaatekulihemela kwa mihai ja Mwana Jwabhe. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ndendakuimanya maha muno yakubhee pambakubhoka bhabhajigananga bha unami bhabhabhile handa mamehi gakalipa gapakuhika kwaachinu, na bhenabho ngaolanga kiha na lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Hata pakati jinunji bhapakupitilanga bhandu bhabhahobhalile Akilisito ili bhanhutange mwangota kwaachabhe bhenabho bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhapakulobholanga hikubho ya unami kupala kwaatembanga bhandu na kwaatendanga bhabhakagulange bhenaangota jika.” <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Kwa henela, mmangange miho mmikombokelanga yakubhee kwa muda gwa yaaka hitatu, kilo na muhi, nakaendelea kunnyamukanga kila jumo jwinunji kwa mahohi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Nangocheni ndendakunkamuanga kwa Annoongo na lilobhe lya neema jabhe, lilikombola kunchenganga na kutendelwa gammbone genigala Annoongo gabhakaalobholelanga bhandu bhabhe bhabhatekwaagula. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Nangalokolila mbiha wala bhunyu wala ngobho ya mundu johajola. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Mwangota bhene ntendakuimanya yakubhe mabhoko gangani gatumike ligongo lya kuchipatia hilebhe yangu na ya akaajangu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Kwa muda goha nakibha ndekunnangianga kulandanikia kubhee kwa kupangana mahengo handa genago tupalikwa twaajangatile bhandu bhanga chilebhe, kongo tutendakombokela malobhe ga Hangwana Ayesu bheene, ‘Mbaya muno kubhoha kuliko kupokela.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Apaulo pabhakalongela genago, bhaakatindibhala majugwa pamo nabho bhoha, na kwaajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Bhoha bhatendita kuguta, na kwaatabhuka kwa kwaanyambatila. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Chikubho chichikatendanga kuumalikanga muno nga lyenilyela lilobhe jwabhakalilobhola kubhee bhangakombolike kwaabhona kabhele. Henela bhakaapeleka mpala ku meeli.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Apaulo ajaula ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Patukajomola kutabhukana nabho kwa kiha, tukakwela meeli kujaula mpaka ku Kosi. Malabhi jakwe tukaika ku Lode, na kubhoka konokwe tukajaula ku Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Konokwe tukajikolela meeli jikibha jijenda ku Foinike, henela tukakwela, na tukajaula. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Patukahika mahali patukakombola kukulola kuchining'ina cha Kupulo, tukapetela upande gwa kuchini kujaula ku Silia. Tukahika chilambo cha ku Tilo pajikabhee jenijela meeli jijikibha jituluha mihigo jakwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Konokwe tukaakolelanga bhabhachijigana bha Ayesu, tukatama pamo nabho kwa muda gwa lijuma limo. Bhabhachijigana bhenabho bhakibha bhalongelanga kwa machili ga Mboomo, bhakaalobholelanga Apaulo akotokujenda ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Nambo muda gwitu pagukajomoka tukabhoka. Bhabhachijagana bhenebho pamo na akaahanu na bhana bhabhenji bhakatuchapalianga mpaka nnyenje ja chilambo. Patukaika kumbwani, twabhoha tukatindibhala majugwa tukaajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ngapena tukatabhukana, twenga tukakwela meeli, nabhena bhakabhujanga kwachabhenji.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Twenga tukaendelea na ulendo gwitu kubhoka ku Tilo na tukaika ku Tolemai kwa meeli yakubhee tukajaula kwalolanga akanung'una bhitu bhabhahobhalela Ayesu, tukatama nabho lichobha limo. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Malabhi jakwe tukabhoka tukajaula kuchilambo cha Kaisalia. Konokwe tukajaula ku nyumba ja mundu jwaatangacha Ngani Jammbone jwakemitwa Afilipo tukatama kwaachabhe. Jonojwe akibha jumo jwa bhenibhala saba bhabhaakagulikwa konikola ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Akibha na bhaali ncheche akaahenja bhakibhanga na ukolo gwa kubhee akaalondoi bha kutangacha ngani ya Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Patukatama konokwe machobha kachoko, alondoi jumo jwa Annoongo jwakemitwa Agayo akatuluka kubhoka ku Yudea. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Akahika kwaachitu, akatola nkaanda gwa Apaulo, akachitabha mmabhoko na mmakongono gabhe, akalobhola, “Mboomo jwa Annoongo akita henela, ‘Bhayahudi konikola ku Yelusalemu bhapakwatabha namuna jenjeni mundu akola nkanda hogogo na kwaakamua kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi.’”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Patukajoha genago, twenga na bhenibhala bhandu bhangi bhabhakibhanga penapo tukaapembelea muno Apaulo akotokujenda ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Nambo Apaulo akajangula, “Nng'utanga chiniki? Au mpalanga kunhengelanga ntima gwangu? Mbii tayali ngabha tu kundabhalila munyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu kunokwe ku Yelusalemu, nambo hata kujomoka ligongo lya Ayesu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Paakalepela kutujoanikia tukaaleka, tukalobhola, “Libhapala Hangwana litendeekwe!”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Patukatama penipala kwa machobha kachoko, ngapena tukatabha mihigo jitu, tukaendelea na ulendo gwa kujaula ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Bhabhachijgana bhangi bha Ayesu bha ku Kaisalia, bhakatupelekanga kunyumba ja mundu jwakemitwa Amnasoni yakubhee tukibha tukajaula kutama nabho kwa muda. Jono akibha mundu jwa kubhoka ku Kupulo na jonjojwe akibha jwachijigana jwa Ayesu kwa machobha gajingi.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakwatyangila Ayakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Patukaika ku Yelusalemu, akaanung'una bhabhahobhalela Ayesu bhakatupokela maha muno. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Malabhi jakwe Apaulo akajaula pamo na twenga kongoloka na Ayakobo, na akanaota bhoha bha nyuumba ja Annoongo bhakibhanga kabhele. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Pabhakajomola kulongela nabho, Apaulo akajemeka kwalobholelanga maha chikubho chimo kwa chengi yakubhee Hangwana Annoongo akapangana kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi kupetela ukolo gwabhe. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Bhenibhala bhandu pabhakajoanga genago, bhakaalumbalila Annoongo. Kabhele bhakaalobholela Apaulo, “Anung'una bhitu Apaulo, nkombola kulola kubhee pabhile na nkutuli nkolongwa muno gwa Bhayahudi yakubhee nangocheni bhatendakwahobhalela Ayesu na bhoa bhabhakamulilanga Malagilo ga Amusa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Bhatekujoanga kubhee ntendakwajigananga Bhayahudi bhoa bhabhatamanga pakati ja bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi kubhee bhakotokamulanga Malagilo ga Amusa, bhakotokwahinanga bhana bhabhenji na kubhee bhakotokagulanga hibhatenditanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Nangocheni, bhatekujoanga mwenga mmi pambani pa Yelusalemu henela hikubho hipakubheebholi? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Bahi, ntende handa chitunnobholile. Pambani tubhi nabho bhandu ncheche bhabhatekuchilapila kwaabhokea Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Nchilondanike nabho mu kwalepela mu kulapila kwabhenji, nkalepelele goa gagapalikwa kubhoa, ngapena bhachekulwange majunju gabhenji. Henela bhandu bhoa bhapakumanyanga kubhee ngani yeniyela hibhalobholilwe nnani jinu nga ya unami, na kubhee mwenga tangu ntama handa chigapala Malagilo ga Amusa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ngani ja bhenibhala bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi nambo bhaapokile Ayesu bhakaapelekelanga balua tubhi kwaalobholelanga hikubho tuitendite, bhakoto kulyanganga choachela chibhabhekile minnoongo ja unami, bhakotokulyee mihai, bhakotokulyehe nyama jakupopotolwa, na bhachibhekange kutali na ngongola.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Bahi, malabhi jakwe Apaulo akaatolanga bhenibhala bhandu na bhakachibhekanga ili bhakondekwange handa chiiyobhalilike ligongo lya kwaajopa Annoongo. Ngapena akajingila mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo na kwakongolelanga kupela kwa lichobha lya kuchibheka maha ili kondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo na ngani ja yadaka hiipakubhokekwa ligongo lya kila jumo jwabhenji.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakamulikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Muda machobha genago saba pagakajomoka, Bhayahudi bhabhakibha bhabhokitinge mu chilambo cha ku Asia bhakaabhona Apaulo mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo. Bahi, bhakakolekeanga lilaka mu libhoga lyoha lya bhandu, bhaakaakamula. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Bhakalongelanga kwa lilobhe likolongwa bhabhikulobhola, “Mwabhandu bha ku Isilaeli, ntujangatilange! Hojojo nga jonijola mundu jwabhajigana bhandu kohakoha hikubho hiitaukana na bhandu bha ku Isilaeli, gagakana Malagilo ga Amusa na Nyuumba ja Annoongo. Hata nangocheni atekwajingia bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi mu nyuumba ja Annoongo na kupalekela uhakwa mahali papakondekwa mu kwaajopa Annoongo.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Ligongo ja kulobhola henela nga yakubhee Atolofimo mundu jwa ku Efeso akibha pamo na Apaulo kunnyini. Bhakaganikianga kubhee Apaulo atekwajingia mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Chilambo choha chikajenela ukomu, bhandu bhakaika kubhoka pande yoha bhakaakamula Apaulo, bhakautanga, bhakaabhoha panja ja nyumba ja Annoongo, na popopo milyango ja nyumba ja Annoongo jikajigalikwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Lilubhalo lyela lya bhandu palikapala kwakoma Apaulo, nambo ngani jikaikila akolo bha manyemba bha ku Loma kubhee kuchilambo choa cha Yelusalemu kutwelile ukomi. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Gunakamo, jonijola akolo bha manyemba akaatolanga manyemba gakwe pamo na akaakolo bha manyemba kujaula kupotana na lyenelyo lilubhalo lya bhandu. Nabhena pabhaakabhona akolo bha manyemba, bhakalekanga kwaapota Apaulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Akolo bha manyemba akaajendela Apaulo, akakamula na kukulumikia atabhikwe minyololo jibhele. Ngapena akakonya, “Hojo mundu nga aganiki na atendite chiniki?”<verse eid="ACT 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Kila jumo akibha alongela lyakwe, bhangi bhalobhola henela na bhangi bhalongelanga chilebhe chengi. Ligongo lya ukomu hogwe, akolo bha manyemba bhangakombola kumanya ngani hejo maha. Henela, akakulumikia bhandu bhabhe bhaapeleke Apaulo nkati ja ngoome. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Apaulo pabhakahika pangaachi ya kujingilila nyuumba ya manyemba, manyemba bhakapalikwa kwaapapa ligongo lya ukomu gwa bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Kwa kubhee lilubhalo lya bhandu likaakagula na kupotanga nyenye, “Mwakome, mwakome!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakuchitetea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Manyemba pabhatendita kwaajingia Apaulo nkati ja ngome, Apaulo akajoopa akolo bha manyemba akalobhola, “Ndendakombola kunnobholela chilebhe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Jonijola nkolo jwa manyemba akajaangula, “Bholi, ntendakuchimanya Chigiliki? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Mwenga ngabha jwajola mundu jwa ku Misili yakubhee machobha kachoko gagapetitite akatandubha ukomu na kwaatandaanga matimbanyundo elupu ncheche mpaka kulikonja?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Apaulo akajangula, “Nenga nga Ayahudi, melikwe ku Taliso mu chilambo cha ku Kilikia, nenga nga mundu jwa chilambo chichimanyikana muno. Choonde ndendakunyopa nongele na bhandu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Jonijola nkolo jwa manyemba akaaleka alongele na bhandu. Henela Apaulo akajema nnani ja ngaachi kwa pungilanga lubhoko lwakwe bhandu, na bhandu bhakatama jii, akajemeka kulongela nabho kwa chilongelo cha Chiebulania.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Akanung'una bhangu bha ku Isilaeli na akaatati bhangu nnyoanikiange chindendakuchitetela nnongi jinunji.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Pabhajoanga abhikulongela nabho kwa chilongelo cha Chiebulania, bhakakotokanga jii. Na jonojwe akapunda kolongela, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Nenga nga Ayahudi, meelikwe kuchilambo cha Taliso konokwe ku Kilikia. Nambo nakalelewa mu chilambo hecheche cha Yelusalemu, mmabhoko ga Agamalieli. Bhakanyigana maha mu malagilo ga akaakolo bhitu, nakibha na machili muno kupangana mahengo ga Annoongo handa mwangota chimmilinge leleni. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Nakaalagianga na kwakomanga bhandu bhabhakajikagula ndela hejeje. Nakaakamulanga akanalome na akaahikege na kwatabhanga mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Akung'i Akolo na chibhoga choa cha akanahota bhakombola kulongela chikubho chenecho handa kweli au unami. Kubhoka kwabhenji nakapokela balua na kujipeleka kwa Bhayahudi bhabhabhilinge ku Damasiko. Nakajaula ku Damasiko kupala naakamulange bhena bhandu na kwaletanga bhabhi bhatabhitingwe mpaka ku Yelusalemu ili bhapotekwe.”<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo alongela namuna Ayesu chibhaabhokile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Hikubho 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Henela bahi panakibha nndela kujaula ku Damasiko, pakati ja muhi, ng'ang'anu nhana nkolongwa kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo gukamulikila na kundindila koha koha. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Penapo nakagwee pahi, nakajoa lilobhe libhi kunobholela, ‘Asauli, Asauli, mboni nntendakunagia?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Nenga nakakonya, ‘Mwenga nga aganiki Hangwana?’ Nabhena akanyangula, ‘Nenga na Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti yakubhee mwenga ntendakunagia.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Bahi bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakibha pamo nanenga pakagubhona gonigola nhana, nambo bhangalijoha lilobhe lya jonijola jwalongela na nenga. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Nenga nakakonya, ‘Hangwana ndende chiniki?’ Nabhena Hangwana akanobholela, ‘Nnyinuke nnyingile ku Damasiko, konokwe mpakulobholelwa ngani yoha hiipalikwa kupangana.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Ligongo lya gonigola nhana nkolongwa nangakombola kulola, henela bhenibhala akajangu bhakangamulanga lubhoko mpaka nakahika ku Damasiko.”<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Konokwe ku Damasiko kukibha na mundu jumo jwaakemitwa Aanania, mundu hojwe atendita kugakoonda Malagilo ga Amusa, na akatopelwa muno nnongi ja Bhayahudi bhabhatamita ku Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Aanani akajema kubhandikila nanenga akalobhola, ‘Anung'una bhangu Asauli, nnole kabhele!’ Palapala miho gangu gakajemeka kulola kabhele, na nenga nakaalola Aanania. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Ngapena Aanani akanobholela, ‘Annoongo bha atati bhitu atekunhagula mwenga kupala mpangane gabhagapala mpangane, munnole jonojwe jwaakondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo na kunnyonikia jonojwe mwene abhi kulongela kwa kang'wa jabhe. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwakubhee mpakulongela ngani yabhe kwa bhandu bhoa na mmikwalobholelanga genigala gamugabhonite na kugajoa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Nangocheni mboni ntendakabha? Nyimuke, nkabatichwe na kujelejewa kupala kulekelelwa kulemwa kwinu kwa kulihobhalela lihina lyabhe.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hangwana atendakwatuma Apaulo kwatangachianga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Henela nakabhuja ku Yelusalemu, na pandendita kujopa mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo, nakabhona malolo. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Nakaabhona Hangwana abhikunobholela, ‘Nyoomboteke mmoke pa Yelusalemu, kwakubee bhandu ngakondanga malobhe ginu nnani jangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nenga nakaajangula, ‘Hangwana, bhenaangota bhatendakuimanya ukweli kubhee nenga nga jonijola jwaatendita kujingila mu kila nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi na kwakamulanga na kwapotanga bhenibhala bhabhatendita kunhobhalela. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Antumichi bhinu Asitefano pabhakakomekwa, nenga na mwene nakibha popopo nibhi kuhangalila chikubho penapo na nenga nakalolekea ngobho ya bhandu bhabhaakomita Asitefano.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Hangwana akanobholela, ‘Nyaule, mbakuntuma kutali kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Gonigola nkutuli gwa bhandu gukaajonikia Apaulo mpaka pambani, nambo pabhakolongela malobhe gangani, bhakakweanga malobhe bhabhi kulongelanga, “Munkomange! Mundu handa jonjoni ngapalikwa kubhee jwamomi!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Bhakapundanga kulongela kwa lilobhe likolongwa, na kongo ngobho yabhenji bhabhi kuponganga nnani na kutitimbula lutukunda na lilaka libhakibhanga nalyo. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Jonijola akolo bha manyemba bha ku Loma, akaakulimikianga manyemba bhabhabhilinge pahi jabhe Apaulo ajingiwe nkati ja likukumba lya ngome ja manyemba kupala kwapota hiyakato na akonywe kwa niki bhandu bhatendita kupota nyenye henela. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Nambo pabhakajomola kwaatabha ili bhapoote hiyakato, Apaulo akankonya linyemba jumo jwaajemite penapo, “Bholi, malagilo gapala kwapota hiyakato mundu jwa ku Loma kongo jwaangahukumulwa?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Jonijola akolo bha manyemba pabhakajoa malobhe haga, akaajendela jonijola akolo bha manyemba bha ku Loma na kwaalobholela, “Mpakutenda chiniki? Ligongo hojo mundu nga mundu jwa ku Loma?”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Ngapena jonijola akolo bha manyemba bha ku Loma akaika kwakonya Apaulo, “Nngongolele, mwenga nga mundu bha jwa Loma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Apaulo akaajangula, “Eloo nenga nga mundu jwa ku Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Ngapena akolo bha manyemba ga ku Loma akalobhola, “Ngapalikwa kutumia mbiya hijingi ili ngombole kubhee mundu bha ku Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Apaulo akalobhola, “Nambo nenga nga mundu bha ku Loma kwa kubhelekwa.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Popopo bhenibhala bhabhakapanga kwakonya Apaulo bhakabhokanga penapo, na hata bhenibhala akolo bha manyemba bha ku Loma akajogopa pabhakaimanya kubhee Apaulo jwaakatabha kwa minyololo akibha mundu jwa kubhoka ku Loma.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo apelekwa nnoongi ja chikomiti chikolongwa cha Bhayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Malabhi jakwe, jonijola akolo bha manyemba bha ku Loma akapala kuimanya kulemwa kwa Apaulo kubhakatenda kwa Bhayahudi. Henela, akajogola Apaulo minyololo, na kulumikia akaakung'i akolongwa na akanahota bha Chikomiti ili bhatendange chikomiti. Ngapena akaaleta Apaulo akaajemea nnoongi ja Chikomiti.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Apaulo akaalolekeha muno bhenibhala akanahota bha Chebule, akajemeka kulongela, “Akaanung'una bhangu, mpaka leleni ndenda kutama kwa ntima chindegele nnoongi ja Annoongo.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ligongo lya chikubho heche Akung'i Akolongwa Anania bhakaakulumikianga bhenibhala bhabhakibha bhabhandikile Apaulo bhampote makopi pakang'wa. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Bahi, Apaulo akaalobholela, “Annoongo bhene apakumpota mwenga andendemundu bhaammile handa likukumba gwabhapakihe wakala! Kwakubhee ntamite penapo ili kunhukumula kwa malagilo na kongo mwe mwabhene ntendakuleka malagilo kwa kulumikia mbotekwe?”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakajemanga kubhandikila na Apaulo bhakaalobholela, “Bholi, ngajogopa kwatukana Akung'i Akolo bha Annoongo?”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Apaulo akajangula, “Mwakanung'una bhangu, nangaimanya yakubhee bhenabho bhakibha Akung'i Akolo. Kwa kubhee jijaandikwe, ‘Nkotokwaalongelela ngangali mmbone akolo bha bhandu bhinu.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Apaulo pabhakaimanya kubhee bhandu bha jenijela Chebule bhakibhanga Mafalisayo na bhangi bhakibhanga Masadukayo, “Mwakaang'una bhangu, nenga na Amfalisayo, na akaabhelei bhakibhanga Amfalisayo. Pambani bhatekundakia ligongo lya kuhobhalela kubhee bhandu bhabhawilinge bhapakuyokanga.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Pabhakajomola kulongela henela, mpwato kukajemeka pakati ja Mafalisayo na Masadukayo na Chebule joha jitekumetunika. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Ligongo lya kumetunika kwebhenji kukibha hoko, Masadukayo bhalongelanga kubhee gwakwa uyoho, wala jwakwa ntumichi jwa kunani kwa Annoongo wala mboomo, nambo Mafalisayo bhatendakuhobhalela hagaga goha gatatu. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Kukabhee na ukomu nkolongwa, bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa bhangi yakubhee nga chibhoga Mafalisayo, bhakajemanga kutaukana kwa machili bhakalobholanga, “Twangabhona kulemwa kohakola kwa mundu hojo! Komboleka likabhee lihoka au ntumichi jwa Annoongo atendakongoloka nabho.” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Bulwa gukibha nkolongwa muno hata jonijola akolo bha manyemba akajogopa kubhee Apaulo bhakaahekite hipande hipande. Henela akakulumikianga manyemba gakwe kujingilila nkati ja lyenilyela lilubhalo bhakaabhoe Apaulo na kwabhujia mu ngome.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Kilo chela, hangwana akajema kubhandikila na Apaulo, “Nkotokujogopa! Handa chimwalobholilinge bhandu pambani pa Yelusalemu, mpakutenda hela hela kunokwe ku Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhayahudi bhaloleanga ndela ja kwakoma Apaulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Papakachee Bhayahudi bhakatenda chikomiti cha ntemela bhakakondenanga kwa kulapila kubhee, “Tulyeehopo wala tung'weehopo choachela mpaka patupakwakoma Apaulo.” <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Bhandu kupunda alobaini nga bhabhakongana na kulapila kutenda chene chikubho. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Bhakaendelea akanachilongola bha akaakung'i akolo na akanahota kulobhola, “Tutekutabha pamo kwa kulapila yakubhee tulyeehopo wala tung'weehopo choachela mpaka patupakwaakoma Apaulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Henela bahi, mwangota pamo na Chebule bhapelekange ngani kwa akolo bha manyemba ili bhaalete Apaulo kwinunji, ntechitendange handa mpalanga kwakonyelekea muno nnani ja ngani jakwe. Natwenga tubhile tayali kwaakoma bhabhi tangu bhangaika pambani.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Nambo mwipwa jwabhe Apaulo pakaajoa nnani ja ngani hejo jibou, akajaula kunikola ku ngome ja manyemba na kwaalobholela Apaulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Ngapena Apaulo akankema jumo jwa akolo jwa lilubhalo lya manyemba akaalobholela, “Mupeleke hojojo akakombo kwa akolo, atekola chilebhe cha kwaakongolela.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Henela jonijola akolo jwa lilubhalo lya manyemba akaapeleka jonijola kakombo kwa akolo bha manyemba akaalobholela, “Apaulo, jonijola ntabhikwa, akangema na kunyoopa ninnete hojojo kakombo kwachiinu, ligongo atekola chilebhe cha kunkongolela.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Jonijola akolo akakamula jwajola kakombo lubhoko, akapeleka nnyenje na akaakonya, “Mpala kungongolela chiniki?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Jonijola kakombo akalobhola, “Bhayahudi bhatekondananga bhanyoope mwapeleke Apaulo ku Chebule jikolo, lyabhenji malabhi kwa lujambuo yakubhee bhapalanga kutendanga uchunguchi muno gwa ngani jabhe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Nambo nkotokondana nabho kwa maana bhabhile bhandu makomi ncheche bhabhabhilinge tayali kwajobhalela. Bhatekutabhanilanga kwa kulapila ngalyanganga wala kung'we mpaka bhaakome Apaulo. Nangocheni bhabhilinge tayali, bhalendela mwaajeketele kujopa kwabhenji.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Jonijola akolo bha manyemba akaanneka ajaule na akaanyamuka abhikulobhola, “Nkotokunnobholela mundu joha jola yakubhee ntekunobholela ngani heyeye.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakwahamia ku Kaisalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Ngapena jonijola akolo bha manyemba akakemanga akaakolo bhabhele na kwalobholelanga, “Mwabhekange maha manyemba mia hibhele, bhandu bhabhakwelanga falasi makomi saba, na manyemba bhabhabhilinge na mikoha mia hibhele, mmangange tayali kujaulanga ku Kaisalia chaa tatu ja kilo ja leleni. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Kabhele mmekange maha falasi yengi hiipakutumiwa na Apaulo mumpelekange na kwahikia maha, kwa Afelikisi atawala bha ku Yuda.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Ngapena akolo akajaandika balua kwa Afelikisi atawala bha ku Yuda henela.<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Nenga Akilaudio Lusia, ndendakunnyandikila mwenga akolo Afelikisi, kupala kunchalimia. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Bhayahudi bhakaakamula mundu hojo na bhakapalanga kwakoma. Nambo panakapata ngani kubhee nga mundu jwa ku Loma nakatola malubhalo gangu ga manyemba kwahokoa. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Nakapala kuimanya alemwite chiniki, henela nakaapeleka nnongi ja Chebule jabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Henela nakahimanya kubhee ngani jene jikibh nnani ja mitau nnani ja malagilo habhenji, henela nangabhona choachela chibhakalemwa na chichipakwatenda akomekwe au kutabhwa mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Panakalobholelwa kubhee Bhayahudi bhalolea ndela ja kupala kwakoma, nakabhona mbaya naalete kwachinu na nakaalobholelanga bhenibhala bhandu bhabhate kwatakia bhakongolele nnoongi jinu chibhaatakia.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Henela manyemba, kwa kukagula gabhakalobholelwanga, bhakaatola Apaulo kilo kwaapeleka mpaka ku chilambo cha Antipatili. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Malabhi jakwe bhenibhala manyemba bhabhajendita kwa makongono bhakabhujanga ku ngome ja manyemba, bhakaalekanga bhenibhala manyemba bhakwalenga falasi bhakaendeleanga na ulendo pamo na Apaulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Manyemba gala pabhaikanga ku Kaisalia na kwapekea balua jonijola Afelikisi atawala bha ku Yuda na kwabheka Apaulo pahi ja ulendei gwabhe. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Atawala Afelikisi pabhajomola kujichoma balua hejo akaakonya Apaulo mmokite koji. Pabhakaimanya kubhee abhoka ku Kilikia, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />akalobhola, “Mbakujoanikia nhalo gwinu pabhapakuikanga pambani.” Ngapena akakulumikia Apaulo bhaabheke pahi ja ujemelei nkati ja chebule ja amwenye Ahelode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Bhayahudi bhaatakia Apaulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Pagakapeta machobha nhano, Akung'i Akolo Aanania akahika ku chilambo cha Kaisalia pamo na akanahota na abhi kulongana mundu jumo jwaumanyo ga malagilo ga Amusa jwakemwa Atetulo, bhakaajendelela kwa Afelikisi atawala bhakaatakia Apaulo nnoongi ja atawala. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Apaulo akakemwa ajingile nkati, Atetulo akajemeka kulongela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Akolo Afelikisi, utawala gwinu gwa malango gutuletile twenga kuhengwa, na hilebhe hijingi yammbone hiitenditwe ligongo lya chilambo chitu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Machobha goa na kila mahali, na kwa namuna joajela, akolo jwammbone Afelikisi, tugapokile haga goa kwa chukulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Nambo, ngapalikwa kuguhobhea muda gwinu nnyingi, tutendakunnyopa kwa wema gwinu, nyoonikie ngani jitu jijipijipi. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Tuimanyite kubhee mundu hojo nga nkomu, atendakulimikia ukomu nkati ja Bhayahudi pa chilambo poha. Jonjoni nga achilongola bha lyenilyela lilubhalo lya bhandu bha ku Nazaleti, <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />kabhele akalenga kutenda hikubho yangapalikwa mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo, henela tukaakamula tukapala kwahukumula kagulana na malagilo gitu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Nambo Alusia akolo bha manyemba, akatuikila na machili gajingi akatupokaa kubhoka kwachitu. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Akakulumikia bhenibhala bhabha bhandu bhabhaatakia bhaike nnoongi jinu, handa munkonyite mundu hojo mwenga mwabhene mpakombola kuimanya kubhoka kwachabhe hikubho yoha hiitwatakia kwachinu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Bhayahudi bhangi bhakakonda bhabhi kulongela malobhe gabhakalongela Apaulo nga ga kweli.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakuchitetea nnongi ja Afelikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Akolo Afelikisi akaapekea chilolelo Apaulo ajemeke kulongela. Apaulo akalobhola,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Ndendakuimanya kubhee ntekubhee aliwali mu chilambo chenijeni kwa yaaka hijingi, henela mbakuchitetela kwa kuhangalala nnoongi jinu. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Nkombola kuimanya maha kubhee, gapetite machobha komi na gabhele jika, kubhokela panakajaula kwajopa Annoongo ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Habha bhabhatekundakia bhangangolelanga mikuntauka mundu johajola. Bhanganolelanga mmikwalokolokea bhandu mu Nyumba ja Annoongo, au kwakolokeanga nkutuli gwa bhandu mu Nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi, au pohapala pangi pannyini. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Kabhele ngakombolanga kongolelanga ukweli kwa hikubho yeniyela hibhatendakundakia kwaachinu. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Nambo, ndendakonda kubhee nenga ndendakwaachalila Annoongo bha atati bhitu, ndendakutama kwa kukagula ndela, yakubhee Bhayahudi bhakemanga nga ndela ja unami. Ndendakuhobhalela kila chilebhe chichijaandikwe mu hitabu ya Malagilo ga Amusa na akalondohi bha Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Nanenga ndendakuhobhalela handa chibhatendakuhobhalela bhenaangota, kubhee bhandu bhabhakondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo na akaabohu bhoa bhapakuyokanga. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Henela mbakuchimila machobha goa na ntima chindegele nnoongi ja Annoongo na nnoongo ja bhandu.”<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Bahi, panakatama kutali kwa yaaka hijingi, nakabhuja ku Yelusalemu na kwapelekela hilebhe ya kwajangatilanga akaajangu na kubhoa chadaka kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Panakibha ndenda kuchibheka maha ligongo kondekwa kwa kwajopa Annoongo, ngapena pabhakangolela mu Nyuumba ja Anoongo. Pangabhee na bhandu pamo na nenga na wala nangakwelekeanga bhandu kutenda ukomu. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Nambo kukibha na Bhayahudi bhangi kubhoka ku Asia, bhena nga bhabhakapalikwa kutama nnoongi jinu na kulongela handa chibhile chikubho choachela chibohu chindendite. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Mwaleke habha bhandu bhabhabhilinge pambani bhalobholange chinnemwite panakajema nnoongi ja Chebule, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />ndendakulongela lilobhe limo tu nnoongi jinu, ‘Nntendankunhukumulanga leleni ligongo lya kunnobholelanga kubhee bhabhawilinge bhapakuyokanga.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Bahi akolo Afelikisi jwaakaimanya maha ndela jela akabheka lichobha lyengi lya kujoanikia ngani jenejo. Akaalobholelanga, “Pabhapakuhika akolo bha manyemba Alusia, nga pambakuhumula ngani jinunji.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Ngapena akakulumikia akolo bha chibhoga cha manyemba aabheke Apaulo pahi ja ujemelei nambo abhe na upenyo gwa kupanga hilebhe yabhe kachoko na akaaganja bhabhenji bhapekewange upenyo gwa kwaaletela gagapalikwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afelikisi jwaajoanikia Apaulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Pagakapeta machobha kachoko Afelikisi pabhakaika pamo na Adulusia anubhabhe, jwaakibha Ayahudi, akalagia bhaakemele Apaulo na kwajoanikia pabhakibha atendakulongela maana ja kwahobhalela Ayesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Nambo Apaulo pabhakiba abhikulongela kwa ngani ja kondekwa, kuchihibhila na kwa ngani ja kuhukumulwa kukuhika, Afelikisi akibha na bhoga na kulongela, “Henela nangocheni bahi! Ntendakombola kubhoka pambakupata muda mbakunkema kabhele.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Muda gogogo Afelikisi akalolea kubhee ampekee chilebhe choachela kupala alekelele. Henela akibha atendakwaakema mala jijingi na kongoloka nabho.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Pahikapeta yaaka hibhele, Apolokio Afesito akajingila mu utabhala mahali pa Afelikisi, nambo kwa kubhee Afelikisi akapala kwabhajilanga Bhayahudi, akaaleka Apaulo mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Apaulo ajopa chitaka lyabhe lijaule kwa akolo bha chilambo cha ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Machobha ga tatu pabhakahika Afesito ku Kaisalia akakwela kujaula ku Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />konokwe Akaakung'i Akolo pamo na akanachilongola bha chiyahudi bhakajendelela na kwachitaki Apaulo, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />bhakaajopa muno Afesito bhaatendele chenichela chibhachipala kwa kwaaleta Apaulo ku Yelusalemu, kwa kubhee bhakibhanga bhalolea ndela ja kwaakoma akibha nndela. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Afesito akajangula, “Apaulo atekuhibhililwa konokwe ku Kaisalia, nanenga namwene mbakujaula konokwe pakubhandikila. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Mwaalekenge akanachilongola bhinunji bhajendange pamo na nenga bhakabhoange ngani jabhenji handa bhatekupangana choachela chibohu.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Afesito akatama nabho kubhandikila machobha nane au komi, ngapena akabhuja ku Kaisalia. Na lichobha lilikahika akajenda penipala pa chebule na kutama pachitengu cha kuhukumulila, akakulumikia Apaulo bhaletwe nnongi jabhe. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Apaulo pabhakapitila, bhenibhala Bhayahudi bhabhakibhanga bhatulukinge kubhoka ku Yelusalemu bhakajemanga bhakibha bhatekwatindila, bhakaletanga mihalo jijingi mikolongwa muno yakubhee bhangakombolanga kukongolela ukweli gwa chikubho cheene. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Ngapena Apaulo akachitetea, akalongela, “Nenga nangatenda chikubho choha chela chichitaukana na malagilo ga Bhayahudi au cha Nyumba ja Annoongo au chichitaukana na amwenye akolo jwa ku Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Afesito, akapala kwabhajila Bhayahudi, akaakonya Apaulo, “Bholi, npala kujaula ku Yelusalemu na kujangula mihalo nnongi jangu konokwe?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Apaulo akajangula, “Nenga nangocheni ndekujema nnoongi ja chebule ja Akaisali, yakubhee nga kumbalikwa kuhukumulikwa. Handa henela mwenga mwabhene chimuimanya maha nangaatendelanga Bhayahudi kulemwa koha kola. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Bahi handa nenga ndekulemwa kwa kupangana kukupalikwa kujomoka, nganaopo kujomoka. Nambo handa mihalo gagabhekitwe kwachangu na habha Bhayahudi ngabha ga kweli, jwakwa johajola jwakombola kumbeleka kwabhenji ku Yelusalemu. Ndendakujopa bahi mbelekwe kwa Akaisali ngahukumulwe!”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Afesito pabhakajomola kulongela na Chebule lyabhe, akatangacha, “Mwenga ntekujopa kupelekwa kwa amwenye akolo jwa ku Loma, bahi, mpakujaula kwa amwenye akolo jwa ku Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afesito atendakwaalobholela Agilipa ngani ja nhwalo gwa Apaulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Pagakapeta machobha kachoko Amwenye Agilipa na alombo jwabhe jwakemitwa Abenike bhakahika ku Kaisalia kwaabhandikia Afesito handa atabhala. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Pabhakibhanga konokwe ku Kaisalia machobha gajingi, Afesito na Amwenye bhakalobholelana genigala gabhatekwatakia Apaulo, bhakalobholanga, “Abhile mundu jumo pambani yakubhee Afelikisi atekwaleka mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Panakajaula konokwe ku Yelusalemu, akaakung'i akolo na akanahota bha Bhayahudi bhakantakia na kunyoopanga naahukumule handa atekulemwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Nambo nenga nakaalobholelanga kubhee ngabha chiiyobhalilikwe ku Loma kummoha mundu joajola ahukumulwe tangu jwaakutakiwa jwangakongana na jwaatakiwa jwake. Na jono apekewe upenyo gwa kuchitetea ngani ja mihalo jabhanhukumula. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Henela pabhahikanga pambani pamo na nenga, nangakabha, malabhi jakwe nakakema chikomiti cha Chebule, nakatama pa chitengu changu cha hukumulo, nakalagia jono mundu bhannete. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Bhenibhala bhabhatekutakiwa pabhakajemanga, bhangalongelanga choachela chibohu handa chinakahobhalela. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Badala jakwe bhakibhanga na kutaukana kwa ngani ja kujopa kwabhenji na kwa ngani ya mundu jumo jwaatekujomoka jwakemitwa Ayesu yakubhee Apaulo akaendelea kulobhola kubhee jwamomi. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Nangamanya chakutenda kwa ngani ja nhwalo gonogwe. Bahi nakaakonya Apaulo handa akapala kujaula konikola ku chebule ja mihalo ku Yelusalemu kwaajangulanga nhwalo gonogwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Nambo Apaulo pabhakaajopa ahukumulwe na amwenye akolo bha ku Loma, akajopa alekeelewe mpaka chibhapakuamua amwenye akolo bha ku Loma, henela nakaamua atame mu chitabho mpaka pambakombola kwaapeleka kwa amwenye akolo bha ku Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Ngapena Aagilipa akaalobholela Afesito, “Mbala kunnyoanikia mundu hojwe nanenga namwene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Afesito akaajangula, “Mpakwaajoa malabhi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Malabhi jakwe Aagilipa na Abenike bhakaikanga kwa kuhangalala kukolongwa bhakajingilanga muchebule ja kuhukumula pamo na akaakolo bha Manyemba na akaakolo bha chilambo. Afesito akaakulumikia Apaulo bhaalete nkati, <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />akaendelea kulobhola, “Amwenye Agilipa, na mwangota bhammilinge pambani pamo na twenga, ntendakummona mundu hojojo! Chibhoga choha cha Bhayahudi bhakakokolekela kwa ngani ja jono mundu konokwe ku Yelusalemu na pambani ku Kaisalia, bhakalobholanga kwa malobhe makolongwa yakubhee ngapalikwa kuhigalia amomi. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Nenga nangabhona chibhalemwite hata apalikwa komekwa. Nambo kwa henela Apaulo akajopa apelekwe kwa Amwenye akolo bha ku Loma, nannenga mbakwaapeleka konokwe ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Nambo kwangu nenga nanga choachela cha kwaajandikila amwenye akolo bha ku Loma. Nga mana hojo mundu ndekwaleta pambani nnoongi jinu kupala mwaakonye ili ngombole cha kwaajandikila na kwaakongolela. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kwa kubhee ndendakuganikia nga mbeenje kwaapeleka atabhwa kwa amwenye akolo bha ku Loma pangali kujandika hikubho hibohu hibhatekupangana.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakuchitetea nnongi ja amwenye Aagilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Bahi, amwenye Aagilipa akaalobholela Apaulo, “Nchitetee.” Penapo Apaulo akanyulula lubhoko lwabhe kulangia kujemeka kuchitetea.<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Amwenye Agilipa, ndenda kuchilola namwene bahati leleni kuchitetea nnoongi jinu ngani ja mihalo joha yakubhee Bhayahudi bhakatakia nenga. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Kwa kubhee mwenga nga ntendakujimanya ndela jijikondekwa na Bhayahudi na hikubho hitupwatanilana, bahi ndendakunnyopa nnyoanikie kwa kutongamanika.”<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Bhayahudi bhoa bhatendakujimanyanga ngani ja umomi gwangu kubhokela lolo, namuna chindekutama kubhokela kandahi pakati ja chilambo changu konokwe ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Bhenaangota batendakumanyanga nenga kwa machobha gajingi, na bhatendakombola kugalobhola genago gandendite handa bhapalitinge, kubhee kubhoka kandai nakibha jumo jwa chibhoga cha bhandu chibhoga Mafalisayo chichikamula malagilo ga dini cha chiyahudi kupunda chibhoga chengi choachela. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Nangocheni bhatekundakia pambani ligongo lya kuhobhalela kwa chenichela chibhakalobhola Annoongo kubhee apakwapekea akanahota bhitu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Ahadi hejo nga jenijela makabila komi na gabhele bhatendakuhobhalela kujibhona jibhikubhokela, na bhenaangota bhatendakwatumikila Annoongo kwa ntima goha muhi na kilo. Mwe amwenye, ligongo lya gangani Bhayahudi bhatendakutakia ligongo lya kuhobhalela konokwe! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Kwa niki joajola pakati jinunji ngaganikia kubhee nga kulimba Annoongo kwayoanga bhabhawilinge?”<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Nenga namwene kabhele ndendakuhobhalela kubhee nga lihengo lyangu kupangana chikubho choachela ili kulikana lihina lya Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Yene hikubho nakaiendanga panakibha konokwe ku Yelusalemu. Nenga jika, ngibha mbatite ukolo kubhoka kwa Akakung'i Akolo, ngapata kwaalekelanga munyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu bhajingi bha bhandu bha Annoongo. Nabhonji bhakahukumulikwa komekwanga, nakatenda gudugudu ja kukoonda. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Mala jijingi nakajaula mu nyuumba yabhenji ya konganilana Bhayahudi na kwaapotanga na kwakulumikia bhaaponje Annoongo. Lilaka lyangu kwachabhenji likibha likolongwa hata nakaakagulanga mpaka mu hilambo yengi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakongolela chibhaokwike</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Hikubho 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Lichobha limo, panakibha mu ulendo kujaula ku Damasiko, nakibha na mamulaka na malagilo kubhoka kwa akaakung'i Akolo. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Mwe amwenye, muda panakibha nndela, chaa chita ja muhi, nakabhona nhana nkolongwa kupunda gwa lyobha gubhikumulikila kupitila kunani kwa Annoongo, gukandindila nenga na bhenibhala bhanakalongana nabho. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Twenga twaabhoha tukagwehe pahi, nanenga nakajoa lilobhe libhikunobholela kwa chilongelo cha Chiebulania, ‘Asauli, Asauli! Kwaniki ntendakunhulaha? Ntendakuchiulaha mwabhene kutaukana nanenga handa lipoonda jwapota mateke nhimbati gwa hangwana bhabhe.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Nenga nakaakonya, ‘Nga ganiki mwenga Hangwana?’ Nabhena Hangwana akajangula, ‘Nenga nga Ayesu yakubhee mwenga ntendakunagia. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Nnyeme gweema. Ndekummokea kupala nimmeke maha kubhee antumichi bhangu. Mpakwalobholela bhandu bhajingi hikubho himuibhonite leleni na genigala gambakupunda kunnangia. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Mbakunhokoa kubhoka kwa Bhayahudi bhajinu na kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhangi yakubhee nenga ndendakuntuma kwachabhenji. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Mpakwahunukulanga miho gabhenji ili bhakombolange kumanya nenga na bhabhokange mulubhendo na kujingila mu nhana, bhabhoke mu machili ga Lichetani na kujingila mu umwenye gwa Annoongo, kupala kunhobhalela, ili bhakombolange kulekelelwanga ubou na bhabhangange pamo na bhenibhala bhabhatenda kunhobhalela.’”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakongolela mahengo gabhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Henela, Amwenye Aagilipa, nenga ngakombola kubhee na mitahu kwa genigala ganigabhonite kunani kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ligongo helyo nakajemeka kutangacha kujemekela kwa bhandu bha ku Damasiko, na panakajomola konokwe nakajaula kwa bhandu bha ku Yelusalemu na chilambo choha cha ku Yudea, na kwa bhandu bhoa bhanga Bhayahudi. Nakaakulumikianga bhaalobholele Annoongo chibhatekulemwanga na kuleka na bhaatendebhukile Annoongo na kulangia kwa hikubho yakubhee bhapendekwike na kuleka ndela yabhenji ya lolo. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ligongo helyo, Bhayahudi bhakangamulanga panakibha mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo, bhakapalanga kungoma. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Nambo Annoongo akanyangatila, na henela mpaka lichobha lya leleni ndekujema maha nibhikuendelea kulobholela genigala ganakagalola kwa bhoa, akolongwa na akachokochoko. Nenga ngalongela choachela kupunda ja genigala yakubhee gabhakalobholanga Amusa na akaalondoi bha Annoongo kubhee gapakupitila, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Akilisito hikapalikwa alage na kubhee bha kujemeka kuyoka, apakwamulikilanga nhana gwa wokovu kwa bhandu bhoha, kwa Bhayahudi akaajabhe na kabhele kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Apaulo pabhakaika pambani kuchitetea kwabhe, Afesito akalongela kwa lilobhe likolongwa, “Apaulo! Ntekola na mpangahi! Kuchoma kwinu muno kutendakunnekela mpangai!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Nambo Apaulo akalongela, “Nenga nanga mpangai mwaakolo Afesito. Chinobhola nga ukweli. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Mwenga Amwenye Aagilipa ntendakuimanya hikubho heye, henela ndendakombola kulongela pangali bhoga nnoongi jinu. Nanga bhoga yakubhee hikubho heyoyo hitendakumanyikana kwinu maana chikubho hecheche changatendeka kwa kuchihiya. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Amwenye Aagilipa, bholi, mwenga ntendakwahobhalela akaalondoi bha Annoongo? Ndendakuimanya kubhee ntendakwahobhalela.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Aagilipa akaajangula Apaulo, “Bholi kwa malobhe ginu kachoko mpakundenda kubhee Akilisito!”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Apaulo akaajangula, “Najoopa Annoongo yakubee, kwa muda nyipijipi au ntandamao, ngabha mwenga jika bali bhoha bhabhanyoanga leleni bhapatange kubhee handa chimile nenga, pangali minyololo jenjeni.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Pabhakaolobhola genago amwenye Agilipa, na Afesito akolo bha ku Yudea, Abelinike na bhenibhala bhoha bhabhabhilinge pamo nabho, bhakajemanga. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Pabhakabhokanga nkati, bhakalobholelananga, “Mundu hojojo jwangatenda choachela chichikaapalikwa kujomoka au kutabhikwa.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Na jono Agilipa akaalobholela Afesito, “Mundu hojojo akakombwile kujogolelwa handa akibha alekelilwe kujaula kwa Akaisali, amwenye akolo bha ku Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Apaulo apelekwa ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Pajikaamulikwa kubhee tujaulange ku Italia kupetela ku bahali, Apaulo pamo na akaatabhwa bhangi bhakabhekwanga pahi ja ujemelei gwa akolo bha lilubhalo lya manyemba jwaakemitwa Ajuliasi jwaakibha pakati ja lilubhalo lilikemitwa, “Lilubhalo lya amwenye akolo bha ku Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tukajemeka ulendo kwa kukweela meeli jijibhokela chilambo cha ku Aadilamito jijikibha jitendakujenda na kupetela bandali hihibhile kumbwani ja Asia, na Aalisitako mundu jwa ku Makedonia jwabhokile ku Tesalonike akibha na twenga mu ulendo. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Malabhi jakwe tukahika ku bandali ja ku Sidoni. Ajuliasi akaatendela Apaulo maha kwa kwaalekelela bhalole akaaganja bhabhe na kupata hilebhe hibhakaipala. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Kubhoka konokwe tukaendelea na ulendo, nambo kwa kubhee mboongo jitenditakutuhibhila nnongi jitu. Tukapetela upande gwa chining'ina cha ku Kupulo, upande gugukibha na mboongo kachoko. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Patukajomboka bahali jijikibha upande gwa ku Kilikia na ku Pamfilia, tukahika kuchilambo cha Mila, gugubhile nkati ja chilambo cha Lukia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Penapo tukakolela meeli jimo ja Alekizandilia jijijaula ku Italia na jonijola akolo jwa lilubhalo lya Ajuliasi akatukweleha nkati ja meeli jenejo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Kwa machobha gajingi tujeendita mbolembole, na kwa kulimba tukaika kubhandikila na ku Nido. Ligongo mboongo jikibha tangu gutendakutuhibhila, henela tukajaula tukapeta upande gwa kuulabho ja ku Kilete kubhandikila ku lasi ja Salumone tukaendelea na ulendo kwa kulimba nngulugulu ya bahali. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Tukajenda kwa kulimba nngulugulu jakwe mbolembole tukaika mahali papakemwa, “Bandali Jambone,” kubhandikila na chilambo cha ku Lasea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Muda nnyingi gukibha guhobhite, na hata lichobha lya kutabha likibha lipetite. Na ulendo gwitu mu bahali gukibha gwa kujogoa muno, ligongo muda gonogwe gukibha nga baada ja muuda gwa kutabha. <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Akaanung'una bhangu, mona kubhee ulendo hogogo gupakubhee gwa kulaga na kuhobhea hilebhe hijingi ngabha kwa meeli jika na mihigo himpetulinge, nambo kabhele kwa umomi gwitu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Nambo jonijola akolo bha chilongola bha manyemba akajoanika muno malobhe ga jonijola jwajeendea meeli na akola meeli na kuleka kujoanikia malobhe gabhakalobhola Apaulo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kwa kubhee bandali hejo jangabhee mahali pa kuhalala pa kutama muda gwa malili, bhajingi bhakapalanga ulendo gujendelee, bhabhikuhobhalela kuhikanga ku Foinike na kutama konokwe machobha goa ga malili. Bandali jenejo jikibha kuchining'ina cha ku Kilete jikibha upande gwa kusini kuuwelo na kasikazini kuwelo.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboongo ngolongwa mu bahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Bahi, mboongo jijibhoka kusini jikajemeka kupooga kachoko kachoko, bhakaganikia kubhee bhakombolanga kupangana chenichela chibhapalanga, henela bhakabhoanga chiano cha kujemea meeli na kujemeka na ulendo kujaula kuchining'ina cha ku Kilete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Nambo pagukapeta muda nyipinyipi, mboongo jijibhii na machili jijikemitwa, “Mboongo ja kasikazini.” jikajemeka kupoga kubhoka kuchining'ina. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Mboongo jikajipota jenijela meeli, na kwa kubhee twangakombola kujipeleka meeli konikola kukubhokita mboongo, tukajileka jipelekwe konikola kujibhoka mboongo. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Tukapelekwa chindema mpaka ku chiluumba chimo chichokochoko chichikemwa Kauda, tukakombola kuguokoa ntumbwi nchoko gwa kuokolea gugukibha nkati ja meeli kwa kulimba. Bhandu pabhakaguuta ntumbwi nchoko gonogwe na kugujingia mu meeli bhajitindia lugoji pahi ja meeli ili kujitabha jikotokulekana, bhaka <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Bhenibhala akaajangatii bha mu jenijela meeli bhakaguutanga ntumbwi gwa meeli nkati, ngapena bhakaguiligilanga meeli lugoji na kutabha kwa machili. Bhakajogopanga kubhee bhakakombwilinge kukwama mu nhanga gugubhile nngulugulu ja kumbwani ja ku Libiya. Kwa henela bhakatuluanga chiano cha kutopa na kujilekanga meeli jiutwange na mboongo. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Mboongo jikaendelea kupoga kwa machili muno na kujipeleka meeli kono na kono na malabhi jakwe bhandu bhakajemekanga kujehanga panja mihigo jijikibha nkati ja meeli. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Lichobha lya tatu, bhakajemekanga kujeanga mmaachi hilebhe ya mu meeli kwa mabhoko gabhenji bhene. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwa machobha gajingi bhangakombolanga kulola lyobha wala ndoondwa, mboongo ngolongwa jikaendelea kupoga muno, tukahengeleka mitima na kulola kubhee ngalama.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Bhandu pabhakatama machobha majingi pangali kulyehe chakulya, Apaulo akajema pakati jabhenji, akalobhola, “Mwaakanung'una bhangu, handa nkagajoanikia malobhe gangu na tukotokuendelea na ulendo kubhoka ku Kilete. Handa nkatenditinge henela tukaokwike na kuhalibika kwa meeli na kuhobhea mihigo. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Nambo nangocheni ndendakunnyopanga nchipekeange ntima, jwakwa hata jumo jwinunji jwapakujomoka, meeli jika nga jijipakuhalibika. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Annoongo yakubhee nenga nga bhakwe na ndendakwaatumikila licho kimuho akaatuma antumichi bhabhe bha kunani kwa Annoongo akamokela, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />akanobholela, ‘Apaulo, nkotokujogopa! Ligongo mpalikwa nkajeme nnongi ja amwenye akolo bha ku Loma, na bhena Annoongo atekuntendela gammbone, na ligongo linu mwenga Annoongo apakuntendela gammbone ga kwaakoha bhoa bhabhabbhilinge ulendo gumo na mwenga bhakotokutinika wala kujomoka.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Henele, mwakolongwa, nchipekeange ntima! maana ndendakwaobhalela Annoongo kubee apakutenda handa chibhatekunobholela. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Nambo meeli jipakupelekwa na kukwama mu chining'ina yakubhee twangachimanya.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Kilo gwa lichobha lya komi na ncheche, tukibha tangu tutendita kokotwa kono na kono mu Bahali ja Adilia. Pajikabhandikila pakati ja kilo bhandu akaajangatii bha meeli bhakaganikianga kubhee tubhandikile kumbwani. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Bahi bhakatabhanga chiano mu ng'oji na kuchitulua pahi ili kupema kunyendea kwa machi, na bhakapatanga mita makomi ncheche, nambo pabhakabhujilanga kupema kabhela bhakapatanga mita makomi gatatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Bhoa tukajogopa kutumbia meeli mu mwala, bhakatuluanga hiyano ncheche ya kujemea meeli na bhakajopanga kuchee chindema. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Bhabhatandaa meeli bhakaloleanga ndela ja kutilanga mu meeli, henela bhakatuluanga mu bahali ntumbwi gugukibha mu meeli, bhabhikuchitendanga kubhee bhajaulanga kutuluanga hiyano ya kujemea nnoongi ja meeli. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Nambo Apaulo akalobholela jonijola akolo bha chibhoga na manyemba gabhe, “Handa akaajangatii bha meeli habha ngaigalilanga nkati ja meeli, ngaokokanga.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Henela bhenibhala manyemba bhakaeketanga migoji jijikakamulila ntumbwi gonigola, bhakagulekanga gutolekwe na machi. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Tuputupu, Apaulo akaalekelanga ntima bhalyangange chakulya, kwa kwaalobholelanga, “Kwa machobha komi na ncheche nangocheni ntekubhee mu bhoga na mwangalyanganga chilebhe choachela. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Bahi, ndendakunyoopanga nlyangange chakulya kwa kubhee ntendakuchipalanga ili nkombolange kubhe bhamomi. Jwakwa hata mundu jumo jwaapakuhulala.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Pabhakajomola kulongela henela, Apaulo akatola nkate, akaachukulu Annoongo nnongoi jabhenji bhoha, akagumetula, akajemeka kulyehee. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Pena bhoha bhakalekelwanga ntima, na bhenaangota bhakalyanganga chakulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Mu meeli tukibha handa bhandu mia mbili na chabini na chita. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Kila jumo pabhakalyehe chakulya cha kolonikanga, kila mundu pabhakalyee na kujukuta bhakajeanga ngaano mu baali jijikibha mu meeli.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboomo ngolongwa chitendakukajula meeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Papakachee, bhoa bhangakombolanga kuchimanyanga chilambo chela, nambo bhakajibhonanga chehemu jimo jijibhi na nhanga, penapo bhakahamuanga kutibhia meeli konokwe mu mihanga handa ikakombolike. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Henela bhakahengelana nanga na kuileka mu bahali, na popopo bhakajijogolanga migoji hihikatabhikwa panchukani, ngapena bhakatabhanga tanga jimo nnongi ili kuhibhila mboongo jikombole kunokola meeli kujaula pa mbwani jela. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Nambo meeli jikanokolwa na machi jikajaula chehemu ja machi machoko na jikatibhila panhanga. Chehemu ja nnongi ja meeli jikatibhila panhanga pangali kupukunyika. Chehemu ja kuyeto jikajemeka kuhengeleka hipande hipande gunakamo kwa mapoto ga machili ga mawimbi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Manyemba bhapalita kwakomanga akatabhwa bhoha kwa kujogopa kubhee bhakaogelinge kuhika kumbwani na kutilanga. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Nambo kwa henela jwajola akolo bha chibhoga cha manyemba akapala kwaokoa Apaulo, akabhaibhilanga bhakotokutenda henela. Akakulumikia bhenibhala bhabhakombolanga kuogela bhaombange kubhoka mu meeli na kujogela mpaka kumbwani, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />na bhangi bhakagulange bhabhi bhachikamulile mu mbaao au mu hipande ya meeli jijitekuengeleka. Henela nga twenga twabhoa patukahika maha kumbwani.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Hikubho hibhatendite Apaulo paching'ina cha ku Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Patukahikanga maha mu chining'ina, tukaimanya yakubhee chenichela chining'ina chela chikemiikemwa Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Bhandu bha chenichela chining'ina bhakibhanga na upalio muno kwachitu. Hula jikajemaka kukoma na kukibha na malili, henela bhakakungananga moto ligongo ili tujotange. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Apaulo akalokotana ndeketu akakolokea pa chiinja. Penapo, ligongo lya lyenilela lyooto lya moto, lijoka lya uchoongo muno likabhoka mu ndeketu likaailigila Apaulo mu lubhoko na kwaluma. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Bhandu bha chenichela chining'ina pabhakachibhona chenichela chijoka atekuchihigilila pa lubhoko lwa Apaulo na kwaluma bhakalobholelana akaachinabhene, “Komboleka mundu hojojo atekoma mundu, na chibhile atekuokoka kutibhila mu bahali, nambo minnoongo jitu ngakombola kwaleka kubhee jwamomi!” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Nambo Apaulo akachikung'undila chenichela chijoka pammoto na jwangahulala hata kachoko. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhakibhanga bhatendakulola kubhee akatupite au akaagwile pahi na kuwee chindema. Nambo pabhakalendelanga muno pangali kulola choachela chichaapatite Apaulo, bhakatindigana maganikio gabhenji nnani jakwe, bhakalobholanga kubhee, “Jonjoni nga jumo jwa minnoongo!”<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Kubhandila na penipala pakibha migonda ja mundu jwakemitwa Apubulio, nga jwakibha akola bha chenichela chining'ina jonijwe akatupokela maha kwachabhe na tukibha akaageni bhabhe kwa machobha gatatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Nambo mu machobha genago atati bhabhe Apubulio akibha atamwa na kugulumana miyai, Apaulo akajaula kwaalola na akaajopela, akaabhekela mabhoko gabhe pammele gwabhe, akannamia. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Pagakabhokela genago, akaatamwa bhoha mu chenichela chilumba bhakaikanga na bhakalamanga. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Bhandu bha chining'ina chela bhakatupekeanga ngwaupa hijingi na patukajemeka kabhele ulendo gwitu, bhakalekelanga nkati ja meeli hilebhe yoa hitukapalikwa kupetula mu ulendo.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulendo gwa kubhoka ku Malita kujaula ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Pajikapeta mihei jitatu tukajemeka kabhele ulendo gwitu kwa meeli jumo ja Alekisandalia jijikemwa, “Minnoongo Mabhela” Jijikemwa Akasita na Apoluksi, meeli jenejo jikatama penipala pa Malita machobha goa ga malili. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Tukaika mu chilambo cha Silakusa, tukatama kwa penapo machobha gatatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kubhoka konokwe tukahika, tukatindila na kuika chilambo cha ku Legio. Palikapeta lichobha limo, mboongo jikajemeka kupoga kubhoka kuchini, na pagapeta machobha gabhele tukaika ku chilambo cha ku Potioli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Konokwe tukaakolelanga lilubhalo lya bhandu lilyahobhalela Ayesu bhangi na bhakutujopanga tutame nabho kwa lijuma limo. Henela nga chitukahika chilambo cha ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Akanung'una bha ku Loma bhabhakahobhalela Ayesu pabhakapatanga ngani hitu, bhakaikanga kutupokelanga mu chooko lya ku Apio na Mikahawa Jitatu. Apaulo pabhaakabhonanga akachukulu Annoongo, akipata ntima.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Patukaika ku Loma, Apaulo akalekelelwa kutama jika jabhe pamo na linyemba limo annolekee.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Pagakapeta machobha gatatu, Apaulo akakemanga pamo akanachilongola bha Bhayahudi. Pabhakahikanga Apaulo akajemaka kwalobholelanga, “Akaanung'una bhangu, nangatenda chikubho choachela chichitaukana na bhandu bhituau chichitaukana genigala gatugayobhalile kubhoka kwa akanahota nambo nakatabhwa kunikola ku Yelusalemu na kungamua kwa bha Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Pabhakangonyanga muno na kulola yakubhee nangalemwa choachela, bhakapalanga kunekanga. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Nambo Bhayahudi bhangi bhakakananga chikubho hecho, nanenga nakajopa ngani jipelekwe kwa amwenye akolo bha ku Loma, na ngapala kwatakianga bhandu bhangu kwa chikubho choachela. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ligongo helyo ndekujopa kongana na kulongela na mwangota, kwakubhee ndekutabhwa minyololo heje ligongo lya kwahobhalela jonojwe jwaalendelwa na Bhaisilaeli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Bhenaangota bhakanobholelanga, “Twenga twanga balua joajela kubhoka ku Yuda, wala jwaakwa nnung'una joajola jwaikite pambani na kongolela au kulongela choachela changali mmbone nnani jinu. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Nambo tuganikia kubhee hipalikwa tujoanikie kubhoka kwachinu mwabhene chenichela ching'anikia mmutwe gwinu. Kwakubhee chituchimanya twenga nnani ja chenecho chibhoga nga kubhee chitendakanikwa koha koha.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Bahi, bhakakondananga nabhena lichobha lya kongana, na bhajingi bhakaikanga konokwe kwaatamita Apaulo. Kubhokela kundabhi mpaka kimuho Apaulo akaalobholelanga na kwaatambulilanga ngani ja umwenye gwa Annoongo, akaajinanga bhandu kubhee bhahobhalele Ayesu na kwakombokeanga Malagilo ga Amusa na majaandiko ga akaalondohi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Bhandu bhangi pakati jabhenji bhakakondanga malobhe gabhe, nambo bhangi bhangaobhalelanga. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Henela bhangakondananga bheneengota kwa bhenaangota, na kujemeka kubhoka Apaulo akaalobholelanga malobhe gangani, “Mboomo ja Annoongo akaalobholelanga akanahota bhinu kwa ndela ja alondoi Aisaya, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />penipala pabhakalobhola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Nyaule kwa bhandu habha nkabhalobholelange.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">Kujoanikia mpakujoanga, nambo ngaelewanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kulola mpakulolanga nambo ngalolanga.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Kwakubhee luunda lwa habha gatekupoganikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na bhatekuibha machikilo gabhenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">bhatekopelanga miho gabhenji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Handa ngabha henela, bhakalolite kwa miho gabhenji, bhakajowininge kwa machikilo gabhenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Bhakaeliwinge kwa luunda lwabhenji, na kundendebhukila nenga, na nenga nganamiinge.’”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Henela Apaulo akalobhola, “Mmanyange yakubhee ngani ja Annoongo jijikongolela nnani ja kuhokolewa bhandu jitekupelekwa kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. Bhenabho bhapakujoanikianga!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Apaulo pabhakajomola kulobhola genago Bhayahudi bhakabhokanga kongo bhabhikonyana machwali gajingi.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Apaulo akatama kwa yaaka hibhele mu nyuumba jibhaakapanga bhenabho bhene, kongo abhikwapokelanga bhoa bhabhakahikanga kwalola. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Na jono atendita kwaatangachianga bhandu Umwenye gwa Annoongo na kujigana ngani ja Hangwana Ayesu Kilisito panga bhooga na panga kwaibhila.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>